2026-08-28 00:02:30 | INFO     | p2p_knowledge_hub.chunking.recursive_chunker:chunk:54 | Following chunks were produced. [DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('3095f021-6002-4802-a302-af87c5b2b7d6'), chunk_index=1, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325062, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n   \n \n  \nPage 1\n \n \n \nPTP_AP_Non-PO Invoice Processing SOP_V1.0  \n \nVersion No. 1 \n \n \n \n  \n \n \nPrepared By/ \nLast Updated By \nReviewed By \nApproved By \nName \nSyed Ali Akbar \n \n \nRole \nTeam Lead \n \n \nDate \n03/01/2025', page_no=1, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('9c027c2c-7dda-479a-b9d9-5fb65b4d492b'), chunk_index=2, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325119, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy\nPage 2\nTable of Contents\n1\nPurpose of the activity .............................................................................................. 3\n2\nAudience .................................................................................................................. 3\n3\nScope ....................................................................................................................... 3\n4\nProcess Dependencies: ............................................................................................ 5\n5\nSystems, Applications and Tools Used .................................................................... 6\n6\nProcess Map............................................................................................................. 7\n7\nSIPOC ...................................................................................................................... 7\n8\nStandard Operating Procedures ............................................................................... 8\n10. Glossary .................................................................................................................. 48\n11. Abbreviations .......................................................................................................... 48\n12. Escalation matrix ..................................................................................................... 48\n13. Check list ................................................................................................................. 49', page_no=2, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('16cdd9c1-95eb-4751-b364-281982740eb0'), chunk_index=3, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325126, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='14.  Document Log/Change Log ................................................................................... 49', page_no=2, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('8e01e318-a958-4468-bc60-ab8df29d83bf'), chunk_index=4, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325200, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy\nPage 3\n1 PURPOSE OF THE ACTIVITY\nThe purpose of this activity is to ensure timely and accurate vendor payments by\nprocessing incoming invoices through Basware and Oracle Fusion, with manual\ninterventions by the Accounts Payable (AP) team when necessary\nExpected output and/or deliverables\nInvoice Submission Vendors send invoices via email to the designated accounts payable\nin the inbox.', page_no=3, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b497fb3a-7fff-47a9-9013-7de9f83adea0'), chunk_index=5, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325205, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Basware Capture & Indexing Invoices are routed into Basware, where initial data capture\nand indexing occurs.\nException Handling If Basware identifies discrepancies or incomplete data, the AP team\nintervenes to correct and manually index the invoices.\nSystem Interface Once corrected, the invoices are passed to Oracle Fusion through\nsystem integration.\nPayment Initiation Oracle Fusion initiates the payment process, ensuring vendors are paid\non time.\n1.1.1 Invoice processing\nPerformed by\nCognizant', page_no=3, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e739bad2-a55e-4ea0-ae49-8087dab0aff8'), chunk_index=6, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325209, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Approved by\nSFL\nStep included\nin the SOP?\nProcess invoices (e.g., data validation,\nPerform PO Match, post invoice / credit to\nERP, block / document exception, return to\nCognizant etc.,), including electronic images.\nX\nYes\nPost invoices\nX\nYes\n2 AUDIENCE\nThis Standard Operating Procedure (SOP) is designed to provide clear and detailed\ninstructions for all individuals involved in the specified processes. The primary audience', page_no=3, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('f3587efa-ff6a-4447-a9e0-f67ebe41906a'), chunk_index=7, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325283, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy\nPage 4\nincludes employees who directly execute the tasks, supervisors and managers who\noversee operations. Additionally, internal and external auditors and regulatory bodies may\nreference this SOP to verify adherence of the implemented process. By outlining these\nprocedures, the SOP aims consistency, accuracy, and compliance across all levels of the\norganization.\n•\nDirect Users:\n•\nGBS active processors: GBS processors who perform the tasks outlined in section 8.', page_no=4, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('8e0c018b-5e6e-4cc7-b696-e0e456b201c1'), chunk_index=8, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325289, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Standard Operating Procedure, to rely on these procedures to ensure consistency and\naccuracy in their work.\n•\nGBS new hires During training phase, associates can find the document as a supporting\ndocument for better understanding of the process.\n•\nIndirect Users:\n.1 Auditors and Inspectors: Auditors may examine SOPs to verify compliance with the\nimplemented processes.\n.2 Finance staff in Safelite and Belron: Management could evaluate the design of the', page_no=4, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ed2d5617-ce42-4e6a-86bd-e7aa3d023f02'), chunk_index=9, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325293, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='process as supported in this document. Further, the change management process\nwould be based and updated in this SOP.', page_no=4, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('1b2de8fb-ab7a-46a2-96a4-420dda5136fc'), chunk_index=10, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325345, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Controlled Copy\nPage 5\n3 SCOPE\nThis SOP defines the end-to-end process for managing invoice transfers from Basware to\nOracle Fusion within Safelite's financial ecosystem. The goal is to ensure: Timely\npayments, Accurate data capture, Compliance with accounting standards and Efficient\nprocessing of invoices in the Transfer queue\nCompany/Entity code\nSystem\nImpacted\n2000 – Safelite US\n2010 – Safelite US\nOracle Fusion\nPosting of the non-po invoices against company", page_no=5, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('68c7ffe6-64e0-4194-bc16-4f6d6447639b'), chunk_index=11, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325350, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='code 2000 & 2010\n4 PROCESS DEPENDENCIES:\nInvoice Queue Dependency – Vendor Code Validation\n•\nIssue: Invalid queue invoices due to mismatched or missing vendor codes.\n•\nAction Required:\no\nIdentify the correct vendor code in both EBS and Fusion systems.\no\nCross-reference with the invoice received in Basware to ensure alignment.\n•\nGoal: Ensure accurate vendor mapping to avoid processing delays or errors.', page_no=5, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('beb2bce3-7b19-4697-9931-2c733b2de9a1'), chunk_index=12, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325357, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 6  \n \n \n \n5 SYSTEMS, APPLICATIONS AND TOOLS USED \nSystem/Appl\nication/Tool \nFunctionality \nAccess Link \n \nBasware \n \nBasware \nworkflow for \nreceiving and \nprocessing \ninvoices \nhttps://belronna.p2p.basware.com/ \n \n \nFusion \n \n \nEnd-to-End \nPayment & \nAccounting \nFlow \nhttps://fa-etup-saasfaprod1.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com/ \nWire \nTo identify the \napprover \ninformation \nhttps://onfirstup.com/safelite/safelite/', page_no=6, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('8c70cdb4-23bc-43dc-8669-912458caf4fa'), chunk_index=13, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325363, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 7  \n \n \n6 PROCESS MAP \n \n \n7 SIPOC \nSupplier \nInput \nProcess \nOutput \nCustomer \nVendor \nInvoice \nProcessing \ninvoices in \nBasware \nInvoice ready for payment in fusion \nVendor', page_no=7, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('caae36a5-4f00-4afc-bced-64cdaaf51b64'), chunk_index=14, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325435, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy\nPage 8\n8 STANDARD OPERATING PROCEDURES\n1. Introduction to Basware\n1. Basware as a capability of AI/ML (Machine Learning).  It auto captures the\nmandatory field with the help of the Machine learning program.\n2. It also helps to eliminate the Backlog/Increase the Visibility.\n3. Over a period, it rectifies the mistakes and auto captures data by itself.\n4. Basware helps us to automate the process.', page_no=8, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('f033fc29-2ca4-4047-92e8-99065d838593'), chunk_index=15, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325441, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='5. Basware helps to achieve a new level of efficiency and reduce errors.\n6. Basware will replace the Kofax/Mark view.\n1.1 Invoice Lifecycle in Basware\n1. Invoice Investigation & Data Capture: - A supplier sends the invoice\nto generic mailbox (invoice@safelite.com) via email in pdf format.\nOnce the invoice is received in Basware, it runs the automated rules\nand priorities to capture data and create the electronic invoice.', page_no=8, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('7dcbe2ed-0c09-448a-a1e1-1e33c1fbce2e'), chunk_index=16, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325445, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='2. Invoice processing: - Once invoice received in Basware, it will auto-\ncapture the data, if all details are correct then it matches with PO and\nreceipt / if any mandatory fields are not captured AP team will update\nthe details manually.  If it is a non-po invoice AP team will review and\nsend the invoices to respective approvers.', page_no=8, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e0f2ec7c-d3c7-46ef-8aef-9fef8d2f3006'), chunk_index=17, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325450, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='3. Payment & Post Payment: - Invoices will move through an approval\nprocess, once invoices are approved by the respective approvers, the\ninvoices will move to transfer queue to get interfaced with oracle.\nFinally, it moves through the payment life cycle.\n4. Basware is a workflow tool, if any intervention required from business\nor supplier that will be modified in Basware, once invoices cleared in', page_no=8, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e61976b1-8373-443d-97ff-53800225e8e0'), chunk_index=18, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325454, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Basware payment & accounting will happen in fusion.', page_no=8, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6d46352c-f47a-42ec-9b9c-4a0b55b6b297'), chunk_index=19, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325486, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy\nPage 9\n1.2 Basware Login\nFollow the below steps to login to Basware.\nSign into okta dashboard at idp.mysafelite.net with your credentials.\nCompany Confidential\nCompany Confidential\n1\nInvoice reception\nInvoice\nscanning\nData Capture\n(Paper & PDF)\nAccounting\nElectronic\ninvoice\nPO Matching\n(inc. EDI)\nNon-PO\nprocessing\nBASWARE\nORACLE\nFUSION\nBASWARE\nArchiving\nBASWARE\nBASWARE\n1. INVOICE INGESTION & DATA CAPTURE\n2. INVOICE PROCESSING\nException\nHandling\nCheck\nRequesting\nPayment\nORACLE\nFUSION', page_no=9, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('f516d7f1-d2ca-478a-91e8-642bcda9207c'), chunk_index=20, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325492, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='LOCAL\nSOLUTION\n3. PAYMENT AND POST PAYMENT\nInvoice Lifecycle', page_no=9, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a0622e7e-6ce5-43ce-8043-ce4d546f0a85'), chunk_index=21, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325498, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 10  \n \n \n       1.3    Basware Login \n \nClick on “Basware Tile”', page_no=10, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('47282938-5181-4545-b275-bce115249106'), chunk_index=22, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325504, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 11  \n \n \n1.5 Basware Login \n \nClick on “Basware P2P”; Basware homepage will appear.', page_no=11, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('cf880d3b-2a77-4438-9ce7-73936bd9ba39'), chunk_index=23, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325538, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy\nPage 12\n2. Basware homepage overview\n2.1 Basware homepage tabs\n1. Home: - Home tab, which will bring you to the Basware home page.\n2. Tasks: -The Tasks tab serves similar functions as the notification or bell      icon\nin Oracle fusion, all your assigned tasks (invoice approvals) will appear in this tab.\n3. Documents: -The documents tab allows users to search for processed invoices.', page_no=12, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('36ece83c-e983-4a7f-a7c8-daa8fa150267'), chunk_index=24, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325542, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='AP team will use Accounts Payable, but an inquiry-only user can search the\ndocuments by using this tab.\n4. Invoicing: -The invoicing tab used to Create the check requests and debit\nmemos.\n5. Accounts payable: -The Accounts payable tab holds the AP functions, including\nthe various queues. This tab intended for Accounts payable team to perform their\nAP related activities.', page_no=12, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('cb710bf9-caaf-44d3-a737-02babe8e779c'), chunk_index=25, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325573, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy\nPage 13\n3 Accounts Payable layout in Basware\n1. Invoice Queues: - Once the vendor sends the Invoices to generic email box will\nappear in one of these four queues.\n2. Search And Adjust View: - Search tab option is used to find specific invoices.\nExample, search invoices by status or Date range.  Use advanced search option to', page_no=13, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('7f3827d9-e2a2-41b9-95ff-3e1ca48b7921'), chunk_index=26, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325578, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='shorten the search list. We can also adjust the view to how we can see the invoice\ninformation and coding information in the view pane.\n3. View And Action Pane: - This will display the View set-up which you have\nselected. We can view Full coding and Half coding layout using this option.', page_no=13, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('797e2135-2d45-4bc0-9778-9122b19c1ec6'), chunk_index=27, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325584, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 14  \n \n \n4. Accounts Payable Overview \n \nThe Accounts payable tab holds activities of AP functions, including the \nvarious queues. This tab is intended for Accounts payable team to perform \ntheir AP related activities. \n \nIn Accounts payable tab we have four queues. \n1. Received queue. \n2. Matching queue \n3. Workflow queue \n4. Transfer queue', page_no=14, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c2afcc29-fe2d-41f8-8006-c687a5918068'), chunk_index=28, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325619, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy\nPage 15\n5.1 Workflow Queue\nAll the non-PO invoices will appear here, especially invoices that require\napproval, are disputed, or are on hold.\nIn Workflow queue we have five sub queues.\n1. Pending Task queue – Invoices are pending with approver.\n2. Rejected queue – Invoices rejected by approver will sit in this queue.\n3. Recipient Missing queue – Invoice doesn’t have appropriate approver\nand non-po invoices.', page_no=15, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a9589e2d-1ed0-4952-8401-df111a8f2432'), chunk_index=29, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325623, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='4. Disputed queue – All the invoices disputed will appear in this queue.\n5. On hold queue – All Hold invoices placed on hold by approver will\nappear in this queue.', page_no=15, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2c3228a5-c1e3-4b60-a042-4d16b0a82b4c'), chunk_index=30, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325649, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy\nPage 16\n5.2 Pending task queue\nIn this queue the invoices which are pending for manager’s coding and\napproval those invoices will stay in this queue. Once the invoice is coded\nand approved by manager, then the invoice will move to transfer queue.\nInvoices would wait for 10days, if no action taken by the approver,\nautomatically it will be escalated and moved to their supervisor.', page_no=16, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a56399d8-94ef-40a9-aeb5-39a1b63df308'), chunk_index=31, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325654, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='We will work on this queue to move old items to the appropriate approver.', page_no=16, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b4bb7c87-5081-453b-aa50-1745cd26e923'), chunk_index=32, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325662, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 17  \n \n \n5.3 Rejected Queue \n \nIf approver rejects the invoice in such cases the invoices will fall under \nthis Queue. \n \nClick on Rejected tab. \n \n \n \n \n5.3.1 Follow the below steps to process “Rejected Queue” invoices \n \n1. Click on the “Rejected” queue.  \n2. Select the invoice from the left side of the queue', page_no=17, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('10c384ee-9a40-4007-a659-9804dd94cd7d'), chunk_index=33, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325691, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy\nPage 18\n5.3.2 Rejected Queue\n1. Based on selected invoice, invoice will be opened, check all\nthe mandatory details (Ex: Supplier name & supplier site,\ninvoice number & invoice date, invoice gross/net amount,\npayment term, PO number etc.) as per the invoice copy.\n2. Click on “history” tab check the entire history of the\ninvoice.\n3. We can view the reason why invoice got rejected.', page_no=18, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('7cd07df5-3525-435c-a5b7-90a817d4e7c6'), chunk_index=34, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325695, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='4. We will take necessary action as per the rejected\ncomments.\nFor example: Routing the invoice to another store manager or requesting\nfor credit memo etc.…', page_no=18, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('8d59e997-d0bf-4ad8-82f2-f29cfc0ee801'), chunk_index=35, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325704, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 19  \n \n \n5.4 Recipient Missing Queue \n \nWhen we take appropriate action in “invalid queue” invoices will move to \nnext queue, if any invoice does not have PO, those invoices will move to \nrecipient missing queue. \n \n AP Team will send the invoice to respective approver (store/district \nmanager) for coding and approving the invoice after doing investigation \nwith the available information on the invoice.', page_no=19, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('27937d2a-b9f4-4339-bdde-ac5e449c519c'), chunk_index=36, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325710, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 20  \n \n \n5.4.1 Follow the below steps to process ‘Recipient Missing’ Queue \n \n1. Click on the “Recipient Missing”  \n2. Select the invoice from the queue.', page_no=20, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b486b15f-3c7e-45d4-a6a8-838782af2a34'), chunk_index=37, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325755, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy\nPage 21\n5.4.6 Recipient missing queue – Non-PO Invoice (Routing rules)\nOnce the invoice is opened from recipient missing queue update the mandatory\nfields and route the invoice to the store manager/district Manager for coding\nand approval.\nFollow the below steps to route the invoice.\n1. As per ship to address search the location manager in location sheet and\nroute for coding and approval.', page_no=21, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ad6a9179-439f-4c89-90d6-eecac71c3424'), chunk_index=38, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325759, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='2. If ship to address is not available on invoice copy, route the invoice as per\nthe bill to address.\n3.if ship to address and bill to address are corporate address (Columbus) than\nroute as per vendor nearest location address. (this is not correct) (We will look\nat history or type of service to locate the correct Corporate contact to approve\nor use the special routing sheet for other scenarios)', page_no=21, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('03059cf0-c610-4c43-af7a-be5a7da325b4'), chunk_index=39, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325763, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='4. Verify routing with Oracle EBS, if needed.\nNote: - On the invoice copy if we have attention name route the invoice to\nrespective person.', page_no=21, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6b2a26b6-43c8-4446-b35b-8032db3befed'), chunk_index=40, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325769, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 22  \n \n \n      5.4.7   Recipient missing queue -Routing \n \nIf there is any attention name (like store manager name or any other approver \nname) route the invoice as per the attention name. \nEx: - Megan Zeller', page_no=22, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('1c1efdc1-3d1a-48ed-ab26-766852569d50'), chunk_index=41, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325775, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 23  \n \n \n      5.4.8 Recipient missing queue -Routing \n \nif ship to address and bill to address are corporate address (Columbus, OH) than \nroute as per vendor address  \nEx: - 52722 type the zip code in ship to code (watch for invoices being routed to \nMonica Mitchell)', page_no=23, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('dbfcee6f-1908-4d16-a9c7-e567b94a04d1'), chunk_index=42, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325783, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 24  \n \n \n      5.4.9 Recipient missing queue -Routing \n \nEnter the approver details as per the location sheet.  * You can also search by address in \nWorkday to get associates for that location. \n \nLocation: Y drive and Wire path to get the location sheet. \n \nY:\\Groups\\Depts\\Finance\\AccountsPayable\\General\\Location-Conversion Info. \n \nWire path: https://onfirstup.com/safelite/safelite/', page_no=24, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('971356c5-3298-4d12-9a49-ba811b84b861'), chunk_index=43, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325791, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 25  \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n5.4.2 Recipient Missing Queue \n \n1. Select the invoice and cross verify all the mandatory details (Ex: Supplier \nname & supplier site, invoice number & invoice date, invoice amount, \npayment term, PO number etc.) if any details are incorrect update the correct \ndetails as per the invoice copy. \n2. Click on “Forward” button to route the invoice to the correct approver.', page_no=25, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c5c1c449-719a-4795-83a7-ab171b25dfae'), chunk_index=44, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325798, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 26  \n \n \n \n5.4.5 Recipient Missing Queue \n \n1. Enter the description or reason for forwarding the invoice to the \napprover. (For Ex: Please code and approve the invoice) (use our \nrouting comments “put in the path”) \n2. Click on “Forward” button to send the invoice for approval.', page_no=26, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('f751668a-80db-4e00-a147-add50eceec2a'), chunk_index=45, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325805, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 27  \n \n \n5.4.9 Recipient Missing Queue -Routing \n \nOnce we route the invoice, you can view the invoice under the workflow tab, it \nwill show the approvers name with whom invoice is pending for approval.', page_no=27, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('52cec3ff-fb0d-4b74-be12-d9fb47f22dfe'), chunk_index=46, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325811, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 28  \n \n \n5.5 Recipient Missing Queue \n \nNote: If any PO invoice received in receipt missing queue, update the PO number in \nheader data and click on down arrow then click on ‘cancel and resend’. Invoice will \nmove to Matching queue.', page_no=28, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0e6e16ae-5da7-4bbc-a47f-946644d2c916'), chunk_index=47, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325816, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 29  \n \n \n5.6 Dispute the invoice \n \nIf we received Credit memo and original invoice is not available, we will dispute the \ninvoice with vendor', page_no=29, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('51c67a8a-800c-46fd-90cf-bee87970b4b2'), chunk_index=48, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325859, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy\nPage 30\n5.6.0 Dispute the invoice\nIf we received Credit memo and original invoice is not available in Basware\nand EBS (Prior to Sep 2024). We will dispute the invoice (Be sure to also\ncheck by supplier name or number & dollar amount for the original).\nBefore disputing the invoice, we must search for the original invoice for the', page_no=30, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('619fdc73-f9f2-4883-a0c4-a2e6f71ced72'), chunk_index=49, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325863, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='credit memo and follow these steps below to search for the original invoice.\n1. Click on Advance search\n2. Click on Creation date: select last 12 months period\n3. Invoice number: enter the Invoice number\n4. Show all statuses: click the box\n5. if we want more features, we can also use the Add criteria tab.\nwe can search as per invoice amount/invoice type etc.\n6.Click on search', page_no=30, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('1f7bb077-87fe-408a-9b05-757a57c2b378'), chunk_index=50, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325869, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Note: If we are unable to find the original invoice in EBS and Basware we will\nsend an email to the vendor for original invoice copy against the credit\nmemo.', page_no=30, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('507a9b0e-402e-4022-aebd-2c6c8e6926d8'), chunk_index=51, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325874, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 31  \n \n \n5.6.2 Follow the below steps to dispute the invoice  \n \nClick on drop down. \nClick on “Dispute” option', page_no=31, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2c54bfba-53ef-42a0-bcd1-8d4d5c835af2'), chunk_index=52, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325882, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 32  \n \n \n5.6.3 Disputing the invoice  \n \nOnce we click on Dispute option below screen will appear \nFill the email id (Dispute@safelite.com or vendor email id) and update the reason \nwhy we are disputing this invoice. \n \nClick on “Dispute” (After these steps invoice will move to Disputed Queue)', page_no=32, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('3bf994ef-5916-4022-aeb5-107afedb99f4'), chunk_index=53, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325888, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 33  \n \n \n5.6.4 Disputed Queue  \n \nIf we are disputing any invoice those invoices will appear in Disputed queue.', page_no=33, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d932a028-6f83-448a-b874-3fd626634487'), chunk_index=54, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325910, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy\nPage 34\n5.6.5 Disputed Queue\nWhen the user works in a disputed queue, the AP team will cross-check\nwhether original invoices are available in EBS & Basware. Once we click on the\ndisputed queue, invoices will appear, Search for the original invoice, if we have\nthe original invoice click on the drop down and click on resolve dispute (If', page_no=34, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('cc783727-8adf-4211-9cf9-87b562481663'), chunk_index=55, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325915, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='required, attach the supporting document in attachment tab as a supporting\ndocuments).', page_no=34, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('672ef6f1-a852-410d-a745-e28b0c02e243'), chunk_index=56, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325921, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 35  \n \n \n5.6.6 Disputed Queue  \n \nIf original invoice is posted or available, we will click down arrow button select \nresolve dispute and the below pop-up will appear. \n \nUpdate the Comments and click on Resolve Dispute.', page_no=35, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b8e1d1c3-ac22-40d5-bc9e-155e2b5e3466'), chunk_index=57, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325927, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 36  \n \n \n5.6.7 Disputed Queue  \n \nOnce we completed Resolve Dispute, Credit memo will appear again in \nrecipient missing queue, then we will forward the Credit memo to approver, \nfor coding & approval. \nOnce the Credit memo is approved it will move to Transfer in Progress \nqueue for payment in Fusion.', page_no=36, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b4a8bbf6-2487-4c73-ba75-c2a89fed47fe'), chunk_index=58, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325933, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 37  \n \n \n5.7 On hold Queue  \n \nAll the invoices which are placed by Approver on hold, those invoices will \nappear in this queue.', page_no=37, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('8978d35f-b0cb-4c52-8ad9-ab3c86ac42eb'), chunk_index=59, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325957, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy\nPage 38\n6 Credit memo process in Basware\nIf we receive any credit memo in Basware: check if original invoice has been received,\nif not processed, Process the Original invoice and credit memo both under POD-3 if\nPO is not available, and send to the store manager for approval.\n1 Update the header data\n2 update the description as pod3 (using full POD description details)', page_no=38, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('00ca7912-7047-4623-b6a0-4a4f1ca1f428'), chunk_index=60, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325961, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='3 Update payment term code as Immediate\n4 Update the amount in negative value.', page_no=38, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6b101408-44c1-4226-a2a7-3cdc4e7bf231'), chunk_index=61, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325986, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy\nPage 39\n6.1 Credit memo process in Basware\nOnce header data updated click on add first coding row and code the invoice\nline by using chart of accounts file.\n1. Account code (515000 fusion combination number)\n2. Cost center (5042 as per cost center)\n3. company code (2010 always)\n4 Analysis code/service line code/ product category code/inter company code\nthese fields are default.', page_no=39, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('edd3c399-5235-46cb-809d-29bbfde9088e'), chunk_index=62, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325990, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='5 Update the line description as pod3 and item name (Ex; glass/window) Add\nexample of POD coding description', page_no=39, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d5a689b0-faae-44ff-8cda-090963fdf92b'), chunk_index=63, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 325996, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 40  \n \n \n      6.2 Credit memo process in Basware \n \nClick on save button after credit memo has been coded \n \n  \n \n \n      6.3 Credit memo process in Basware \n \nClick on forward button. \nThen forward the credit memo to the store manager for coding and approval.', page_no=40, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('507b0f29-3e59-45b8-8a14-45ac134526aa'), chunk_index=64, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 326022, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy\nPage 41\n6.4 Credit memo process in Basware (Original invoice Matched in EBS)\nIf Credit memo is received in Basware and the original invoice has been\nmatched in EBS to the PO.\nthen follow the below steps to process the Credit memo.\nEx:\n1042957 original invoice (Processed in EBS)\nCM1042957 credit memo (Processed in Basware)\n6.5 Credit memo process in Basware (if original invoice processed in EBS)', page_no=41, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a2bf4beb-dfe8-47f2-9733-799a11d930a2'), chunk_index=65, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 326026, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Open the invoice in EBS.\nIf it is matched, Go to the all-distributions tab in EBS', page_no=41, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('cf66246f-2774-438e-af55-ab1c3157b18d'), chunk_index=66, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 326049, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy\nPage 42\n6.5 Credit memo process in Basware (if original invoice processed in EBS)\nAs per the G/L account, convert the account number in Chart of account file.\n6.6  Credit memo process in Basware (if original invoice processed in EBS)\nUse this spreadsheet to get the new chart of accounts, In this\nspreadsheet we have two sections on the left side update the old coding', page_no=42, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('16aa6c80-4443-4356-8e07-5287f890f788'), chunk_index=67, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 326053, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='details to auto populate the new chart of accounts on right side.\nEx: -200-6163-3480', page_no=42, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('94b51775-903e-4a17-b582-2eca7f58d16c'), chunk_index=68, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 326060, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 43  \n \n \n \n      6.7 Credit memo process in Basware (if original invoice processed in EBS) \n \n  1. Update the coding details as per the chart of accounts \n  2.Once coding completed forward the credit memo to the store manager as per         \nPO location code for approval.', page_no=43, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('9cf21285-acbe-40f1-9aba-90afa068db69'), chunk_index=69, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 326066, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 44  \n \n \n      6.8 Credit memo process in Basware (if original invoice processed in EBS) \n \n After credit memo routed for approval. \n Click on Workflow tab to check the credit memo status with whom it is pending.', page_no=44, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('5387d6fa-e69e-429c-a20c-041b152b26ab'), chunk_index=70, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 326094, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy\nPage 45\n7 Credit memo – Original Invoice Match with PO\nIf Original invoice matched with PO in Basware, we must match the Credit memo\nwith PO. Following is the mandatory details we need to change in header data.\n1 Check all the mandatory details.\n2 Invoice type should be ‘as Credit memo’\n3 Credit memo number should end with ‘CM’ or as per the credit memo copy.', page_no=45, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('90facd85-fe6c-4d6a-8a18-d0bc4feb27a8'), chunk_index=71, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 326098, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='4 Terms should be ‘Immediate’\n5 Amount should be in ‘negative value’.', page_no=45, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('26a8fdfd-d6b4-41d1-bde3-1f8482c87ea7'), chunk_index=72, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 326105, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 46  \n \n \n      7.1 Credit memo process in Basware \n \nIf everything is correct as per ‘Credit memo’, Update the negative amount at PO \nlevel and invoice header line level. \n \n  \n \n \n \n      7.2 Credit memo process in Basware \n \nUpdate quantity as per the credit memo copy and update the amount in \nnegative. \nThen click on “Match “button', page_no=46, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ff2e54bf-6563-45b5-a50a-673d3db27557'), chunk_index=73, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 326111, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 47  \n \n \n      7.3 Credit memo process in Basware \n \n After “Match button” is clicked, automatically coding info will appear as below.  \n \n  \n \n \n      7.4 Credit memo process in Basware \n \nThen click on confirm tab.', page_no=47, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('93941d49-64a1-4979-ac9f-4e4730799f5e'), chunk_index=74, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 326118, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 48  \n \n \n10. GLOSSARY \nTerm: \nDefinition: \nPO \nOfficial document issued by a buyer to a seller. \n \nReceiving \nAcknowledgement of goods/service received from the vendor. \n \n \nGBS \n \nGlobal Business Services   \nPOD \nPurchase Order Discrepancy \n11. ABBREVIATIONS \nTerm/Abbreviation/Role \nDescription \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n12. ESCALATION MATRIX', page_no=48, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('3cdda4a7-a4b9-40c4-90b3-fe7620247fc6'), chunk_index=75, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('a4a44452-ec83-48e2-9890-cc6a4aef8c2f'), document_group_id=UUID('ad632cc0-2d11-4730-9e88-5f6e2be977b0'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 30, 326128, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Controlled Copy \n \n \n \n \n \n \n   \n  \n  \n \nPage 49  \n \n \n13. KEY CONTROLS / CHECK LIST \nUpdates.xlsx\n \n14.  DOCUMENT LOG/CHANGE LOG \nDate: \nVersion \nNo: \nCreated/Modified \nby: \nApproved \nby: \nPage (s) \nmodified \nSummary \nof \nchange(s) \nType of \nchange \n(Add, \nmodified. \nDeleted) \n03/01/2025 \n1.0 \nSyed Ali Akbar \n \n \n \nBasware SOP', page_no=49, section=None, title=None)]
