2026-08-28 00:02:59 | INFO     | p2p_knowledge_hub.chunking.recursive_chunker:chunk:54 | Following chunks were produced. [DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('f2ec6392-daff-4a55-ad23-885869b8f27c'), chunk_index=1, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('1515baf9-5995-4e8a-8585-81a2f6035458'), document_group_id=UUID('c9c5b0c8-bc37-4f3a-a779-8bcd7fc31e7a'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 59, 731713, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='1 | P a g e\nStandard Operating Procedure (SOP)\nTitle:\nAccounts – Payable\nVersion:\n1\nEffective Date:\n22 February 2024\nPrepared by:\nTamara Gray\n1. Purpose\nThe purpose of this SOP is to establish standardized procedures for processing invoices and payments\nat Tamborine Mountain Glades. It also outlines guidelines for verifying and recording expenses to\nensure accuracy, efficiency, and compliance with financial policies.\n2. Scope', page_no=1, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('40fd83cf-d202-4f71-bbfc-59955d4881f5'), chunk_index=2, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('1515baf9-5995-4e8a-8585-81a2f6035458'), document_group_id=UUID('c9c5b0c8-bc37-4f3a-a779-8bcd7fc31e7a'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 59, 731728, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='This SOP applies to all employees involved in the accounts payable process at Tamborine Mountain\nGlades, including the finance department, department heads, and any staff responsible for approving\nor processing payments.\n3. Responsibilities\n•\nAccounts Payable (AP) Staff: Responsible for processing invoices, verifying expenses, and\nrecording payments in the accounting system.\n•\nDepartment Heads: Approve invoices related to their department’s expenses and ensure that\nall necessary documentation is provided.\n•', page_no=1, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b9d8c0a6-f1f3-4837-85b9-b80fae1d0cd9'), chunk_index=3, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('1515baf9-5995-4e8a-8585-81a2f6035458'), document_group_id=UUID('c9c5b0c8-bc37-4f3a-a779-8bcd7fc31e7a'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 59, 731734, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Finance Manager: Oversees the accounts payable process, ensures compliance with\ncompany policies, and approves payments.\n4. Definitions\n•\nInvoice: A document issued by a vendor requesting payment for goods or services provided.\n•\nPurchase Order (PO): A document issued by the company authorizing the purchase of goods\nor services.\n•\nPayment Terms: The agreed-upon time frame within which a payment must be made to the\nvendor.\n•', page_no=1, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('7425be52-1efd-4fda-95ab-ced61a2733b4'), chunk_index=4, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('1515baf9-5995-4e8a-8585-81a2f6035458'), document_group_id=UUID('c9c5b0c8-bc37-4f3a-a779-8bcd7fc31e7a'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 59, 731739, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Expense Verification: The process of ensuring that all expenses are valid, accurate, and\nauthorized.\n5. Procedures\n5.1 Receiving and Logging Invoices\n•\nInvoice Receipt:\no\nInvoices may be received via mail, email, or through an electronic invoicing system.\no\nAll invoices should be directed to the accounts payable department immediately upon\nreceipt.\n•\nInvoice Logging:\no\nThe accounts payable staff logs each invoice into the accounting system, assigning a', page_no=1, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('5823adae-d7da-4d79-b2aa-e308ce86bdcd'), chunk_index=5, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('1515baf9-5995-4e8a-8585-81a2f6035458'), document_group_id=UUID('c9c5b0c8-bc37-4f3a-a779-8bcd7fc31e7a'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 59, 731743, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='unique reference number.', page_no=1, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e52f1ac8-d1c6-4419-abd6-995ec1ebcc56'), chunk_index=6, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('1515baf9-5995-4e8a-8585-81a2f6035458'), document_group_id=UUID('c9c5b0c8-bc37-4f3a-a779-8bcd7fc31e7a'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 59, 731844, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='2 | P a g e\no\nThe log should include the invoice date, vendor name, invoice amount, due date, and\nthe related purchase order number, if applicable.\no\nIf the invoice is not associated with a purchase order, note the department or project it\npertains to.\n5.2 Verifying Invoices and Expenses\n•\nPurchase Order Matching:\no\nMatch the invoice with the corresponding purchase order and delivery receipt to', page_no=2, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('208e9e89-fc12-478c-8372-c9509a7525f9'), chunk_index=7, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('1515baf9-5995-4e8a-8585-81a2f6035458'), document_group_id=UUID('c9c5b0c8-bc37-4f3a-a779-8bcd7fc31e7a'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 59, 731849, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='ensure that the goods or services were received as ordered.\no\nVerify that the quantities and prices on the invoice match those on the purchase order.\n•\nExpense Verification:\no\nConfirm that the invoice amount is accurate and within the agreed-upon payment\nterms.\no\nEnsure that all necessary approvals have been obtained from the relevant department\nhead before processing the invoice.\no', page_no=2, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('09113b29-9bb7-4dd1-b169-23625935a838'), chunk_index=8, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('1515baf9-5995-4e8a-8585-81a2f6035458'), document_group_id=UUID('c9c5b0c8-bc37-4f3a-a779-8bcd7fc31e7a'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 59, 731853, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='If the invoice includes any discrepancies or unauthorized charges, contact the vendor\nimmediately to resolve the issue before processing the payment.\n•\nApproval Process:\no\nOnce verified, the invoice must be approved by the department head or authorized\npersonnel.\no\nThe finance manager or designated approver should conduct a final review and\napprove the invoice for payment.\no\nAll approvals should be documented and retained for audit purposes.', page_no=2, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0e36dffd-49b6-4b65-aa7b-6cc30d63e7e3'), chunk_index=9, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('1515baf9-5995-4e8a-8585-81a2f6035458'), document_group_id=UUID('c9c5b0c8-bc37-4f3a-a779-8bcd7fc31e7a'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 59, 731857, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='5.3 Processing Payments\n•\nPayment Scheduling:\no\nPayments should be scheduled based on the invoice due date and the company’s cash\nflow management practices.\no\nPrioritize invoices with early payment discounts, if applicable, to take advantage of\ncost savings.\no\nGroup payments by due date and vendor to streamline the payment process.\n•\nPayment Methods:\no\nPayments can be made via electronic funds transfer (EFT), check, or credit card,', page_no=2, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('7d19cad2-3a61-4b3e-ae42-c456695c1ec8'), chunk_index=10, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('1515baf9-5995-4e8a-8585-81a2f6035458'), document_group_id=UUID('c9c5b0c8-bc37-4f3a-a779-8bcd7fc31e7a'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 59, 731861, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='depending on the vendor’s preference and the company’s payment policies.\no\nEnsure that all payment details are accurate, including the vendor’s bank account\ninformation, payment amount, and payment reference.\n•\nRecording Payments:\no\nOnce the payment is made, record the transaction in the accounting system, marking\nthe invoice as paid.\no\nInclude details such as the payment date, method of payment, payment reference', page_no=2, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('438246d6-b25a-441c-b9ec-bb7aa28341df'), chunk_index=11, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('1515baf9-5995-4e8a-8585-81a2f6035458'), document_group_id=UUID('c9c5b0c8-bc37-4f3a-a779-8bcd7fc31e7a'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 59, 731865, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='number, and the account from which the payment was made.\no\nReconcile the payment with the bank statement to ensure accuracy.\n•\nFiling and Documentation:', page_no=2, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('1ee2a291-10af-48fb-93cb-9f1698f2048a'), chunk_index=12, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('1515baf9-5995-4e8a-8585-81a2f6035458'), document_group_id=UUID('c9c5b0c8-bc37-4f3a-a779-8bcd7fc31e7a'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 59, 731939, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='3 | P a g e\no\nFile the paid invoice along with the payment confirmation and any related documents\nin the accounts payable records.\no\nMaintain both physical and electronic copies of all invoices and payment records for a\nminimum of seven years or as required by law.\n5.4 Month-End and Year-End Procedures\n•\nReconciliation:\no', page_no=3, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('7638b979-3341-4867-bd98-5a952db8a9f8'), chunk_index=13, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('1515baf9-5995-4e8a-8585-81a2f6035458'), document_group_id=UUID('c9c5b0c8-bc37-4f3a-a779-8bcd7fc31e7a'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 59, 731943, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='At the end of each month, reconcile all accounts payable records with the general\nledger to ensure accuracy.\no\nIdentify and investigate any discrepancies or outstanding payments.\n•\nReporting:\no\nPrepare and submit a monthly accounts payable report to the finance manager,\ndetailing total expenses, payments made, and any outstanding liabilities.\no\nInclude a summary of any early payment discounts or penalties incurred due to late\npayments.\n•\nYear-End Closing:', page_no=3, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('9ad709fb-f23b-4e4b-a5b7-397516d9873c'), chunk_index=14, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('1515baf9-5995-4e8a-8585-81a2f6035458'), document_group_id=UUID('c9c5b0c8-bc37-4f3a-a779-8bcd7fc31e7a'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 59, 731947, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='o\nAt the end of the fiscal year, ensure that all invoices for the year have been processed\nand recorded.\no\nPrepare year-end reports summarizing total expenses and accounts payable activities.\no\nAssist with the annual audit by providing all necessary documentation and records.\n6. Guidelines for Verifying and Recording Expenses\n•\nAccuracy: Ensure that all invoices are accurate, authorized, and supported by appropriate\ndocumentation before processing payment.\n•', page_no=3, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e090c31f-a31a-4385-a895-766de42d5046'), chunk_index=15, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('1515baf9-5995-4e8a-8585-81a2f6035458'), document_group_id=UUID('c9c5b0c8-bc37-4f3a-a779-8bcd7fc31e7a'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 59, 731951, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Compliance: Adhere to company policies, payment terms, and legal requirements when\nprocessing payments.\n•\nTimeliness: Process and pay invoices promptly to maintain good relationships with vendors\nand avoid late payment penalties.\n•\nDocumentation: Maintain detailed and organized records of all accounts payable\ntransactions to support financial reporting and audits.\n7. Review and Revision\nThis SOP should be reviewed annually or as necessary to ensure it remains relevant and effective. Any', page_no=3, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0bdf1f26-fe01-4e5b-9429-ce620d93779e'), chunk_index=16, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('1515baf9-5995-4e8a-8585-81a2f6035458'), document_group_id=UUID('c9c5b0c8-bc37-4f3a-a779-8bcd7fc31e7a'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 32, 59, 731955, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='revisions must be approved by the finance manager and communicated to all relevant staff.', page_no=3, section=None, title=None)]
