. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 170\n4\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nContent', page_no=4, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('1377762c-5d52-4081-88af-e555ef6c7ea1'), chunk_index=89, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 616956, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Guided Buying: Finding Items and Making\nPurchases\nThis guide is for guided buying users who need to purchase goods or services, or send an invoice on behalf of a\nsupplier.\nGuided buying is a powerful procurement capability that allows users to order goods and services easily, while\nkeeping purchasing activities compliant with an organization's procurement requirements.\nThis guide applies to:\n•\nSAP Ariba Buying\n•\nSAP Ariba Buying and Invoicing", page_no=5, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('10c39cb6-7a2e-48f9-b23b-5d1dc0bebcf8'), chunk_index=90, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 616960, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Related Guides\nGuided Buying Administration\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nPUBLIC\n5', page_no=5, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('50d57b1b-f2cb-4e79-8128-52623c413663'), chunk_index=91, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617073, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Overview of Your Dashboard\nSign in to guided buying to see your dashboard for purchasing goods and services.\n\ue04c\xa0Recommendation\nMake sure your browser resolution is more than 700 pixels high to ensure you can see all the content on the\ndashboard.\nYou can perform the following actions from your dashboard:\n•\nFinding an Item or Service [page 28]\n•\nBrowse the categories of goods and services [page 11]\n•', page_no=6, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('5330ea85-19e6-443b-a2d7-20a8c5ebd044'), chunk_index=92, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617077, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Purchasing an Item [page 40]\n•\nRequest a non-catalog item or service [page 53]\n•\nGet a quote [page 73]\n•\nFind out the status of your request [page 107]\n•\nView and run reports [page 166]\n•\nMake a repeat purchase [page 70]\n•\nBuy on behalf of others [page 92]\n•\nView and update your user profile [page 14]\n•', page_no=6, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('246dfa4a-5cab-41ad-bc64-93c3623a1bfd'), chunk_index=93, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617081, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Update your default language and currency: In the upper right corner of your dashboard, click your name and\nchoose Change default locale.\n•\nDelegate your approval authority [page 101]\n•\nActivate or deactivate your mobile device for use with the SAP Ariba mobile app: In the upper right corner of\nyour dashboard, click your name and choose either Activate mobile device or Deactivate mobile device.\n•', page_no=6, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('3687ecac-6572-426f-88ec-e1c1b2f0cd04'), chunk_index=94, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617085, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Update your email notification preferences: In the upper right corner of your dashboard, click your name and\nchoose Change email notification preferences to choose how you want to notified about different events.\nOn the Edit Email Notification Preferences page, choose a document type, such as Requisition, from the\ndropdown to specify the method and frequency of notification.\n•\nAcknowledge receipt of items or services [page 141]\n•', page_no=6, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('73996657-9545-4e91-a44f-43f3a6162e6c'), chunk_index=95, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617089, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Approve someone else's request, document, or task [page 99]\n•\nGet help [page 168]\nYou can use the following options to navigate between your dashboard and other pages:\nTo Do This...\nTake This Action...\nGo back to the previous page you were viewing\nClick the back arrow (\ue1eb\xa0) at the top of the page.\nReturn to the main dashboard\nClick your organization's logo at the top of the page.", page_no=6, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('f181acba-f52b-4204-a4c3-3ca168e5d27c'), chunk_index=96, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617092, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='View your notifications\nClick the notification bell icon (\ue23a\xa0) in the upper right corner,\nand then choose a notification to handle a request.\nView the items in your cart\nClick the cart icon (\ue043\xa0) in the upper right corner.\n6\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nOverview of Your Dashboard', page_no=6, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('8cb3d631-c6d1-40ad-8b44-298e07e2d7e7'), chunk_index=97, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617121, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="To Do This...\nTake This Action...\nSign out of the site\nClick your name in the upper right corner, and then choose\nSign out.\nJoule Icon\nYour administrator might make Joule available to you.\nJoule, SAP's generative AI copilot, allows you to ask questions about your purchases and receive immediate and\naccurate answers through generative AI. You can also ask it how to perform tasks.", page_no=7, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a2b70c5a-93b7-40ba-825d-8fa24e53094b'), chunk_index=98, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617125, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='To access the Joule panel, click the Joule icon (\ue2a3\xa0) at the top of the window.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nOverview of Your Dashboard\nPUBLIC\n7', page_no=7, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e38c4412-7d32-4346-ba25-d893fadf7616'), chunk_index=99, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617131, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='The following figure shows the Joule panel:\n8\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nOverview of Your Dashboard', page_no=8, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('9d0976a6-438a-4ac1-ad80-4958f91788b9'), chunk_index=100, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617185, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Joule has the following capabilities:\nUse Case\nDescription\nExample\nPurchase requisition status\nDisplays the status of a specified\npurchase requisition.\nShow me the status of PR123\nPurchase requisition approvers\nDisplays previous and active approvers\nfor a specified requisition.\nApprovers for PR123\nPurchase requisition shipping details\nDisplays the shipping details of a\nselected purchase requisition from a list.\nWhat is the shipping\naddress\nPurchase requisition details\nDisplay details, such as line-item', page_no=9, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('940775dd-ceec-4771-903a-390d593378db'), chunk_index=101, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617189, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='information of a specified purchase\nrequisition.\nShow me the details in\nPR123\nRecent purchases\nDisplays the list of purchase requisitions\ncreated recently.\nShow me the list of\nrequests that I created\nrecently\nYour favorites\nNavigate the user to the Your favorites\npage.\nTake me to my favorite\nitems\nNotification Bell Icon\nWhen a document requires your action or when changes are made to a document, guided buying sends you a', page_no=9, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('3c86b8ce-b24e-48d1-a9d9-a61de0598a09'), chunk_index=102, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617193, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="notification through the notification bell icon (\ue23a\xa0). Notifications are sent to approvers and watchers. After you've\nhandled a request, like approving an invoice, the notification is cleared from the list. Documents you're watching\nremain on the notifications list for three months.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nOverview of Your Dashboard\nPUBLIC\n9", page_no=9, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d2dc99f2-9f9d-4b67-b92a-d0072b43992d'), chunk_index=103, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617249, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Figure 1: List of Notifications from the Notification Bell\nThere are two types of notifications, summary and individual:\n•\nSummary notifications have a number at the end. The count is based on the number of notifications for that\ndocument type. When the count of the notification for one document type reaches five, it's listed as a summary", page_no=10, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('cf8191c1-6dd9-46f8-bbe7-a16831ecfac4'), chunk_index=104, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617254, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="notification. When you select a summary notification, you're taken to those documents in Your requests or\nYour approvals.\n•\nIndividual notifications list the type of document, followed by the document ID. When you select an individual\nnotification, you're taken to that document. The count of notifications decreases after you've handled a\nrequest.\nFigure 2: Summary Notification and Individual Notification\nSystem Errors", page_no=10, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('428b9831-5b4e-4a76-ad4b-1022631085a5'), chunk_index=105, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617257, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='If a system error or unexpected error occurs, guided buying displays a dialog box containing an error message and\nguidance, including user options. You can view the details of the issue and share it with your administrators.\nDepending on the action that failed, guided buying displays a dialog box that contains the following buttons:\n•', page_no=10, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4026a170-d4cd-41e7-a4a1-de3e9535a175'), chunk_index=106, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617261, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Refresh page: retrieves the current data and refreshes the page. This button is available when the information\ndisplayed is out of date.\n10\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nOverview of Your Dashboard', page_no=10, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('861f142b-1fc9-4091-bccb-d2b9c8af029d'), chunk_index=107, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617323, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='•\nShow details: displays more information about the error. Then, a Copy to clipboard button displays, which\nallows you to copy error information for use in other applications, such as a support-ticketing or messaging\nsystem.\n•\nClose or OK: closes the dialog box.\nYou might have to wait two minutes before trying the same operation again. In the meantime, you can perform\nother operations in guided buying.\nRelated Information', page_no=11, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('7c176084-df02-4080-880d-59ac35145ae5'), chunk_index=108, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617327, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Browsing the Categories on Your Dashboard [page 11]\nBrowsing the Categories on Your Dashboard\nIf you're not sure how to go about searching for a good or service, use the categories on your dashboard to help you\nlocate the right item.\nContext\nYour organization's purchasing department presents the most relevant purchasing categories that apply to your\nrole or location on your dashboard.\nProcedure\n1.", page_no=11, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('3e74ef77-8c70-498d-9cc2-d6675fbc75f1'), chunk_index=109, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617331, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="In the Popular section of your dashboard, choose one of the categories.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nDepending on which category you choose, you are guided to different types of pages.\n2. Based on the category you chose, you'll see one of the resulting options:\nOption\nDescription\nMore specific cate-\ngories\nContinue to choose categories until you find the items you're looking for.\nThe following icons help you to browse more effectively:\n•", page_no=11, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('40f7d005-baa9-45d5-9e77-576ad4792f45'), chunk_index=110, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617335, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Catalog item (\ue011\xa0): When you choose a category with this icon, you'll see a list of related items\nyou can buy.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nOverview of Your Dashboard\nPUBLIC\n11", page_no=11, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4fb9deae-7e62-4d7d-9647-dde546b5d438'), chunk_index=111, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617425, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Option\nDescription\n•\nWebsite (\n): When you choose a category with this icon, you are redirected to another\nwebsite.\nThe Non-catalog\nrequest page\nYour organization recommends submitting a non-catalog request [page 53] for this type of item.\nComplete the information on the Goods tab, and then add the item to your cart.\n\ue05c\xa0Note', page_no=12, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('495406e7-83a3-43c0-821a-258612a6a498'), chunk_index=112, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617429, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="If your organization uses service orders and service sheets, you'll also see a Services tab that\nyou can complete when necessary.\nA list of items that\nfall into that cate-\ngory\nAfter you find an item, choose an item to view more details, or Purchasing an Item [page 40].\nA form\nForms guide you through the purchase of a service or configurable item, or to request something\nfrom your organization.", page_no=12, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a445dfe6-6b21-4d0a-bc31-cf631cb83fbd'), chunk_index=113, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617433, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='The following are the different types of forms:\n•\nRequest form: Fill out this form to request quotes from suppliers [page 73] for a particular\ngood or service. For example, you might want to request quotes from several suppliers to\nprovide advertising services related to a particular project.\n•\nLine item form: Complete the form fields in addition to the standard non-catalog request', page_no=12, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0acf57fa-798b-48ad-97e9-c8eee985c604'), chunk_index=114, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617437, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="fields. After filling out all the required fields, you check out and submit the request for approval.\n\ue201\xa0Caution\nAfter you submit a request that includes information from a line-item form, if you need\nto edit the details, you'll need to delete the request and create it again with the correct\ndetails.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nThe default currency on a form is derived from the country/region associated with your", page_no=12, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('18d76daa-dac9-46c1-85de-75d8cfea3119'), chunk_index=115, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617440, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='ship-to address or plant. For example, if your ship-to country/region is the United States,\nyour currency default to USD.\n•\nCustom form: Complete this form to request something from your organization. For example,\nyou might have a Check Request form available for requesting a one-time payment for a\nsupplier.\nAnother purchasing\nsystem\nRequest goods or services of that type in the system to which you are redirected.', page_no=12, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d7a996a2-ef1b-4dca-9c2c-cc5f49dca43f'), chunk_index=116, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617444, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='A page with instruc-\ntions for completing\na purchase in that\ncategory\nYour organization has a purchasing process that is specific to the category you chose.\n12\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nOverview of Your Dashboard', page_no=12, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ed1be8f8-1763-415c-8954-96b639e45600'), chunk_index=117, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617474, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Managing Your User Profile\nYour user profile stores basic organizational information about you and determines what actions you can take.\nViewing Your User Profile [page 13]\nChanging Your User Profile [page 14]\nCreating a Personal Address [page 17]\nViewing Your User Profile\nYou can view your basic account profile information within guided buying.\nContext', page_no=13, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('1dd5a476-4551-49ce-ae55-145cceb7a07d'), chunk_index=118, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617478, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="View your basic account profile to ensure that you're in the correct business unit and that your email address and\nship-to address are correct.\nProcedure\n1.\nFrom the guided buying home page, select the user icon, and then choose\nApp settings\nView your\nprofile\n, as shown in the following figure.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nManaging Your User Profile\nPUBLIC\n13", page_no=13, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c3306022-3727-44c5-bae3-90ad7184754d'), chunk_index=119, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617527, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='2. Your profile displays the following information:\n•\nPersonal information: Name and email address.\n•\nOrganization information: Release authority, plant, company code, purchasing organizaiton, and\npurchasing group.\n•\nAccount information: Purchasing unit, GL account, and cost center.\n•\nShipping and delivery information: Plant (shipping) and deliver-to address.\n3. Review your profile information. If you need to make changes, see Changing Your User Profile [page 14].\nChanging Your User Profile', page_no=14, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2f81cbf4-c88d-4050-ab07-a39f4c59e4a0'), chunk_index=120, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617531, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="You can make changes to your user profile, like updating your contact information or delivery address.\nContext\nYour user profile stores basic organizational information about you and determines what actions you can take. The\nfields in your profile are configured by your organization. Changes to your profile are subject to approval by your\nsupervisor.\nYour organization's policies determine if you can make changes to your profile.", page_no=14, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2917a8f7-74e3-4227-bee5-4335d5fda20d'), chunk_index=121, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617535, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='When you make changes to your profile, you must choose from the options available. For example, if you want to\nchange the Purchasing Unit, open the dropdown menu (\ue1e2\xa0) and select Search more to find a different option, as\nshown in the following figure.\n14\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nManaging Your User Profile', page_no=14, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('64675274-520d-4c7e-a05b-a124d11050c6'), chunk_index=122, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617541, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Procedure\n1.\nFrom the guided buying home page, select the user icon, and then choose \nApp settings\nChange your\nprofile\n, as shown in the following figure.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nManaging Your User Profile\nPUBLIC\n15', page_no=15, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('798bbbdf-6141-4f58-bfac-181fc978fc92'), chunk_index=123, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617625, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='2. On the Personal Info page, you can make the following changes:\nField name\nOptions\nName\nEnter a name.\nBusiness Email Address\nEnter an email address.\nSupervisor\nUse the options available.\nGroups\n1.\nIn the Groups section, choose Select, which is the last\noption in the list.\n2.\nFrom the Choose Values for Groups window, do the\nfollowing:\n•\nSearch for a group: Enter the name of a group and', page_no=16, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('99f5d9b8-d80a-4f35-abf5-4d24389cf328'), chunk_index=124, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617629, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="choose Search.\n•\nAdd a group: Select the group's checkbox in the\nAdd to Currently Selected column.\n•\nRemove a group: Deselect the group's checkbox in\nthe Currently Selected column.\n3.\nChoose Done to save your changes.\nLimited Responsibilities\nIf available, choose the Add/Remove button to request\nchanges to your purchasing unit responsibilities. You must\nbe a member of the group to make purchasing unit changes.\nJob Profile", page_no=16, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d3d9c4d3-514b-40f2-a67b-bad111844735'), chunk_index=125, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617633, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Use the options available.\nTeam Requisition Members\n1.\nFrom the list of team requisition members, choose\nSelect, which is the last option in the list.\n2.\nFrom the Choose Values for Team Requisition\nMembers window, do the following:\n•\nSearch for a member: Enter the name and choose\nSearch.\n•\nAdd a member: Select the member's checkbox in\nthe Add to Currently Selected column.\n•", page_no=16, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c289704f-eab8-4ecb-90c4-97722099ad66'), chunk_index=126, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617637, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Remove a member: Deselect the member's check-\nbox in the Currently Selected column.\n3.\nChoose Done to save your changes.\nChoose Next or the next step to save your changes.\n3. On the Accounting/Shipping page, you can make the following changes:\nField name\nOptions\n1. Change your organization information\nUse the options available to make changes to the following\nfields:\nRelease Authority\nCompany Code\nPurch Org (purchasing organization)", page_no=16, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('cbe6b18d-afa8-4f96-89a4-ec33fd5fcb08'), chunk_index=127, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617640, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Purch Group (purchasing group)\n2. Change your accounting information\nUse the options available to make changes to the following\nfields:\nPurchasing Unit\nGL Account\nCost Center\n3. Change your shipping and delivery information\nTo add a plant address (shipping), do the following:\n16\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nManaging Your User Profile', page_no=16, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a0e140fa-0d13-4c99-948c-225d308a1918'), chunk_index=128, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617735, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Field name\nOptions\n1.\nIn the Plant section, open the dropdown menu (\ue1e2\xa0) and\nselect Search more.\n2.\nIn the Choose Value for Plant window, choose New.\n3.\nEnter details for the Create Custom Plant form.\n4.\nChoose Save to save your changes.\nTo add a delivery address, enter the address in the Deliver\nTo field.\nYou can also add a new plant address (shipping) when you', page_no=17, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c321d167-0b68-4635-9ac6-f2aa975ade32'), chunk_index=129, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617739, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='check out. For more information, see Creating a Personal\nAddress [page 17].\nChoose Next or the next step to save your changes.\n4. Justify Changes: Enter a justification for your profile change request. Optionally, choose Add Attachment to\nadd an attachment. Choose Next or the next step.\n5. Approval Flow: Review the approval flow and add approvers, if needed. Choose Next or the next step.', page_no=17, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('185fe9d4-f76f-4944-9a42-8e6d60bd8d6d'), chunk_index=130, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617743, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='6. Review Changes: Review the changes and choose Submit.\nTo see your changes, you must sign out and then sign back in. Your request must be fully approved before the\nchanges display. If no approvals are required, your profile changes display when you sign back in.\nCreating a Personal Address\nYou can create personal addresses so goods and services can be sent directly to non-company locations.\nContext', page_no=17, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('33922a39-a040-47a7-82da-e02f1697eaa8'), chunk_index=131, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617747, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Create and manage your own ship-to addresses if you're working from non-company locations, such as your home,\na client's office, or a temporary residence. You can enter up to 50 addresses.\nWhen you enter an address, guided buying validates it and allows you to choose a standardized version of the\naddress.\nWhen you order goods or services, you can choose from Company locations (official company addresses) or Your", page_no=17, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('3666a8e4-a1d3-4f12-aa9c-f88db66366d2'), chunk_index=132, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617751, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="addresses (personal addresses). Personal addresses don't affect the buy on-behalf-of or delegation functionality\nin guided buying. You can view, add, and edit only your own addresses and select only your own addresses when\nfilling out forms. When you click Request on behalf of and select another user, you see only your own addresses,", page_no=17, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c8380fc4-eac8-4f3b-8e2b-a2ff01c4159b'), chunk_index=133, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617755, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="not those of the other user. Similarly, if you've been delegated approval authority, you see only your own addresses.\nYou can add personal addresses from the user menu or during check out.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nYour organization might not allow you to create addresses for official company locations, because they are\nadded by administrators, not users.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nManaging Your User Profile\nPUBLIC\n17", page_no=17, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2c87b0c6-f706-4c91-ada2-00c69ec664c3'), chunk_index=134, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617839, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Procedure\n1.\nYou can create a personal address in the following ways:\n•\nFrom the guided buying homepage, click your name in the upper right-hand corner and then choose\nApp\nsettings\nChange your profile\n.\n1.\nGo to the Accounting/Shipping step.\n2. Go to\nPlant\nSearch more\nNew\n.\n3. Enter the details in the Create Custom Plant form and choose Save.\n•\nOn the checkout page, choose\nManage locations', page_no=18, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('35cae7be-526c-4538-8fa5-1112c554e164'), chunk_index=135, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617844, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Ship To\nBrowse all\n.\n1.\nIn the Choose a shipping address window, choose Your addresses.\n2. In the Manage your addresses window, click plus symbol (\ue058\xa0) to add a new address.\n3. In the Add an address window, add the following information:\nField\nDescription\nName\nThe name of the person or organization for the address, such as Chad Noll or BigBuyer, Genève.', page_no=18, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('82d88a06-9723-4c6a-9fb8-246814b58e5d'), chunk_index=136, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617847, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='The name displays in menus when you select addresses and suppliers use it on shipping labels.\nKeep this\naddress\nprivate\nSpecifies whether to keep this address private.\nClick to hide the address from other guided buying users; they see only the words "Private Address." Only\nshippers, service providers, and guided buying administrators can see the address.\n\ue05c\xa0Note', page_no=18, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ffa2a2c3-e781-4454-af69-cfd7470f8989'), chunk_index=137, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617851, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Regardless of this setting, the address always displays to users in SAP Ariba Procurement solutions and\nSAP S/4HANA.\nAddress\nThe complete address, starting with the country or region. Guided buying uses the country or region from\nyour user profile by default.\nAs you type, guided buying displays matching addresses for most countries and regions; you can select one\nor continue typing.\nEmail', page_no=18, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a7004fa7-ffab-4584-94af-8a764693aece'), chunk_index=138, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617855, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="The email address of a person at this address.\nPhone\nThe telephone number of this address. Enter numbers as they would be dialed from the address's country;\ndon't use the international country code.\n2. Click Add.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nIf you didn't select a standardized address when entering the address, you must select the address you\nentered or the standardized one and click Use this address.\n18\nPUBLIC", page_no=18, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4340ee0e-a358-4b4d-91ca-d34f2f8c8442'), chunk_index=139, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617859, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Guided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nManaging Your User Profile', page_no=18, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('24756745-59c0-4770-b0fd-abc79161acd2'), chunk_index=140, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617888, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Results\nThe new address is available when you select a ship-to address in the checkout page. The Manage your addresses\npage also displays ad-hoc addresses added in SAP Ariba Procurement solutions. Those addresses display a\nValidation Required label until you edit and validate them in guided buying.\nNext Steps\nYou can edit or delete personal addresses in the Manage your addresses window. To edit an address,click the edit', page_no=19, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('be7bfc9f-4015-4f98-a9a8-dfaad568a1f5'), chunk_index=141, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617892, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='icon (\ue038\xa0). To delete an address, click the delete icon (\ue03d\xa0).\nAfter making any changes, any in-progress or completed requests continue to use the old address.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nManaging Your User Profile\nPUBLIC\n19', page_no=19, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0787d7dc-e25f-428b-8a89-7b9b5ab45620'), chunk_index=142, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617942, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Accessibility\nSAP Ariba has enhanced the accessibility of guided buying with the goal of eventually reaching adherence with the\nWeb Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG).\nThe WCAG is a set of recommendations published by the World Wide Web Consortium for creating applications\nthat are more accessible to people with disabilities and to user agents.\n\ue05c\xa0Note', page_no=20, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('da93e0d0-9183-4b8c-981e-2e2d58cee885'), chunk_index=143, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617946, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="This accessibility is supported in Microsoft Internet Explorer 11 and later and Google Chrome 79 and later.\nScreen Readers\nSAP Ariba tests guided buying with the following screen readers:\n•\nJAWS from Freedom Scientific Inc.\n•\nVoiceOver from Apple Inc.\nOther screen readers might work, but they haven't been tested.\nPages\nGuided buying meets WCAG 2.0 level AA accessibility requirements on the following widely used pages:\n•\nHome\n•", page_no=20, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('cd3660d5-2e64-417f-9314-d00dca352b08'), chunk_index=144, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 617950, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Search results\n•\nShopping cart\n•\nItem details\n•\nCheckout\n•\nRequisition\n•\nNon-catalog requisition\n•\nYour requests\n•\nYour approvals\n•\nYour favorites\n•\nPunchOut\n•\nRequest details\n•\nNon-catalog request\n•\nPurchase order details\n•\nTeam buying\n20\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nAccessibility', page_no=20, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('1dd6e440-4a7f-45f4-9c94-f1ec3a883f93'), chunk_index=145, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618000, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='•\nOn-behalf-of buying\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nOn the Requisition page, the process flow chart is not fully level AA compliant.\nPages that meet the level AA requirements contain checkpoints to help disabled users access applications, for\nexample:\n•\nPage elements meet minimum contrast settings, which helps users who have color weakness see different\npage sections and controls more clearly.\n•\nArrow keys control menus, tab lists, and carousels.\n•', page_no=21, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('05c9eee5-1e41-454c-bc7e-325135b59a6b'), chunk_index=146, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618004, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Screen readers recognize and read information for user interface components, such as item count for menus\nand tab lists.\n•\nPages can be scaled and all functions on the page are preserved and are usable.\nRelated Information\nSwitching Page Control Groups by Keyboard [page 21]\nUsing Carousels by Keyboard [page 22]\nUsing the Calendar by Keyboard [page 22]\nShortcut Keys Supported by Guided Buying [page 23]', page_no=21, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('34069c85-6b99-4337-a40f-72114c8dd263'), chunk_index=147, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618008, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Switching Page Control Groups by Keyboard\nSome pages have a multiple groups of controls, such as a left pane and a right pane.\nProcedure\n1.\nTo switch the focus to the next group with the keyboard, press Ctrl + 6 .\n2. Continue pressing Ctrl + 6 to loop back to the original group.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nAccessibility\nPUBLIC\n21', page_no=21, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e9449179-93f4-4d45-9e42-3ee619acc1d5'), chunk_index=148, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618059, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Using Carousels by Keyboard\nWhile shopping, you can access guided buying carousels with the keyboard.\nContext\nUse the following instructions to control a carousel with the keyboard:\nProcedure\n1.\nWhen the focus is on the element before a carousel, press the Tab key to enter the carousel.\n2. Press the left arrow ← or right arrow → keys to navigate between items within the carousel.', page_no=22, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('abbca306-6a8b-4f5a-a1ec-4efe380354e0'), chunk_index=149, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618063, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='3. Scroll the carousel by pressing the left arrow ← or right arrow → keys to move the focus to the left or right\narrow icon in the carousel, then click Enter to scroll one item left or right.\n4. Press the Enter key to select an item within the carousel.', page_no=22, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e4d5f905-e84c-49c7-9a31-f43549662b95'), chunk_index=150, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618067, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='5. To exit the carousel, press the Tab key to navigate to the right arrow icon within the carousel, then press the\nTab key again to move the focus to the element after the carousel.\nUsing the Calendar by Keyboard\nYou can select dates with the keyboard.\nContext\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nThe calendar control in the Checkout and Requisition pages doesn’t support screen readers.', page_no=22, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('cec00fa4-0922-4b85-8ef7-786ab31d61b7'), chunk_index=151, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618071, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='To use the calendar control with the keyboard:\nProcedure\n1.\nNavigate to the calendar.\n22\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nAccessibility', page_no=22, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d9b2c662-a24d-4558-98ae-4cd1aaeeb1c4'), chunk_index=152, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618149, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='2. Control it using the following operations:\nOperation\nInstructions\nOpen calendar\nPress Enter .\nChoose date\nUse the arrow up/down/left/right keys to navigate to the date area and press Enter to choose a\nspecific date.\nSwitch from day to\nmonth\nPress Ctrl + Up (Windows) or Ctrl + Command + Up (Mac) to switch from the day', page_no=23, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('7ab7ba4b-d5bc-40cb-91a2-297ee12fda83'), chunk_index=153, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618153, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='pane to the month pane, then press Tab and choose the month with the arrow up/down/left/\nright keys.\nSwitch from month\nto year\nPress Ctrl + Up (Windows) or Ctrl + Command + Up (Mac) to switch from the month\npane to the year pane, then press Tab and choose the year with the arrow up/down/left/right\nkeys.\nSwitch from year to\nmonth', page_no=23, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e95a8b63-574a-4031-a2bf-7a0d7b22a892'), chunk_index=154, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618157, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='In the year pane, choose the year and press Enter ; the pane switches to the month pane, then\npress Shift + Tab and choose the month with the arrow up/down/left/right keys.\nSwitch from month\nto day\nIn the month pane, choose the month and press Enter ; the pane switches to the day pane, then\npress Shift + Tab and choose the day with the arrow up/down/left/right keys.', page_no=23, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('30fb4e3f-8b49-44c3-83ba-90c66f79e18b'), chunk_index=155, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618161, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Shortcut Keys Supported by Guided Buying\nGuided buying supports shortcut keys on some pages for customer catalog-based purchasing.\nYou can use the following shortcut keys:\nPage\nAction\nShortcut Key\nRequest details\nSubmit\nCtrl + Shift + S\nEdit\nCtrl + Shift + E\nDelete\nCtrl + Backspace\nWithdraw\nCtrl + Shift + W\nBuy again\nCtrl + Shift + B\nChange request\nCtrl + Shift + E\nCancel request', page_no=23, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('7709b400-b423-4eb2-97b0-bfc364db7e53'), chunk_index=156, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618164, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Ctrl + Shift + C\nCheckout\nSubmit\nCtrl + Shift + S\nSave and exit\nCtrl + Shift + P\nApproval\nApprove\nCtrl + Enter\nDeny\nCtrl + R\nTeam buying\nStop\nCtrl + Shift + O\nOn-behalf-of buying\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nSome of the shortcut keys listed in the table might conflict with the default shortcut keys of your web browser.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nAccessibility\nPUBLIC', page_no=23, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('df9ada25-20e9-4605-a8eb-b3ed8283b19c'), chunk_index=157, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618168, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='23', page_no=23, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('bdccb86c-1420-4bd2-9c18-8da5ae177eb4'), chunk_index=158, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618193, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Reading Announcements on the Home Page\nYou might receive broadcast announcements, which are informational messages sent by your organization.\n1.\nWhen you sign in, announcements display in a rotating carousel on your home page:\nAnnouncements that you haven\'t yet read contain the label "New."\n2. Each announcement displays for five seconds, but you can stop message rotation by hovering the pointer on', page_no=24, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ad1e8596-b1a3-4c85-97b2-77b4f6517bcb'), chunk_index=159, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618197, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='the carousel or by clicking any dot at the bottom of the carousel.\n3. Click Learn more to read more information:\n24\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nReading Announcements on the Home Page', page_no=24, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4a70cb44-967e-4852-a4bf-d4f31bb5dcbf'), chunk_index=160, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618203, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Click Close to go back to the home page.\n4. After you've read all new announcements, the carousel moves to the bottom of the home page to create more\nspace and to make the announcements less prominent.\nRelated Information\nReading Announcements from the Notifications Menu [page 26]\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nReading Announcements on the Home Page\nPUBLIC\n25", page_no=25, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d633f65f-1a1d-4df5-a6e0-e70508f44738'), chunk_index=161, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618227, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Reading Announcements from the Notifications\nMenu\nAll announcements are available in the Notifications menu.\nContext\nYou can view announcements at any time from the Notifications menu. You can also tell which announcements are\nnew and which you've already read.\nProcedure\n1.\nFrom any guided buying page, click the Notifications bell icon (\n) and choose Announcements.\n26\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases", page_no=26, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c5bbe1fd-abee-4ce0-a96d-cb915238971f'), chunk_index=162, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618231, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Reading Announcements on the Home Page', page_no=26, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('720c1104-9f54-44e7-8c30-5e9c8c174ef7'), chunk_index=163, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618253, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Guided buying displays the Announcements page:\n2. Click any announcement to view it.\nClick Close to exit the announcement.\n3. In the Announcements page, a blue vertical line appears next to new announcements; after you click\nan announcement, the blue line disappears. Click Mark all as read to remove the blue line from all\nannouncements.\nRelated Information\nReading Announcements on the Home Page [page 24]', page_no=27, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('08dee1f8-5971-472e-a9dd-6ba4c27354ee'), chunk_index=164, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618256, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Guided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nReading Announcements on the Home Page\nPUBLIC\n27', page_no=27, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('f12d4713-57b8-439b-b46f-e188ea98fca2'), chunk_index=165, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618316, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Finding an Item or Service\nThere are various ways to find an item or service. For example, you can use a keyword in the search bar or you can\nfind the item based on the supplier.\nBefore you search for an item or service, consider using an option from the Recommended for you carousel on the', page_no=28, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('95d1de08-366a-4031-a7c9-2e69d8a1a080'), chunk_index=166, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618320, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='homepage, if available on your site. This section dynamically lists catalog items that might be of interest to you. It\nuses artificial intelligence to list items that were bought by you or other users in your organization that have your\njob function. Click any item in the carousel to view more information and to add it to the cart.', page_no=28, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('1b8b1669-df9d-4eaa-aa3f-76edc8e8fcb8'), chunk_index=167, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618324, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='The following figure shows an example of a Recommended for you carousel.\nYou can click the More options menu (\ue1f2\xa0) to move the carousel to bottom of the page. Clicking it again moves the\ncarousel back to the top of the page.\nWays to Find an Item or Service\nUse any of the following ways to find an item or service:\n•', page_no=28, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ccab0e37-3c00-454d-bcd9-29b98eefeae1'), chunk_index=168, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618327, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Request an item or service from a landing page, see Landing Pages [page 29].\n•\nSearch by keyword using the search bar, see Search Results [page 31].\n•\nSearch for an item or service by supplier, see Suppliers [page 33].\n•\nUse a form to request an item or service, see Forms [page 36].\n28\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nFinding an Item or Service', page_no=28, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('bf435ab2-1446-4701-adf3-44ca3e0e1dc1'), chunk_index=169, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618335, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="•\nCompare the details of similar items at once, see Comparing Items [page 37].\nLanding Pages\nLanding pages are customized pages that contain clickable tiles to catalog items, forms, or links to other sites.\nWhen you sign in, guided buying displays the home page, which contains groups of landing pages for your\norganization's purchases.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nFinding an Item or Service\nPUBLIC\n29", page_no=29, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('51a6cf38-ee9e-4b71-9c0c-cbbae9202e4f'), chunk_index=170, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618359, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='The following is an example home page containing nine tiles:\nFigure 3: Sample home page\nLanding pages are for a particular category. For example, if you\'re a new employee and you need a workspace\nsetup, you search for "workspace setup" in guided buying. It might display your facilities landing page, which shows\nfacilities services that are specific to your location, such as building services, cleaning services, workspace setup,', page_no=30, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('632f1603-3e99-49f8-adf5-07388dda3809'), chunk_index=171, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618363, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='or catering. You click the "Workspace setup" tile to fill out a form for ordering that specific service.\n30\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nFinding an Item or Service', page_no=30, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d70a622a-f962-4902-a6ec-c530351220c5'), chunk_index=172, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618392, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='The following is an example of a facilities landing page:\nFigure 4: Facilities landing page\nSearch Results\nWhen you search for an item, your buying options are categorized into different tabs in the search results.\nUsing the search bar, you can search for an item or service by keyword, supplier, or part number. When you enter a\nsearch term, suggested options display, as shown in the following figure.\n\ue04c\xa0Tip', page_no=31, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('349b99ca-e676-465b-ae49-b19b32c9c8c7'), chunk_index=173, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618396, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="If your site's default locale is set to an Asian language, you must enter at least two characters when you conduct\nsearches throughout guided buying.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nFinding an Item or Service\nPUBLIC\n31", page_no=31, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('226f537b-0ad5-4a23-9ebd-127e7aab3b71'), chunk_index=174, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618446, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="The tabs available and the links you can access are based on your site's configuration and your group membership.\nIn the following figure, the Explore, Catalogs, Item hierarchy, Spot Buy catalog, Suppliers, Forms, and Explore\nmore results tabs are available.\nThe following tabs display in the search results:\n•\nExplore: This tab displays the most popular search results from each tab.\n•", page_no=32, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('064fca41-efaa-4b1d-a12b-2ee7d0937781'), chunk_index=175, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618450, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Catalog: This tab displays results for items and services from your catalog. When you see the Buy from\nsupplier option for an item, you must navigate to the supplier's site to add the item to your cart.\n•\nItem hierarchy: This tab displays results for service items containing hierarchical items, which allows users to", page_no=32, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('1b9d6134-2777-469e-b509-a99d36e876bd'), chunk_index=176, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618453, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="create two-level service purchase requests. For example, if you need to request a catering service, the child line\nitems could be the clearning service and the rental equipment.\n•\nSpot buy catalog: This tab displays results for items and services that aren't available through your catalog.\nYou can use this option to request non-catalog items without having to specify a supplier. For more information", page_no=32, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('38b32bd5-1b5a-4420-badb-1978b0b86bc7'), chunk_index=177, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618457, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='on spot buy capability, see Spot Buy Capability in Guided Buying.\n32\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nFinding an Item or Service', page_no=32, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2217906c-eae3-42bd-a272-40a9279e3040'), chunk_index=178, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618541, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='•\nSuppliers: This tab displays the suppliers you can purchase from, results are listed as supplier tiles. When you\nopen a supplier tile, you can find more information about the supplier and if available, find forms for items or\nservices defaulted to that supplier. For more information, see Suppliers [page 33].\n•\nForms: The tab displays custom forms your organization created for completing different procurement', page_no=33, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('fba38c0b-fa30-400b-b23d-5608a157e027'), chunk_index=179, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618545, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='activities. For example, there could be forms for requesting items or services, creating a project, or transferring\nownership of a document. Your organization may create forms for repeat purchases like, "Requesting a clearing\nservice". For more information, see Forms [page 36].\n•\nExplore more results: The results on this tab are based on your organization\'s most recently used options:\nforms, links to external sites, or landing page tiles, for example.', page_no=33, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a471e253-9322-4bb4-9df9-4357633c9616'), chunk_index=180, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618549, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Suppliers\nSupplier details include items and services they offer.\nThe Suppliers tab allows you to choose your item or service based on the supplier. When you open the Suppliers\ntab, tiles for the available suppliers display. Preferred or qualified status, diversity information, and risk exposure\nscore is readily available so you can quickly find the supplier that meets your criteria. The tiles also include the\nsupplier's location and vendor ID.", page_no=33, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('38fe5c32-b15b-44a1-b7f1-eed2880899b5'), chunk_index=181, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618553, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Within the supplier tile you can find the items and services they offer, contact information, forms for requesting\ntheir products or services, and a non-catalog request form that defaults to that supplier. The Can't find what\nyou're looking for? section displays a link to create a non-catalog request, as shown in the following figure.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nNon-catalog request forms aren't available if you belong to the No Ad-Hoc Item group.", page_no=33, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('7e4dcbe4-61df-4d2a-8bf4-111a4b09987c'), chunk_index=182, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618557, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Supplier Risk\nIf your organization has SAP Ariba Supplier Risk enabled, the supplier's risk exposure score is available. The score\nis based on the different aspects of the business: Regulatory & legal, Environmental & social, Operational, and\nFinancial. For more information, see Mitigating Risk for Non-Catalog Purchases [page 55]. In the following figure,\nthe risk exposure score is Unknown, which indicates the supplier isn't engaged with risk exposure activities.", page_no=33, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a40ededa-939c-4de9-a434-aed4d8d9f0e6'), chunk_index=183, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618560, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Guided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nFinding an Item or Service\nPUBLIC\n33', page_no=33, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6f57f9cf-5298-4a45-946e-f069ff528080'), chunk_index=184, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618594, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Supplier Diversity\nDepending upon your site\'s configuration, you might see diversity labels, like "Hispanic owned" or "women owned",\non suppliers. Businesses that support diversity are a growing trend globally, and procurement organizations are\nbecoming more aware of the impacts manufacturers have on the environment and their local communities. Your\nadministrator can promote diversity through procurement within your organization by labeling suppliers with', page_no=34, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b6a0d256-2ee8-4df3-91d4-5e6db491ff4f'), chunk_index=185, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618598, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='diversity types, such as "Hispanic owned" or "women owned", or by creating a diversity program.\nDiversity Types\nIf configured for your site, diversity types like "Women-owned business" or "LatinX business" display in the\nfollowing scenarios:\nIf you\'re creating a non-catalog request, diversity types might display on supplier tiles, as shown in the following\nfigure.', page_no=34, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d0e55801-2c5e-45d0-9fe9-833f5e646b0b'), chunk_index=186, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618602, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='If you open a customer catalog item to view more details, diversity labels display in the supplier details.\n34\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nFinding an Item or Service', page_no=34, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('66d05c1b-99f6-4742-bea5-3de05ea408c8'), chunk_index=187, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618687, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Diversity Program\nIf your organization wants to promote diversity through procurement further, they can create a diversity program.\nSuppliers that belong to the program are labeled with your diversity program logo and their details include a\ndescription of the diversity program, as shown in the following figure.\nGuidelines for Using Subcontractors as Suppliers', page_no=35, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4fa8486e-427a-4772-9b38-7fde9a3b61a2'), chunk_index=188, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618691, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="If the Is Subcontractor value on a purchase requisition is changed, in-app messages inform and warn you about\nediting this field. These messages help to prevent the subcontractor value from being incorrectly entered.\nIf you're using subcontractors for purchase requisitions, follow these guidelines to ensure subcontractors are paid,\nthus preventing subcontractor-related penalties. Follow these guidelines to ensure subcontractor information is\ncorrect:\n•", page_no=35, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0eaad50e-cc68-47d6-b927-750789cd4118'), chunk_index=189, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618695, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Subcontractor value from supplier master data: The subcontractor value copies from your supplier master\ndata. If the Is Subcontractor value changed in a requisition, the value doesn't change in your supplier master\ndata. You must update the supplier's Is Subcontractor value, if necessary, for each purchase requisition.\n•\nImported requisitions with subcontractors: Requisitions imported from external systems use the Is\nSubcontractor value from the imported requisition.\n•", page_no=35, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6d6e67b9-1989-434e-9efd-81e39d64d315'), chunk_index=190, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618698, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Ordered items with subcontractors: If a purchase requisition has been ordered, additional items can be added\nto the order. If the newly added item uses the same supplier and the Is Subcontractor value is changed, it also\nchanges the Is Subcontractor value for the ordered item.\n•\nDuplicating items with subcontractors: If a purchase requisition is duplicated (\nMore options\nBuy\nagain', page_no=35, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('02b72dec-079f-40f0-af7e-7024de9ac938'), chunk_index=191, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618702, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='), the Is Subcontractor value copies to the new version. Any changes made to the duplicate version do\nnot apply to the original purchase requisition.\nAfter purchase requisitions are submitted in guided buying, you can find the purchase order in your SAP Ariba\nBuying solution. You can find purchase orders based on the subcontractor field, and then prioritize the receipts', page_no=35, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4b2f6d84-45c6-4d69-ab41-eefad50b83dc'), chunk_index=192, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618706, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='and payments for subcontractors. To find purchase orders based on the subcontractor field, go the the Purchase\nOrders page in your SAP Ariba Buying solution. In the search fiters, select Yes from the Is Subcontractor field, as\nshown in the following figure.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nFinding an Item or Service\nPUBLIC\n35', page_no=35, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('5f1ec2ed-e1bd-4ba0-ab9a-656985a2133b'), chunk_index=193, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618759, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Forms\nForms guide you through the purchase of a service or configurable item, or to request something from your\norganization.\nYour organization might have forms for requesting certain items or services. For example, there could be a form for\ncleaning services using a company located near your office.\nYou can use the following types of forms to request an item or service:\n•', page_no=36, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('99b419a2-4390-4717-8ae7-132193dd858a'), chunk_index=194, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618763, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Request for Quote Form: Fill out this form to request a particular good or service. For example, you can\nrequest quotes from several suppliers to provide advertising services related to a particular project. For more\ninformation, see request quotes from suppliers [page 73].\n•\nLine Item Form: Complete the form fields in addition to the standard non-catalog request fields. After filling', page_no=36, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('8a40d8da-bbb8-466b-a916-aa214742eee1'), chunk_index=195, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618767, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="out all the required fields, you check out and submit the request for approval.\n\ue201\xa0Caution\nAfter you submit a request that includes information from a line-item form, if you need to edit the details,\nyou'll need to delete the request and create it again with the correct details.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nThe default currency on a form is derived from the country/region associated with your ship-to address or", page_no=36, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('8205633f-0758-41e5-97fb-1f881c39f170'), chunk_index=196, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618770, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='plant. For example, if your ship-to country/region is the United States, your currency default to USD.\n36\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nFinding an Item or Service', page_no=36, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ebb283ec-ea77-4609-9cbb-4ca20751689b'), chunk_index=197, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618810, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="•\nCustom Form: Complete this form to request something from your organization. For example, you might have\na Check Request form available for requesting a one-time payment for a supplier.\n•\nNon-Catalog Request Form: If the item or service you need isn't availble in your catalog, you can create a\nnon-catalog request. On each tab in the search results, there's a tile for a non-catalog request at the bottom of", page_no=37, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('9fdaf968-92f6-4ace-b381-2332f076f3df'), chunk_index=198, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618815, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="the page, as shown in the following figure.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nThe Request a non-catalog item option is only available if you're a member of the No Ad-Hoc Item group.\nComparing Items\nIf you're deciding between similar items, you can compare multiple items at once before you add the item to your\ncart.\nContext\nDetails in the comparison table might also include Hazardous Materials, Green, and Preferred Item, as shown in", page_no=37, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d3960d5d-a245-430b-9aa5-586fc10bf732'), chunk_index=199, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618819, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='the following figure.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nFinding an Item or Service\nPUBLIC\n37', page_no=37, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('25da9bae-8b54-46c5-a6e8-79beb4a4d332'), chunk_index=200, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618848, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='•\nHazardous Materials: Item contains a hazardous material.\n•\nGreen: Item has been produced using eco-friendly practices.\n•\nPreferred Item: Item has been configured as a preferred item, which means your organization wants spend\ndirected towards items labeled as Preferred.\nAn icon displays if an item falls within any of these categories. "No" indicates that it does not apply, and a dash (-)', page_no=38, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('1bfbae1a-82b9-450f-bc8a-c0c70c19ce3d'), chunk_index=201, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618852, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="indicates there's no data available for that category.\nProcedure\n1.\nOn the Catalogs tab, find items to compare and check the Compare box in the item tile, as shown in the\nfollowing figure.\n38\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nFinding an Item or Service", page_no=38, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('563ffc8d-0079-47cb-92a7-f28b2c097f10'), chunk_index=202, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618859, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='2. In the banner menu with the selected items, click Compare as shown in the following figure.\n3. On the comparison page, you can select the Highlight differences toggle to highlight the differences, as shown\nin the following figure.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nFinding an Item or Service\nPUBLIC\n39', page_no=39, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ae90c394-bcef-451d-b7da-bded2a3f6c50'), chunk_index=203, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618882, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Purchasing an Item\nAfter you find the items or services you need, add them to your cart and submit the request for approval.\nContext\nThe following video demonstrates the buying process in guided buying. You can play the interactive tutorial for\nstep-by-step instructions; all tutorials are captioned exclusively in English:', page_no=40, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4a514e34-15fe-4c0d-8474-2716afe7ea66'), chunk_index=204, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618885, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='After all the items are in your cart, select the Check out button to start the purchase request, as shown in the\nfollowing figure.\n40\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nPurchasing an Item', page_no=40, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0f81a5aa-512f-4cdb-9439-97b190e54457'), chunk_index=205, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618913, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="After you select Check out, items from your cart populate into a purchase requisition. You must complete the\nrequest before it can be submitted for approval. The checkout page verifies information against your site's policies;\ntherefore, incorrect details or selections result in warnings or errors. The following figure displays an error message\ndisplays at line-level.", page_no=41, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('3dc816b2-58d4-47f6-8756-fd7a8eca1a63'), chunk_index=206, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618917, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='You must resolve all the errors before you can submit a request. For more information on resolving errors and\nwarnings, see Warnings and Errors on Requests [page 43].\nProcedure\n1.\nAdd a brief summary of your request to the Title field, as shown in the following figure.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nPurchasing an Item\nPUBLIC\n41', page_no=41, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('8a926e70-8f76-4858-bc14-122e4c5dc7d9'), chunk_index=207, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618958, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='2. In the Items section, open the dropdown menu and adjust line-item information as needed, as shown in the\nfollowing figure.\nFor more information about the sections in each line-item, see the Related information section following this\nprocedure.\n3. If available, click Validate to check for warnings or errors.\n4. Review the approval flow and if needed, you can add or remove users.', page_no=42, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('75654fbf-0e46-4502-a92c-88b8896ac377'), chunk_index=208, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618962, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="If the Refresh to update window displays when you edit the approval flow, you must refresh the flow before\nmaking edits.\n5. To save the request, click Save and exit.\nThe request is saved in Composing status.\n6. To submit the request, click Submit and it's submitted for approval.\n7.\nTo withdraw the request, click Withdraw, which saves it in Composing state.", page_no=42, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e9e9929a-b15a-4bec-b637-28fcb14312c9'), chunk_index=209, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 618966, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="If you delete all the items on the request, the entire request is deleted and you're taken back to the home page.\n8. After you submit the request, navigate to Your Requests to check the status. For more information, see\nFinding the Status of Your Requests [page 107].\n42\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nPurchasing an Item", page_no=42, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('469050f6-e3d1-4e0b-9493-469d29a03923'), chunk_index=210, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619047, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Related Information\nAccounting [page 44]\nShipping [page 46]\nComments [page 47]\nAttachments [page 47]\nOthers [page 48]\nWarnings and Errors on Requests\nPurchasing policies implemented by your organization may cause warnings or errors to appear when you create a\nrequest.\nWhen creating a request, you might see an error that states: Enter a valid value. This error message appears below', page_no=43, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('1de82d58-704d-41e3-aed4-ce38040b9406'), chunk_index=211, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619051, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="each field that either has an incorrect value or is blank.\nTo resolve this error on your requests:\n•\nBe sure to complete all fields that are marked with a red asterisk (*).\n•\nIf you get an error message on an accounting field for which you've entered a value, take a look at a request you\nsubmitted previously and compare the accounting information between the two requests.", page_no=43, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('f4875779-dec3-41f9-874d-eaf1af50f569'), chunk_index=212, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619054, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Additionally, if your request violates one of your organization's policies, an error or warning message explains how\nto make your purchase compliant.\nYou might also run into custom error messages set up by your organization for certain fields. If you're not sure\nhow to fix a certain error message, we recommend searching for the error message text in your organization's help\ncommunity [page 170].\n\ue04c\xa0Tip", page_no=43, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('98406e2b-661e-4b20-b943-3ef29f27d699'), chunk_index=213, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619058, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Use double quotes around the error message text when searching to look for help content that contains this\nexact error message.\nIf you can't determine how to resolve the error, click Ask expert in the help community to get assistance from\npurchasing experts in your organization.\nThe purchasing policies implemented by your organization's procurement department will guide you to the right", page_no=43, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c08c7d28-cbb1-4f77-b2d9-782bc721ed50'), chunk_index=214, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619062, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="system and process for what you need to buy. You find out right away when a policy is violated, rather than finding\nout after submitting a request.\nFor example, if your organization has a gift policy that prevents you from purchasing gifts that are more than $25\nUSD, you'll see an error message that prevents you from buying the item as a gift. You can submit the request after", page_no=43, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4eb6aeb9-e1ab-486f-9cb9-6e00ba22f72a'), chunk_index=215, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619066, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='you choose a more inexpensive gift.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nPurchasing an Item\nPUBLIC\n43', page_no=43, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('42c72097-5f9c-4845-b8f9-f7c0f0c767dc'), chunk_index=216, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619103, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Figure 5: Policy Violation\nOther policies might show a warning message with a place to enter an optional description:\nFigure 6: Policy Warning\nIf you make purchases on behalf of a department in your organization, such as marketing or facilities, you are now\nequipped to follow all the necessary procurement policies without having to read through pages of procurement\nmanuals.', page_no=44, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6b771672-f30f-40ab-bf47-51e559100831'), chunk_index=217, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619107, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="In addition to these benefits, you can also get help from purchasing experts in your organization and collaborate\nwith your colleagues [page 170] in your organization's help community. You'll have quick access to the right\nprocess for your location and type of purchase, which reduces the need to pick up the phone or send an email to\nfigure out the right process or point of contact.\nAccounting", page_no=44, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e6fde977-38fb-481a-a8fd-ffa3f46014c6'), chunk_index=218, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619111, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='In the Accounting section of purchase requisitions, information about who is billed for the purchase and other\ncost-related details are available.\nYou can make the following changes in the Accounting section:\n44\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nPurchasing an Item', page_no=44, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('980df839-d759-47b2-b4a8-107c6ef646d6'), chunk_index=219, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619118, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='•\nSplit Accounting: Divide the cost among multiple accounts by clicking Split accounting, as shown in the\nfollowing figure.\nChoose the split accounting type: Percentage, Quantity, or Amount, as shown in the following figure.\nIf you need to split the cost across more than two segments, click Add split, as shown in the following figure.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nPurchasing an Item\nPUBLIC\n45', page_no=45, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('dfa28a94-d4bb-4034-9a2b-0637211f6ca4'), chunk_index=220, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619188, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='•\nMass-Edit Accounting Fields: If your organization allows you to mass-edit accounting fields, you can make the\nfollowing changes:\n•\nLine item: To use new values on specific line items, click Changing accounting details for specific\nitem(s)?, make the necessary changes, click Next, and then click Done to apply the changes.\n•\nMultiple items: To change accounting information for multiple line items, click Manage details and select', page_no=46, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('73717592-4a79-4395-a242-d17354071a4a'), chunk_index=221, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619193, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='new values to use on all line items.\nShipping\nIn the Shipping section for each item in your purchase request, you can change the plant address, need-by date,\ndeliver-to address, or purchase group, if allowed by your organization.\nYou can make the following shipping information changes during checkout:\n•\nEdit line item shipping: You can change the shipping information for each line item by doing the following:\n1.', page_no=46, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('158de6d4-eb71-4f48-95ed-4b9997806f13'), chunk_index=222, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619197, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='In the Shipping section, open the Plant dropdown menu (\ue1e2\xa0) and click Browse all.\n2. Click New to create a new plant address.\n3. Fill in the address details on the Plant form and click Save.\n•\nMass-edit shipping fields: You can change the shipping information for multiple items at once by doing the\nfollowing:\n1.\nIn the header-level Ship to section, click Manage locations.', page_no=46, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d4dfd929-7a6d-4324-bf7e-b7b53450230d'), chunk_index=223, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619201, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='2. You can do the following:\n•\nSelect new values to use on all line items.\n•\nTo use new values on specific line items, click Shipping items to different locations?.\n•\nTo create a new address to use on all line items, do the following:\n1.\nOpen the Plant dropdown menu (\ue1e2\xa0) and click Browse all.\n2. Click New.\n3. Fill in the address details and click Save.', page_no=46, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('24d79021-209b-4d08-baa8-d617a0b5fa98'), chunk_index=224, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619205, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='3. Click Done to apply the change.\n46\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nPurchasing an Item', page_no=46, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('8af49c60-0bcd-4502-bfae-af4dc301f14f'), chunk_index=225, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619278, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='You can also create new ship-to addresses before you checkout. To create ship-to addresses from your user profile,\nsee Creating a Personal Address [page 17]\nComments\nIn the Comments section of purchase requisitions, you can add comments and allow suppliers to see your\ncomments.\nComments can be added at header level or line item level, before or after a requisition is submitted. Any', page_no=47, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('06f7974c-cb06-44e4-b7ae-1e83f92d614c'), chunk_index=226, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619282, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="justification entries added appear in the Comments section; you can't delete them. You can allow suppliers to\nsee comments by selecting the Share with supplier box, as shown in the following figure.\nThe number of comments you can add to a requisition is configured by your administrator. By default, the\nmaximum number of comments allowed is 100. If you need to add more than 100 comments, you must do the", page_no=47, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('99a53c85-460f-4392-9a1e-b6d113b863f1'), chunk_index=227, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619286, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='following:\n•\nThe System.GuidedBuy.Limits.RequisitionCommentMax parameter must be set to the number of\ncomments allowed on purchase requisitions. SAP Ariba Support sets this parameter for you. Have your\ndesignated support contact file a service request (SR) to set the parameter.\n•\nYour administrator must configure the following parameter in Ariba Administrator under\nIntelligent\nConfiguration Manager\nManage Configurations\n:\n•\nSet maximum comments on requisitions\n(Application.GuidedBuy.Limits.RequisitionCommentMax), see Set maximum comments on\nrequisitions.', page_no=47, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b02ecc19-6ea3-43f8-8af6-1a49373eaad4'), chunk_index=228, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619290, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Attachments\nIn the Attachments section of purchase requisitions, you can add attachments at header-level or line-level.\nAttachments can be added before or after a purchase request has been submitted. Drag and drop any files and\nclick Add to the Attachments section. To allow suppliers to see your attachments on SAP Business Network, click\nthe Share with supplier box, as shown in the following figure.', page_no=47, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('46ce6048-8713-4a5e-9320-cbafe093b5c3'), chunk_index=229, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619293, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Guided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nPurchasing an Item\nPUBLIC\n47', page_no=47, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('931dc1d5-0f70-4151-bcdd-4c119f4c800d'), chunk_index=230, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619332, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='\ue05c\xa0Note\nThe maximum total file size allowed for all attachments in a request is 35 MB.\nOthers\nIn the Others section of purchase requisitions, additional information such as, subcontractor or classification\ndetails can be changed.\nIn the Others section, the fields available are based on your organization and they may allow you to make changes\nto the following fields:\n•\nCommodity Code\n•\nIs Subcontractor\n\ue05c\xa0Note', page_no=48, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('03bb75a5-f6c7-4d9b-a5e2-4ec052784eb0'), chunk_index=231, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619336, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='For more information on using subcontractors, see Guidelines for Using Subcontractors as Suppliers [page\n35] .\n•\nItem Category\n•\nMaterial Group\n•\nPayment Terms\n•\nAdditional Supplier Email Addresses\n•\nIncoterms Code\n•\nIncoterms Location\n•\nPurch Org\n•\nLine Item Text\n•\nTax Code\n•\nContract Workspace ID\n•\nContract\n48\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nPurchasing an Item', page_no=48, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('8efaca7d-bf66-455e-8aaf-4b981c44c985'), chunk_index=232, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619427, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="\ue05c\xa0Note\nIf you're using contracts for the item or service, you can find the contract number by selecting\nContract\nBrowse all\n. Avoid using the recent-contracts list, because it could contain contracts for other suppliers.\n•\nOther Limit\nAdding Approvers and Watchers\nWhen a purchase requisition is created, approvers and watchers are automatically assigned to the approval flow", page_no=49, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2144a1d5-532d-4d3c-a37f-3d1bf74fbe22'), chunk_index=233, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619431, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="but you can also add additional approvers and watchers to the approval flow.\nContext\nAn approver is anyone who has the authority to approve or deny a request. A watcher is someone who can't\napprove or deny a request, but is notified of the request's progress. Any user who can view a request can add", page_no=49, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('be38adb7-ad12-43ba-aca3-2d49a4f4dede'), chunk_index=234, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619435, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='or remove approvers and watchers from the approval flow. You can also add groups as additional approvers and\nwatchers to purchase requisitions, but not to other document types, such as forms or invoices. Consider the\nfollowing when working with approval flows:\n•\nYou can add or remove approvers and watchers when the request is in Composing or Submitted state.\n•', page_no=49, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d423c06a-eb72-42b5-921d-8f37cf9e3d79'), chunk_index=235, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619439, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="You can't change the list of approvers or watchers after the request reaches Approved state.\n•\nYou can't add approvers or watchers if the purchase requisition is in Denied state.\n•\nYou can add approvers or watchers before or after the active approver.\n•\nYou can only delete users that were manually added to the approval flow. You can't delete users that were\nautomatically added to the approval flow.\n•", page_no=49, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('8fd1ec26-aadb-4c4c-9612-9efaa36df9a2'), chunk_index=236, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619443, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="If you're editing a request that has already been partially approved, you can't remove users or groups who have\nalready approved it.\n•\nIf the request has been denied, you can't add users or groups to the approval flow. You must withdraw the\nrequest first and then add them.\nProcedure\n1.\nGo to the home page and choose one of the following:\n•", page_no=49, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('29b982ca-3a6f-421c-b3c1-ce9c26311169'), chunk_index=237, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619447, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Click Your approvalsYou can add or remove additional approvers and watchers when the request is in for\nrequests that are waiting for your approval, that you're watching, or that you recently approved.\n•\nClick Your requests for requests you're currently composing or have already submitted.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nItems are sorted by the date they were last changed.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nPurchasing an Item\nPUBLIC\n49", page_no=49, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('8d710b98-ad31-4468-90bb-fc682567a1e2'), chunk_index=238, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619500, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='2. Click a request that is in Composing or Submitted state.\n3. To add additional approvers or watchers to the Approval Flow:\na. Hover your pointer over a dotted line in the approval flow. Guided buying displays a plus symbol (\ue058\xa0) in the\nflow, indicating where the new approvers or watchers can be added, as shown in the following figure.', page_no=50, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('bbf7c272-220e-4a92-ab3b-9e416af60ab5'), chunk_index=239, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619504, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='b. Click the plus symbol (+) to display the Add approval request window.\nc. Select Approver or Watcher. Optionally, enter a reason for adding the additional approvers or watchers.\nd. Search for a user or group, or scroll down in the list until you see it.\ne. Click Choose beside the user or group.\nf.\nClick Add to add the user or group.', page_no=50, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a49e4eaa-3430-46f2-8578-961ec57a04bc'), chunk_index=240, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619508, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='4. To remove approvers or watchers from the Approval Flow:\na. Click the "X" symbol (\n) next to an approver or watcher, as shown in the following figure.\nb. Click Remove.\nResults\nGuided buying adds or removes the approver or watcher from the Approval Flow.\nIf you added an approver before the current approver, guided buying removes the request from the current', page_no=50, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('341d432a-ff1c-4b08-a7f6-a58a22901e80'), chunk_index=241, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619511, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="approver's To approve list and the added approver becomes the current approver. Then, as the request progresses\nthrough the Approval Flow, guided buying skips users who already approved it.\n50\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nPurchasing an Item", page_no=50, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('655f16be-0dd2-42f6-a4b2-2dda1fecb719'), chunk_index=242, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619599, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Inventory Items\nYou might be allowed to request items from inventory, which are items stocked by your organization, such as MRO\n(Maintenance, Repair, and Operations) items or items your organization manufactures.\nUse the same procedure to request inventory items as you do for regular items. These requests go through the\nregular approval flow and can be copied and saved as favorites.', page_no=51, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a6ccee3c-1b53-4730-8621-1e28c6a89c8a'), chunk_index=243, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619603, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='When you search for inventory items, you see the available quantity of each item and you can choose specific\nstorage locations when ordering. You can request a quantity greater than the available quantity.\nAfter these requests are fully approved, guided buying converts them to reservation documents and sends them\nto external systems for routing to your inventory department. The request details page displays the reservation', page_no=51, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('cd0cf1f8-ea15-4307-9cdf-8c2e9b21d1cc'), chunk_index=244, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619607, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="number for the inventory items generated by the external system.\nRestrictions\nInventory items have the following restrictions:\n•\nInventory items don't display a supplier or cost.\n•\nYou can cancel inventory items after ordering, but you can't change or edit them.\n•\nYou can't add inventory items to a change request; if you search the catalog for items to add to a change", page_no=51, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b1a71299-26c7-4ca2-be09-f845798237ea'), chunk_index=245, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619611, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='request, guided buying doesn\'t display any inventory items.\nSearch Results Page\nWhen guided buying displays inventory items in the Search results page:\n•\nThey display the term "Inventory item."\n•\nThey display Available qty and they have a Refresh link that retrieves the latest quantity, which is useful for\npopular items. If there are multiple storage locations, guided buying displays the combined quantity.\n•', page_no=51, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e9d0d450-d277-4015-9618-63ac80201f5c'), chunk_index=246, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619614, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='They display the Plant and Storage location (if there is more than one storage location, they display\n"Multiple"). Plant doesn\'t display if you have a plant selected in your profile or if you\'re buying on behalf of\na plant.\n•\nInstead of Add to cart button, there\'s a Select button, which selects the item, adds it to the cart, and reduces\nthe quantity available to other users.\n•', page_no=51, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a8bd76d9-3721-4a28-9d74-78494965efdf'), chunk_index=247, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619618, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='You can refine search results by setting In stock, Plant, or Storage location.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nInventory Items\nPUBLIC\n51', page_no=51, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c75cb497-0ac1-4d79-b11c-bc3d22e70e26'), chunk_index=248, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619694, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Item Details Page\nWhen guided buying displays inventory items in the Item details page:\n•\nThey contain no supplier information or Lead Time.\n•\nThey display Available qty and a Refresh link.\n•\nThey display the Storage location if there’s only one location. If there are multiple locations, they display\nWhich storage locations have this item? which displays all storage locations, available quantities, and allows', page_no=52, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('7a3303c9-14e8-406b-9cd7-618711b24a16'), chunk_index=249, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619698, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='you to divide the requested quantity among each location. Each storage location you choose creates a separate\nline item in the request.\n•\nThey contain a control for setting the Required-by Date. The date you select appears in the resulting request\nand it allows your inventory department to know when you need delivery of the items.\n•', page_no=52, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b69de228-7bc1-438b-b3f4-034e6054ba5b'), chunk_index=250, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619702, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='You can click Add to cart to start a request or Add to favorites to save it to your personal favorites list.\nShopping Cart Page\nWhen guided buying displays inventory items in the Shopping cart page:\n•\nThey display the Plant (unless you selected a plant in your profile or are buying on behalf of a plant) and\nrequested quantity. The quantity is not editable here.\n•', page_no=52, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('79fa4846-8878-468b-89e2-9b13c20817ef'), chunk_index=251, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619706, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='You can optionally divide the requested quantity among the available locations. Each storage location you\nchoose creates a separate line item in the request.\n•\nThey display "Reserved items from inventory are not charged to your account." and zero cost for inventory\nitems.\nCheckout Page\nWhen guided buying displays inventory items in the Checkout page:\n•\nAll inventory item information from the previous pages display in this page.\n•', page_no=52, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('894b3ad2-ae81-42cb-9583-de0dd2a7a8d1'), chunk_index=252, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619709, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Requests can contain both regular items and inventory items. Regular items display before inventory items.\n•\nEach storage location you choose creates a separate line item in the request.\n•\nInventory items don't have a Ship to address or a cost.\n52\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nInventory Items", page_no=52, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c2246c5e-74fa-40b7-ab6d-32268138f9dd'), chunk_index=253, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619762, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Requesting a Non-Catalog Item or Service\nIf you can't find the items you need by searching or browsing the customer catalog, you can create a non-catalog\nrequest. You complete a few fields to describe what you need so that a purchasing agent can locate and order the\nitems for you.\nContext\nWatch the interactive tutorial for step-by-step instructions; all tutorials are captioned exclusively in English:\nBuying Non-Catalog Items.", page_no=53, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('8244ae68-7533-4359-991d-2e47560de28c'), chunk_index=254, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619766, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Consider the following when you create a non-catalog request:\n•\nYour administrator might prevent you from ordering non-catalog items, in which case the Request a non-\ncatalog item option won't display.\n•\nYou can't create service requisitions containing hierarchical items using the Request a non-catalog item\noption.\n•\nYou can add a maximum of 200 line items and 100 comments per request.\n•", page_no=53, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a04d72ef-867e-4da3-83ed-3794d2747bc7'), chunk_index=255, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619770, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="If you use a custom line-item form, you can add a maximum of 20 line items per request.\n•\nNon-catalog requests might take longer to process than customer catalog orders.\n•\nIf your organization uses service orders and service sheets, you'll see both a Goods and Services form. If you\nsee only the Goods form, this means your organization allows only non-catalog requests for goods.", page_no=53, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('668fc292-0253-4494-a983-fe94f9c67f50'), chunk_index=256, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619774, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Guided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting a Non-Catalog Item or Service\nPUBLIC\n53', page_no=53, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('fa627abc-f873-45cc-81a3-3ed84ebdaf26'), chunk_index=257, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619858, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Procedure\n1.\nOn the right side of your dashboard, click\nQuick Links\nRequest a non-catalog item\nor the plus symbol\n(\ue058\xa0).\n2. Choose either the Goods or Services tab.\n\ue04c\xa0Tip\nIn most cases, if you're buying an item that will be delivered to you, choose Goods. If you're requesting a\nservice that will be performed, choose Services.", page_no=54, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('fbf3f838-d61f-4378-91bb-615fb6359fed'), chunk_index=258, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619863, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="3. In the Product name or Service name field, enter a name for the product or service you need.\n4. For the Category field, choose the category that most accurately describes what you're requesting.\nChoose Browse all from the dropdown menu to see all categories.\n5. Guided buying might display a Recommended alternatives from catalog carousel, which uses artificial", page_no=54, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4c7be2e9-469c-4c83-a9dc-2376e9cf0df2'), chunk_index=259, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619866, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='intelligence to find up to five items related to the item you entered. Ordering recommended items is simpler\nand faster than creating a non-catalog request.\nClick any item in the carousel to display more information and to add it to the cart.\n6. If you are requesting a service, use the calendar icon (\ue0ae\xa0) to choose a start date and end date.\n7.', page_no=54, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a5eacbff-bde0-45e2-9819-cf30ccff9141'), chunk_index=260, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619870, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Add a supplier to your non-catalog request:\n•\nTo order from a preferred supplier for the given category, choose one of the suppliers under\nRecommended suppliers for you.\n•\nClick View all suppliers to choose a supplier from your organization's list of suppliers. You can search by\nsupplier name or supplier keyword.\n8. Enter a detailed description of the good or service.", page_no=54, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2fa0b0e4-c48c-43d5-8c17-0a86fc54f43a'), chunk_index=261, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619874, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='9. If you are ordering a product, complete the Quantity and Unit of measure fields.\n10. Enter the price and currency for the good or service.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nThe default currency is derived from the country/region associated with your ship-to address or plant. For\nexample, if you have a ship-to country/region of the United States, your currency default to USD.\n11. Click Add to cart.', page_no=54, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('81c577a6-6afd-4154-8145-e51287304005'), chunk_index=262, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619878, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='12. After you add the first item to the shopping cart, you can click:\n54\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting a Non-Catalog Item or Service', page_no=54, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('453bba49-d1bc-48bc-8f84-e307e7c25fc0'), chunk_index=263, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619969, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Option\nDescription\nDone\nReturns to the home page\nMore options menu (\ue1f2\xa0) > Create\nnew\nClears the page and allows you to create another non-catalog line and add it to the\nshopping cart\nMore options menu (\ue1f2\xa0) > Copy\nLeaves the existing information on the page and allows you to edit it to create another\nnon-catalog line\n13. To check out, click Check out.', page_no=55, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4c347722-8fe8-42aa-a9dd-2da0605f2b51'), chunk_index=264, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619974, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="14. To see additional fields, click the right arrow to expand a line item. Edit fields that have incorrect information.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nIf you use contracts, select a contract number by clicking the Contract field and then clicking Browse all;\ndon't select one from the recent-contracts list, because it could contain contracts for other suppliers.\n15. Click Submit.", page_no=55, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e55f2996-30b3-4a2a-8cea-757ab570864c'), chunk_index=265, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619977, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='16. A confirmation dialog box displays. Click Done to go to the home page.\nNext Steps\nAfter you submit a request, you can check on the status periodically, see Finding the Status of Your Requests [page\n107].\nIf you need to withdraw a submitted request, choose Withdraw to stop the approval process and revert the', page_no=55, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a682763d-e502-423f-9cd6-f7345d4e37be'), chunk_index=266, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619981, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='document back to Composing state. You can leave a reason for withdrawing the request in theComments section.\nMitigating Risk for Non-Catalog Purchases [page 55]\nWorkflow for Non-Catalog Engagement Requests [page 57]\nRequesting a Non-Catalog Item with an Ad Hoc Vendor [page 61]\nMitigating Risk for Non-Catalog Purchases\nYour organization might allow you to mitigate potential risk with non-catalog purchases. The risk exposure score', page_no=55, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('29596c82-fae9-4072-9b98-2938661c73c8'), chunk_index=267, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619985, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='displays when you select a supplier for these purchases.\nThe risk exposure graphic could help your organization avoid using suppliers with high risk business practices, such\nas using forced labor, or production processes that cause environmental harm.\nThe level of risk associated with each supplier is based on recent activities; therefore, the supplier could be at a low', page_no=55, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ef9f0e0d-3ae4-4b2d-9ef2-3885eea95126'), chunk_index=268, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619989, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="risk level today, but change to a high risk level tomorrow. For example, if the supplier uses production practices that\nare harmful to the environment, and there's media coverage of it, the supplier's risk score could increase.\nThe risk exposure score displays on recommended suppliers at the bottom of a non-catalog request, as shown in\nthe following figure.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases", page_no=55, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('7b5a614c-a0b5-4e29-b3fb-52a1a18ca8e9'), chunk_index=269, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 619992, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Requesting a Non-Catalog Item or Service\nPUBLIC\n55', page_no=55, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ddfde121-c4ab-4d54-b574-a54a4a27026b'), chunk_index=270, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620013, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='If you select View all suppliers, the risk exposure level displays in the selection window, as shown in the following\nfigure.\nThe risk score (Low, Medium, High) is based on the average score for each risk type: Regulatory & Legal,\nEnvironmental & Social, Operational, and Financial. In the following figure, the overall score is Medium and each\nrisk type has its own level.\n56\nPUBLIC', page_no=56, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0eba6f0b-a27f-4a47-9dba-b68aedf6dfe6'), chunk_index=271, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620017, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Guided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting a Non-Catalog Item or Service', page_no=56, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('bb50f0c3-c9db-4a21-a7df-13e872f385d0'), chunk_index=272, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620102, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Each risk level is defined as:\n•\nLow: There is a low possibility of activities by the supplier that might have a negative impact on your\norganization's buying practices.\n•\nMedium: There is a moderate possibility of activities by the supplier that might have a negative impact on your\norganization's buying practices.\n•", page_no=57, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('098e3981-1925-4067-96f6-c95766b917ef'), chunk_index=273, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620106, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="High: There is a high possibility of activities by the supplier that might have a negative impact on your\norganization's buying practices.\n•\nUnknown: There isn't enough contributing factor activity to calculate the supplier's risk exposure.\nWorkflow for Non-Catalog Engagement Requests\nWhen you submit an engagement request, the supplier is evaluated by risk experts in SAP Ariba Supplier Risk.", page_no=57, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2cad303f-d5e8-44f0-b2e0-2d3dc0bf7d2b'), chunk_index=274, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620110, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Engagement requests examine suppliers on a deeper level and help your organization better mitigate risk.\nFollow these guidelines when working with engagement requests:\n•\nYou can submit, or link to, one engagement request in a purchase request; therefore, all items in the purchase\nrequest that require an engagement request must use the same supplier.', page_no=57, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6aa7e844-fc06-4bb5-b717-3eb3b27b75ac'), chunk_index=275, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620114, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Valid scenario: Line item 1 for Acme supplier requires an engagement request, line item 2 for Acme supplier\nrequires an engagement request, line item 3 for ABC supplier doesn't require an engagement request.\nInvalid scenario: Line item 1 for Acme supplier requires an engagement request, line item 2 for ABC supplier\nrequires an engagement request.\n•", page_no=57, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e4e4d4e6-12dd-46e0-8b21-a2973aac6a40'), chunk_index=276, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620118, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Engagement requests can't be used for purchase requisitions created from a request for quotation (RFQ).\n•\nIf you create a purchase requisition, and then select Change request to create another version, you can't link\nthe second version to an engagement request.\n•\nMultiple items on a purchase request could require an engagement request, and the engagement request", page_no=57, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('bf0ac807-9175-458d-a13b-e9ecb9d64236'), chunk_index=277, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620121, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='required for the first item might be different than the one required for the second item.\n•\nIf you can link to an existing engagement request, your purchase request might be processed faster.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nYou must belong to the groups named Supplier Risk Engagement Requestor and Purchasing User to create\nan engagement request.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting a Non-Catalog Item or Service\nPUBLIC\n57', page_no=57, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a19ac6bc-4a96-4fe0-8fd4-1bf9bde63c54'), chunk_index=278, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620168, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='The following is an example of a workflow for a non-catalog request that requires an engagement request.\n1.\nWhen you select a supplier, a notification appears if the purchase request requires an engagement request, as\nshown in the following figures.\nNotification on purchase request\nNotification on line items\n2. Upon checkout, you can handle the engagement request by doing one of the following:\n•', page_no=58, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b20e2210-4b6c-4c69-8b89-9078c8e99dd7'), chunk_index=279, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620172, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Create engagement request: If an engagement request for the chosen supplier doesn't exist, you'll need\nto create a new engagement request. You're taken to SAP Ariba Supplier Risk to start one.\n•\nLink existing engagement request: If an engagement request for the chosen supplier exists, you can\nlink to an existing engagement request. You can link to an engagement request that is in-progress or\ncompleted.", page_no=58, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('13176d23-5089-4e98-b8f2-897cc1dd2a9b'), chunk_index=280, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620176, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="3. Consider the following as you wait for an engagement request to get approved:\n•\nIf you edit a purchase request after you submit or link to an engagement request, you must also update the\nengagement request to match the changes you've made.\n58\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting a Non-Catalog Item or Service", page_no=58, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('245e355c-e2e4-4b3c-874f-17d788bc3a8c'), chunk_index=281, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620236, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="•\nYou can add items to a purchase request after the engagement request process has begun, but they must\nuse the same supplier.\n•\nThe status of the purchase request doesn't reflect the status of the engagement request. You must view\nthe purchase request to find the status of the engagement request.\n•\nIf a linked engagement request is denied or cancelled, you must create a new purchase request. Purchase", page_no=59, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e1193a28-5166-4f5a-afb5-b81590aedf59'), chunk_index=282, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620240, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="requests with denied engagement requests can't be edited and resubmitted.\n•\nYou don't receive a notification when the engagement request is approved.\n4. The progress of the engagement request in SAP Ariba Supplier Risk displays in guided buying. The status of\nthe engagement request could be any of the following:\n•\nEngagement request not yet submitted: The engagement request is in draft state; it was created and\nhasn't been submitted.", page_no=59, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('843f8d54-9c2d-4f61-9554-ea3d09b7835f'), chunk_index=283, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620244, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Engagement request not yet submitted\n•\nSubmitted: The engagement request has been submitted. If you make changes to the purchase request,\nyou can edit the engagement request when it's in Submitted status.\nEngagement request has been submitted\n•\nEngagement request is in approval: Due diligence tasks are complete and the engagement request has", page_no=59, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('890e8732-afd1-4240-84ee-b03953bc805b'), chunk_index=284, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620248, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='been submitted for approval. You can add additional items to the purchase request, but they must use the\nsame supplier.\nEngagement request is in approval\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting a Non-Catalog Item or Service\nPUBLIC\n59', page_no=59, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4abc2125-2844-4716-88a5-26d57258cc86'), chunk_index=285, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620274, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="•\nEngagement request has been denied: The engagement request was denied and you must create a new\npurchase request. You can't edit the engagement request or the associated purchase request when the\nengagement request has been denied.\nEngagement request has been denied\n•\nEngagement request fulfilled: The engagement request is approved and you can submit the purchase", page_no=60, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b1493cc4-afed-418a-979f-e0f5b3318e4b'), chunk_index=286, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620278, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='request. You can add items to the purchase request, but they must use the same supplier as the\nengagement request.\nEngagement request fulfilled\n60\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting a Non-Catalog Item or Service', page_no=60, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b3769d7c-f405-4682-9831-4e85110d5246'), chunk_index=287, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620365, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Requesting a Non-Catalog Item with an Ad Hoc\nVendor\nYou can use ad hoc vendors for non-catalog requests in guided buying.\nPrerequisites\nYour site must be configured to use ad hoc suppliers.\nContext\nAd hoc vendors are suppliers from your SAP Ariba Buying solution that can be be added as-needed without\nonboarding them in your system. When the Use Ad Hoc Supplier option is available on non-catalog requests, you', page_no=61, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c91adc6c-3f9d-4bc4-b5b4-731ab3d032da'), chunk_index=288, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620370, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='can choose from the ad hoc vendors available. When you use an ad hoc vendor, you must enter contact details for\nthe supplier. The contact details are used to complete the transaction.\nAd hoc vendors also use virtual card payments, which generate new virtual card numbers for each order and\ndisplay less banking information. Virtual cards offer secure transactions with new suppliers typically used for\none-time or infrequent purchases.', page_no=61, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('f765db5e-78af-4a74-b202-d7ab190dba3c'), chunk_index=289, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620373, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Consider the following when using ad hoc suppliers:\n•\nThe imported ad hoc vendor details, including their supplier locations, cannot be modified.\n•\nAd hoc vendors can be used to buy only goods using a non-catalog request form. They can't be used for\nservices. If you create a non-catalog request and choose an ad hoc vendor, categories associated with services\ncan't be selected.\n•", page_no=61, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('cd366408-266a-43f8-bb75-2795fc5cffdf'), chunk_index=290, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620377, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Requests with ad hoc vendors can have multiple line items, but all the line items must use ad hoc vendors.\n•\nAfter your request is submitted, approvers can change the ad hoc supplier and the contact details before the\nrequest is approved.\n•\nSupplier selection policies configured in guided buying don't effect which ad hoc suppliers are available.\nProcedure\n1.\nOn your dashboard, choose\nQuick Links\nRequest a non-catalog item", page_no=61, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e78be827-9b74-4701-8f2a-e5a390018318'), chunk_index=291, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620381, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="or the plus symbol (\ue058\xa0).\n2. Choose the Goods tab.\n3. In the Product name field, enter a name for the product you need.\n4. For the Category field, choose the category that most accurately describes what you're requesting.\nChoose Browse all from the dropdown menu to display all categories.\n5. In the Description field, enter a description for the product you need.", page_no=61, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('69d99c71-4b5e-4586-a5a3-94be1a5d3110'), chunk_index=292, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620385, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Guided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting a Non-Catalog Item or Service\nPUBLIC\n61', page_no=61, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c001733d-58a3-40dd-bced-b8709d68c3aa'), chunk_index=293, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620455, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="6. To use an ad hoc supplier, choose the Use Ad Hoc Supplier check box, and then select the supplier you want to\nuse.\n7.\nTo add contact information for the ad hoc supplier, choose Add Contact and enter the following contact\ninformation:\n\ue04c\xa0Tip\nYou can search for existing supplier contact information by entering the supplier's email address. If the", page_no=62, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('fd3cbb79-e607-4b35-8dd7-2ed7659f8171'), chunk_index=294, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620459, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="supplier's contact information was used for a previous request, the information will display.\n•\nEmail ID\n\ue201\xa0Caution\nThe Email ID can't contain the plus symbol (+).\n•\nName\n•\nAddress 1\n•\nCity\n•\nState/Province\n•\nZip code\n•\nCountry/Region\nClick Add.\n\ue04c\xa0Remember\nEntering the correct contact information ensures timely payment and reduces the risk of payment failure", page_no=62, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ac43b29e-6371-4950-bb20-4c880c223519'), chunk_index=295, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620463, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='or delays. This information also provides a record of the transaction, which supports audit and compliance\nrequirements.\n8. Choose Add to cart.\n9. After you add the first item to the shopping cart, you can choose:\nOption\nDescription\nDone\nReturns to the home page\nMore options menu (\ue1f2\xa0) > Create\nnew\nClears the page and allows you to create another non-catalog line and add it to the\nshopping cart', page_no=62, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b924b56d-75a5-489a-adee-a9cb5d74f636'), chunk_index=296, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620467, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='More options menu (\ue1f2\xa0) > Copy\nLeaves the existing information on the page and allows you to edit it to create another\nnon-catalog line\n10. To check out, choose Check out.\n11. To see additional fields, choose the right arrow to expand a line item. Edit fields that have incorrect information.\n12. Choose Submit.\n13. A confirmation dialog box displays. Choose Done to go to the home page.\n62', page_no=62, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('256f4fa3-0381-4cbb-91ac-a5394a18e49e'), chunk_index=297, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620471, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='PUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting a Non-Catalog Item or Service', page_no=62, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('9b10e88d-1b4b-4a02-b3a2-56790fa61e11'), chunk_index=298, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620548, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Creating a Request for Limit Items\nYou can add enhanced limit items (category E) to requests and send these requests to SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public\nEdition.\nContext\nIn the Guided Buying Capability with SAP Ariba Buying (2NV) integration scenario, buyers can add limit items\nin guided buying requests for goods and lean services that correspond to the item category E in SAP S/4HANA', page_no=63, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('64b85e1e-3998-4057-85aa-8d4f66f4144e'), chunk_index=299, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620552, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Cloud Public Edition. Limit items are procured without following the goods receipt and the service sheet processes.\nThe requests for limit items are characterized by validity periods to define the effective dates of the procurement\nprocess and predefined amount limits to control item prices.\nProcedure\n1.\nSearch the catalog for the limit item.\n\ue04c\xa0Tip', page_no=63, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('01dff345-81b8-494f-b7fe-3dfa06e69e7b'), chunk_index=300, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620556, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Limit items display the This is a limit item checkbox. To procure a limit item as a non-limit item, deselect\nthe checkbox. If the checkbox isn't available, the item doesn't qualify as a limit item.\n2. Check the This is a limit item checkbox and enter the following information:\n•\nStart date\n•\nEnd date\n•\nExpected value\n•\nOverall limit\nClick Add to add the item to your cart.", page_no=63, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('438006e3-0c3c-4754-b1e9-883d48ed6aeb'), chunk_index=301, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620560, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="3. If you can't find the catalog limit item, create a non-catalog request for a limit item:\na. From the home page, choose\nQuick Links\nRequest a non-catalog item\n.\nb. Choose the Goods or Services tab.\nc. In the Product name or Service name field, enter a name for the product or service you need.", page_no=63, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('62fb864c-2e13-4b4f-822d-bfac6d4d7f58'), chunk_index=302, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620564, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="d. In the Category field, choose a category that describes what you're requesting. If the category is mapped\nto a commodity code applicable to limit items, enter the Start date, End date, Expected value, and\nOverall limit values.\ne. Optional: Add a supplier.\nf.\nClick Add to cart.\n4. After you've finished adding items to your request, click Check out.", page_no=63, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('7e665b7a-cfb1-443f-a6d5-532e774feab3'), chunk_index=303, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620567, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='5. Review the details on the checkout page, and then click Submit.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nCreating a Request for Limit Items\nPUBLIC\n63', page_no=63, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('83d6dcd3-2a34-4c67-96e5-1406e3dd486f'), chunk_index=304, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620604, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='\ue05c\xa0Note\nUsers in time zones outside of GMT may not be able to submit requisitions with service line items to SAP\nS/4HANA when the service start date is the current date. To ensure that users can submit requisitions\nwith the current date as the service start date, enable the Allow current date as start date for service\nitems (Application.Purchasing.S4Hana.AllowCurrentDateAsStartDateForServiceItems)', page_no=64, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('be0a6e6d-baf7-441f-8d2f-d0cfbb3985db'), chunk_index=305, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620608, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='parameter. For more information, see Allow current date as start date for service items.\nA confirmation dialog box displays. Click Done to return to the home page.\nResults\nGuided buying sends the data on the request to SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition. A purchase requisition is\ncreated in SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition.\nRelated Information', page_no=64, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d64bf09e-cef4-4493-b7a3-1049c23c5585'), chunk_index=306, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620612, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Sending Limit Items in Guided Buying Requests to SAP S/4HANA or SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition\n64\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nCreating a Request for Limit Items', page_no=64, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('bbb91a6a-a1cf-4987-bbd2-02886d94bd31'), chunk_index=307, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620691, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Creating a Standing Order\nYou can create standing orders in guided buying for goods and services configured as limit items or services inSAP\nERP and SAP S/4HANA.\nContext\nYou can use standing orders for recurring orders for low-value items and routine services. The goods or services\navailable for standing orders are procured without following the goods receipt and the service sheet processes.', page_no=65, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('418d2595-ce3b-4851-9bd9-503ef99e2f6f'), chunk_index=308, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620695, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='These orders have validity periods and predefined amounts to limit time period and item pricing. When you submit\nthese orders, you request a limit item.\nWhen you create a standing order, the first item added to your cart must qualify for a standing order, or display the\nThis is a standing order checkbox. If your administrator configured customer catalog searches, after you add the', page_no=65, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d55598c0-c45a-4e4f-96b3-fcdf11a5da14'), chunk_index=309, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620699, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="first limit item to your cart, any subsequent searches return only limit items. For more information, see Configuring\nCustomer Catalog Searches for Standing Orders.\nStanding orders can have more than one item, but they must be limit items. When you create a standing order, you\nmust specify the ordering period (start and end dates); the recurrence period (how often it's delivered); and the", page_no=65, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('583e6cf8-8a11-46b1-8dff-4fa51684df74'), chunk_index=310, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 620703, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='expected total cost. If you add more than one item to a standing order, the specified dates for the first item apply to\neach subsequent item.\nProcedure\n1.\nSearch the catalog for the limit item to create the standing order.\n\ue04c\xa0Tip\nLimit items display the This is a limit item checkbox. To procure a limit item as a non-limit item, deselect', page_no=65, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('042fdef0-acea-4bcc-bcea-328c1eec7cbf'), chunk_index=311, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621038, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="the checkbox. If the checkbox isn't available, the item doesn't qualify as a limit item.\n2. Check the This is a standing order checkbox and enter the following information:\n•\nStart date\n•\nEnd date\n•\nExpected amount\n•\nMax amount\n•\nUnit of measure\n3. Enter the additional details required if you are adding a parametric item. For example, if you're adding a shirt,", page_no=65, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0c6755a5-c8e5-4d38-876a-ffd400a60a85'), chunk_index=312, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621047, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='you might be required to select its color and size.\n4. Click Add to cart. The item is added to your cart.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nCreating a Standing Order\nPUBLIC\n65', page_no=65, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e1b54ac4-8256-40fe-9ff1-423dfc8f3645'), chunk_index=313, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621129, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="\ue04c\xa0Remember\nStanding orders only allow you to order 1 of each item.\n5. If you can't find the limit item in the catalog, create a non-catalog limit item request:\na. From the home page, choose\nQuick Links\nRequest a non-catalog item\n.\nb. Choose the Goods or Services tab.\nc. In the Product name or Service name field, enter a name for the product or service you need.", page_no=66, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0f119c70-8fc1-4c1f-9c73-1c25d58520a0'), chunk_index=314, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621134, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='d. For the Category field, choose a category that describes your request. Categories that qualify for standing\norders display the This is a standing order checkbox.\ne. Check the This is a standing order checkbox, enter the Start date, End date, Expected amount, and Max\namount.\nf.\nOptional: Add a supplier.\ng. Comments: Specify the recurrence period, or how often the item or service should be delivered. For', page_no=66, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b3e290c7-1f6a-41aa-a809-e8335370d296'), chunk_index=315, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621138, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='example, "Deliver this item every 2 weeks until the specified end date." The supplier delivers based on the\ninstructions provided in this section.\nh. Click Add to cart.\n6. After you\'ve finished adding items to your request, click Check out.\n7.\nReview the details on the checkout page, and then click Submit.\nA confirmation dialog box displays. Click Done to return to the home page.\nNext Steps', page_no=66, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b202087d-2612-41dc-9d8b-043cc9c393e1'), chunk_index=316, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621142, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='After you submit a request, you can check on the status [page 107] periodically.\nA Withdraw button in the request allows you to stop the approval process and revert the document to Composing\nstate. When you withdraw a document, you can enter comments that are added to its Comments section.\nRelated Information\nFinding an Item or Service [page 28]\n66\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases', page_no=66, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ae7f77ee-86cb-4a25-8fee-44d36d73df21'), chunk_index=317, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621145, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Creating a Standing Order', page_no=66, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c8de622a-1963-4555-b837-4c1deac28e61'), chunk_index=318, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621230, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Favorite Items\nYou can create lists containing your favorite items so you can quickly add them to requests. Favorites lists are\nstored in the Favorites tab on your home page.\nFavorites makes it easy to select frequently purchased items. You can add customer catalog items, items from\nsuppliers' external sites, line item forms, or request forms to your favorites lists.", page_no=67, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('dcb1845f-4c9b-4802-bd44-a0dab5a90f4c'), chunk_index=319, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621234, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='You can create multiple favorites lists. For example, you might create a list named "New Hire Onboarding" for items\nfor new employees, and another list named "Copier Supplies" for items for the copy room. Each list can have an\nunlimited number of items and forms.\nAdding an Item to a Favorites List [page 67]\nChoosing an Item from a Favorites List [page 68]\nAdding an Item to a Favorites List', page_no=67, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6a76dbe0-db34-4106-9947-c6a7c9f3ce3e'), chunk_index=320, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621238, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Add an item to a favorites list to make it easy to find so you can buy it again, later.\nContext\nWhen there are items that you buy frequently or that you want to group together, add them to a favorites list to\nmake them easy to find and purchase. You can create as many favorites lists as you want. The first time you add a', page_no=67, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('dc3af44b-0907-494b-8ea6-7b2f2428af23'), chunk_index=321, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621242, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="favorite item, you'll create a new favorites list. You can add customer catalog items, items from suppliers' external\nsites, line item forms, and request forms.\n\ue094\xa0Restriction\nFavorites lists have the following limitations:\n•\nYou can't add spot buy items, single and multi-line RFQ forms that are composed of multiple form\ncomponents, custom forms, project forms, or externally managed forms to favorites lists.\n•", page_no=67, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('70114ceb-0174-4392-9672-965f7003ad01'), chunk_index=322, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621245, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="You can't share favorites lists with other users; your favorites lists can be used only by you.\n•\nYou can't add items to favorites lists when you're buying on behalf of other users.\nProcedure\n1.\nSelect a customer catalog item or form.\n2. Click \ue065\xa0 Add to favorites.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nFavorite Items\nPUBLIC\n67", page_no=67, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('8052a94e-1695-431d-81bf-b85f3757074b'), chunk_index=323, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621323, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='3. In the Add this item to... box, choose a favorites list through either of the following methods:\n•\nTo start a new list, click Create new list, enter a new list name, and click Add.\n•\nTo use an existing list, select it. You can select multiple lists at one time.\n\ue05c\xa0Note', page_no=68, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ad128a26-f3dd-4ddd-87dc-175629485edc'), chunk_index=324, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621327, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='If the selected item already exists in the list, guided buying displays "Item is already in list." Items can\'t\nappear more than once in a list\n•\nIf you have many lists, you can find one by entering its name in the Filter lists box.\n4. Click Add.\nResults', page_no=68, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('079e701d-8492-4f2e-94be-984ac4a5b1f3'), chunk_index=325, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621331, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='The item is added to the favorites list. You can then add it to requests in the current session or later sessions.\nThe star icon (\ue065\xa0) next to the Add to favorites link is filled in to indicate that the item is in at least one favorites list.\nHovering your mouse pointer over the Add to favorites link displays the favorites lists to which the item has been\nadded.', page_no=68, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('7735f3a0-6e43-4e37-b0f9-1e0ef09b8a28'), chunk_index=326, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621335, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Next Steps\nTo delete an item from a favorites list, click Your favorites on your home page, hover your pointer over the item, and\nclick the "X" that appears in the upper right corner. To delete an entire favorites list, click the delete (\ue03d\xa0) icon that\ndisplays to the right of the list name.\nChoosing an Item from a Favorites List', page_no=68, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('60bf9627-8afc-4def-8d18-e328960d2f20'), chunk_index=327, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621339, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Items in a favorites list can include customer catalog items, items from a supplier's external site, line item and\nnon-catalog request forms.\nContext\nUse a favorites list to quickly add frequently purchased items to requests.\n\ue094\xa0Restriction\nFavorites lists have the following limitations when choosing items:\n•\nPerforming a customer catalog search doesn't find favorite items. Instead, find them by viewing your\nfavorites lists.\n68\nPUBLIC", page_no=68, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d8a9c6c6-afc6-4ef6-8826-a03335bc1d6b'), chunk_index=328, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621343, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Guided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nFavorite Items', page_no=68, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('9efa0390-3d9c-4ff0-a764-c8afe0062ada'), chunk_index=329, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621376, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="•\nYou can't use favorites lists when you're buying on behalf of other users.\nProcedure\n1.\nOn the home page, click Your favorites.\n2. Select an item by doing any of the following:\n•\nFor customer catalog items, click Add to cart.\n•\nFor items from a supplier's external site, click Buy from supplier. Guided buying sends you to the", page_no=69, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('59dec988-8c65-459a-8564-de0cc926a9e8'), chunk_index=330, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621380, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='supplier\'s website to view and configure the item. Click the site\'s "Add to Cart" or "Check Out" button\nto add the item to your request in guided buying.\n•\nFor line item or request forms, click the tile.\nResults\nYour favorite item is added to your cart in guided buying.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nFavorite Items\nPUBLIC\n69', page_no=69, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('bdf80880-5ef2-431a-bc4c-b95828fc0e65'), chunk_index=331, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621452, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Making a Repeat Purchase by Copying a\nRequest\nIf you frequently reorder the same items, you can speed up the ordering process by copying one of your previous\nrequests.\nContext\nYou can copy a request regardless of its status. The approval flow for the copied request is determined based on the\ninformation you update in the new request. For example, if you increase the quantity in the request, the Approval', page_no=70, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('67b5a659-8721-47ec-a524-0bd969f0f784'), chunk_index=332, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621456, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Flow section might include additional approvers.\nWhen you copy a request, we recommend checking the following information:\n•\nThe requester (On behalf of field) is copied and validated. You'll see an error message if the requester is no\nlonger with your organization.\n•\nSupplier information is validated. You'll see an error message for any invalid fields.\n•", page_no=70, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('1d4bfa62-f7e2-4c59-a5f5-188abfc2364b'), chunk_index=333, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621460, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="For service items, the following details are copied, and you might need to update them before you submit the\nrequest: expected and maximum amounts, service start and end dates, and child items and their amounts.\nThe following information isn't copied from the previous request to the new request:\n•\nDelay purchase until\n•\nNeed-by date\n•\nComments\n•\nAttachments\n•\nItems from supplier external sites\n\ue05c\xa0Note", page_no=70, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('597bbeec-660b-4959-9453-4214db3d684b'), chunk_index=334, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621463, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="You need to manually click the item from the supplier external site again and check out from the supplier's\nwebsite to add it to your request.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nWhen copying an existing requisition, for example, using the Buy again option, Spot Buy items are not copied to\nthe new requisition. To re-purchase a Spot Buy marketplace item, you must add the item to your cart directly", page_no=70, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e4d28937-1722-40e6-90bd-53c140909263'), chunk_index=335, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621467, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='from a Spot Buy catalog search.\nProcedure\n1.\nOn the home page perform one of the following actions:\n70\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nMaking a Repeat Purchase by Copying a Request', page_no=70, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('41ce73df-9a9e-4266-a4e8-1d37e462645d'), chunk_index=336, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621501, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='•\nChoose Your requests and click a request from the list.\n•\nChoose a request from the Recent requests box on the right.\n2. Click the more options menu (\ue1f2\xa0) at the top of the request and choose Buy again, and then click Buy again in\nthe popup to confirm the action.', page_no=71, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4dc9e7b0-b649-4fdc-85cc-fda8263751b2'), chunk_index=337, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621505, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='You are taken to the Checkout page. The request title adds "Copy of" to the beginning of the original request\'s\ntitle.\n3. Click Submit to send the new request as it is, or update some of the details before submitting it.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nWhen you view the submitted request, the History section shows that you created this request as a copy of\nanother request.', page_no=71, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('42e0cf38-270b-4214-99a2-b762d58fea5e'), chunk_index=338, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621509, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Guided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nMaking a Repeat Purchase by Copying a Request\nPUBLIC\n71', page_no=71, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('35342d21-f945-4306-bbc7-7e70e3a4cd96'), chunk_index=339, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621566, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Copying and Saving Items on a Request\nYou organization might allow you to copy request line items and save requests for future use on the checkout page.\nContext\nCopying line items is especially useful in the following cases:\n•\nWhen you're requesting multiple non-catalog items that have minimal differences.\n•\nWhen you're ordering the same customer catalog item but need to ship the items to different locations.", page_no=72, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ef8a8aa4-33c6-4047-8eb8-c59e5c1090aa'), chunk_index=340, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621570, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Saving a request empties your shopping cart and allows you to keep multiple requests in Composing status. You\ncan access saved requests on the Your requests page.\nProcedure\n1.\nChoose an item from the customer catalog or request a non-catalog item, and then click Add to cart.\n2. Click Check out.', page_no=72, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6c8bd26d-04d8-449a-8cb6-5b167ce6ec9f'), chunk_index=341, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621574, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='3. In the upper right corner of the item on the checkout page, click the more options menu (\ue1f2\xa0) and choose Copy.\nThe new line item is added below the original line item.\n4. Update any of the information on the copied line item.\n5. To save the request and submit it later, click Save & exit at the top of the page.', page_no=72, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('3d3e992a-6889-4bea-9b64-acde7349dc69'), chunk_index=342, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621577, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='You are returned to the home page of the customer catalog.\nResults\nTo access your saved requests:\n1.\nOn the home page, choose Your requests.\n2. Access one of the requests in Composing status. These requests display at the top of the list.\n72\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nCopying and Saving Items on a Request', page_no=72, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('12172dfd-3758-459c-9f9d-428a4719958c'), chunk_index=343, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621622, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Requesting Quotes from Suppliers\nBased on the type of item and amount you need, your organization might allow you to request a quote from one or\nmore suppliers.\nContext\nWatch the interactive tutorial for step-by-step instructions; all tutorials are captioned exclusively in English:\nRequesting Quotes.\nYour purchasing department might have designed forms for certain types of purchases. You can find these forms', page_no=73, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0d431137-cd01-40b0-b948-e11bd3e72f34'), chunk_index=344, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621626, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="by searching or browsing the catalog. When you open one, you'll see instructions that explain how to fill it out.\nBased on the type of item you're requesting, the category and suppliers might already be chosen.\nAfter you complete the form, a request for quotation (RFQ) is created automatically. In some cases, you might be", page_no=73, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('3a9eacc9-2bfb-420c-a694-5d98ab3aeae6'), chunk_index=345, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621630, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='in charge of accepting a quote from a particular supplier. After a supplier provides a quote and you accept it, you\nsubmit a purchase request for people in your organization to approve (for example, your supervisor or someone in\nthe purchasing department). The resulting purchase order is sent to the supplier to fulfill.', page_no=73, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('44b10e2c-a9b6-45f4-86ba-f424d97fc94e'), chunk_index=346, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621634, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='If you decide not to move forward with your RFQ, you can cancel it by clicking Cancel request. The RFQ moves to\nCanceled status.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting Quotes from Suppliers\nPUBLIC\n73', page_no=73, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c938ed31-472a-42e6-9025-531ebc2de892'), chunk_index=347, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621676, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="\ue05c\xa0Note\nYou can cancel RFQs in Awaiting quotes or Awaiting award status. You can't cancel awarded RFQs.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nYou can use on-behalf-of (OBO) by user and company code functionality for RFQs. They don't support on-\nbehalf-of by purchasing unit or plant. The RFQ is created by the user or company code that you chose.", page_no=74, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('53a536fc-6bec-4a4f-8af1-0dc3b6a2e9b5'), chunk_index=348, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621680, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="When you award the RFQ, the award uses the on-behalf-of context of the RFQ. For more information about\non-behalf-of functionality, see Buying on Behalf of Another User, Company Code, Purchasing Unit, or Plant\n[page 92].\nRFQ forms might allow you to request up to 10 line items.\nProcedure\n1.\nSearch or browse your organization's customer catalog to find the required form for your purchase.", page_no=74, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('36d07f1c-002c-4970-9d7b-d58f6f70ecf2'), chunk_index=349, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621684, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='2. Click the form title to open the form.\nThe Request for quote page shows the form type, form description, and fields that you need to complete. The\ndescription gives more details about the form with instructions for how to complete it.\n74\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting Quotes from Suppliers', page_no=74, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('f7e25a4c-0166-4514-a44e-b85efe8db059'), chunk_index=350, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621689, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Guided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting Quotes from Suppliers\nPUBLIC\n75', page_no=75, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('5e58bf00-e389-497e-9f48-f0fc972606e0'), chunk_index=351, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621765, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='\ue05c\xa0Note\nThe default currency on the form is derived from the country/region of your ship-to address or plant. For\nexample, if you have a ship-to country/region of the United States, your currency defaults to USD.\n3. Fill in all the required fields (including the title) and any optional fields. Titles can contain up to 60 characters.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nA red asterisk (*) indicates that a field is required.', page_no=76, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('55b99fdc-f263-490d-8770-22855db8d461'), chunk_index=352, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621769, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="When you create a purchase requisition from the quote later, you won't be able to change the following values:\n•\nCommodity code\n•\nMaterial group\n•\nQuantity\n•\nUnit price\n•\nUnit of measure\n•\nSupplier\n4. If the Estimated budget field displays, enter the approximate total target price of all line items in the RFQ,", page_no=76, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('3e1ce623-5e00-4e41-b85a-001f9cd4f56f'), chunk_index=353, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621773, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="which can't exceed the estimated budget value. Your organization might share this information with suppliers.\nClick the same as total target price checkbox to set estimated budget to the RFQ total target price value.\nIt erases any value you entered in the Estimated budget field and uses the sum of each item's target price,\ninstead.", page_no=76, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('40b5b87e-9933-4b28-aaf5-2f70bbb659d5'), chunk_index=354, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621777, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='5. The Respond by date field specifies the deadline for supplier responses. The RFQ event closes at midnight (in\nyour time zone) of the date you specify.\n6. An Add related items list might display on the right-hand side of the form. To add one of those items to your', page_no=76, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('20d76c3f-4e29-470c-8f72-e58747b97ca0'), chunk_index=355, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621780, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='RFQ, click the plus symbol (+) for that item. You can remove it from the RFQ by clicking the delete button (\ue03d\xa0)\nthat displays next to it.\n7.\nIf a line item has a Duplicate icon, you can click it to make a copy of the line item and then make changes to the\ncopy. RFQs can contain up to 10 line items.', page_no=76, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('9665ddca-ede8-4ce8-b55b-adbb1c930ced'), chunk_index=356, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621784, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='8. If Next appears at the top of the page, click it to move to the second page of the form.\n76\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting Quotes from Suppliers', page_no=76, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('31ffb6d6-759e-4571-a38a-205ef35975c6'), chunk_index=357, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621836, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='9. If you have the option to choose suppliers, review the list of suppliers that your\norganization prefers or recommends for this type of purchase in the Suppliers section.\n•\nClick Invite supplier or Select to include a supplier in the RFQ. You can choose more than one supplier.\nClick Select all to include all suppliers.\n•', page_no=77, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('5a268114-59c2-4cfd-8b50-a91661089bd5'), chunk_index=358, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621840, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Click Uninvite or Unselect to remove a supplier from the RFQ. Click Unselect all to remove all suppliers.\n•\nIf available, click Show more suppliers to choose other potential suppliers to add to your RFQ.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nDepending on the type of purchase, your organization might require you to add a certain number of\npreferred suppliers to the RFQ.\n•', page_no=77, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('3e589346-e1b3-41fe-8cf5-b24192a0b996'), chunk_index=359, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621843, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Guided buying might rank each supplier with a percentage value based on your line items. To see more\ninformation about a supplier, click the down arrow below the supplier name. Guided buying displays\ncontact information, preferred and qualified commodities provided by that supplier, and any contracts\nyour organization has with that supplier. If a valid contract is available, guided buying automatically\nincludes its number in the RFQ.', page_no=77, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('9856ab94-f589-4310-a05b-9f82a1b56d91'), chunk_index=360, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621847, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="10. After you've filled in all the required fields and chosen your suppliers, click Request Quotes or Submit.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting Quotes from Suppliers\nPUBLIC\n77", page_no=77, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('1a188285-7c56-4108-a805-824fe3781b16'), chunk_index=361, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621918, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Results\nGuided buying can take up to three minutes to accept RFQs, because it must communicate with multiple systems\nto create the event, send line items, and add suppliers to invite. It then displays a confirmation that the RFQ was\nsubmitted successfully. Your request will be in Awaiting quotes status until you get a quote from a supplier.\nNext Steps', page_no=78, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d9e8418c-ebc5-44c9-a349-10332c176487'), chunk_index=362, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621922, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="After you submit the form, you can check on the status [page 107] periodically. You'll also be notified by email and\non your dashboard when suppliers respond with quotes, which moves the request to Awaiting award status. You\ncan click the link from the email or access the dashboard notification to review the quote from the supplier and\nchoose whether to accept the quote.", page_no=78, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a0e8debb-44d9-4f55-bc8c-d4d4de0d1a74'), chunk_index=363, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621926, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='After guided buying creates a purchase requisition, if the supplier included an attachment (such as an image,\ndocument, or spreadsheet) in the quote, you can view it by clicking the RFQ link in the requisition. Guided buying\nopens the RFQ and displays a link to the attachment in the Invited suppliers section.\nAfter creating an RFQ, you can:\n•\nSave an RFQ in Composing state [page 78]\n•', page_no=78, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('8e06a1a1-8416-4318-b90b-e2b566f3fbe8'), chunk_index=364, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621929, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Change an RFQ [page 80]\n•\nDuplicate an RFQ [page 88]\n•\nCancel an RFQ [page 89]\n•\nCompare bids and award quotes [page 81]\nRelated Information\nCreating a Team RFQ [page 155]\nSaving an RFQ in Composing State\nBefore submitting an RFQ, you can save it in Composing state for editing later.\nContext', page_no=78, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b7e4b2b3-11b8-499c-b057-5eb255b2d848'), chunk_index=365, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621933, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='RFQs that are complex or contain many items might require you to compose them over several sessions. Guided\nbuying allows you to save RFQs in Composing state for later editing and submission.\nYou can save RFQs without completing required forms. All your input and supplier selections are saved.\n78\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting Quotes from Suppliers', page_no=78, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('fdd7a34f-b5be-4a25-9b12-d55357916ce5'), chunk_index=366, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621963, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Procedure\n1.\nWhile editing an RFQ, click Save:\n2. Click either Continue editing to continue modifying the RFQ or Back to home to go to your home page.\nResults\nGuided buying saves a draft of the RFQ. You can perform other tasks in guided buying or sign out, and your RFQ\nremains available for editing.\nNext Steps', page_no=79, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('84c59249-9735-4dbe-aa71-4d420756fbe8'), chunk_index=367, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 621967, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='To continue editing the RFQ later, go to your Your requests page, click Quotes, and click the RFQ, which is in\nComposing state.\nAfter submitting the RFQ, you can no longer save it in Composing state, even if you change it by editing it.\nRelated Information\nChanging an RFQ [page 80]\nCancelling an RFQ [page 89]\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting Quotes from Suppliers\nPUBLIC\n79', page_no=79, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6d7ef8b9-0495-4477-b2ab-1c637fc65a11'), chunk_index=368, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622019, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Changing an RFQ\nYou can change self-service RFQs after they reach Request sent state. Changing an RFQ sends an email\nnotification to suppliers who have submitted a bid for the original RFQ version.\nPrerequisites\nGuided buying allows changes for new multi-line RFQs, not legacy single-line RFQs. Your organization must have\nimplemented new multi-line RFQs to use this feature.\n\ue05c\xa0Note', page_no=80, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4438891f-2858-48b3-bc5d-7b9773fa62ad'), chunk_index=369, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622023, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="You can change only self-service RFQs; you can't change low-touch, high-touch, or sourcing request RFQs.\nRFQs must be in either Request sent or Receive quotes state. You can't change them after they reach Awarded or\nRequisition completed state.\nContext\nYou can change information in RFQs after they've been published to suppliers. For example, you can change\ndescriptions or quantities, change the RFQ end date, or invite additional suppliers.\nProcedure\n1.", page_no=80, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('cb646f80-b8f5-4647-83b7-651cea678b7d'), chunk_index=370, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622027, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Click Your requests and find the RFQ you want to change. (You can change RFQs after they reach Request\nsent state.)\n2. In the RFQ, click Edit request:\n3. Make any changes you need.\nFor more information about editing RFQ fields, see How to get quotes.\nYou can't save these RFQs in Composing state for editing later.\n4. When you've finished editing the RFQ, click Submit.\n80\nPUBLIC", page_no=80, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('f22ae8a1-f406-4b68-b203-12be583deff1'), chunk_index=371, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622030, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Guided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting Quotes from Suppliers', page_no=80, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('9eb5f7e6-3552-4ac7-b40a-1f6e6a757f4d'), chunk_index=372, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622107, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='To undo your changes, click the more menu (\ue1f2\xa0) and choose Cancel edits. The RFQ goes back to the previous\nstate.\nResults\nIf your changes alter the scenario (such as changing the flow from self-service to low-touch), guided buying cancels\nthe original RFQ, creates a new RFQ containing the updated content, and assigns it a new RFQ number.\n\ue05c\xa0Note', page_no=81, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('9f31959d-3c92-4647-afb7-89e426ad8a95'), chunk_index=373, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622111, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Depending on the changes you make, guided buying might use a different policy and workflow than it used for\nthe original RFQ. For example, increasing the RFQ total amount might change the scenario from self-service\nto low-touch, requiring a different workflow. If the scenario changes, when you submit the RFQ guided buying\ndisplays a message indicating that the workflow changed.', page_no=81, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('db3f3431-53c8-479d-b728-390bf079dc02'), chunk_index=374, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622115, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="After you submit the changes, guided buying sends the RFQ to SAP Ariba Sourcing.\nRelated Information\nSaving an RFQ in Composing State [page 78]\nCancelling an RFQ [page 89]\nComparing Bids and Awarding Quotes\nAfter you submit an RFQ and it's approved, the suppliers you invite provide bids. You can monitor the RFQ event", page_no=81, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('1c910559-e7f7-41df-93d4-053a6ba15956'), chunk_index=375, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622119, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='to see bids as they are received, compare bids, award the business to a supplier, and create a purchase requisition\ncontaining the quote.\nContext\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nThis interface does not apply to legacy single-line RFQs or sourcing requests.\nGuided buying displays a complete view of your RFQ event and gives you a real-time graphic comparison of bids', page_no=81, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('3eb8b868-bde1-468b-a219-4563e177b373'), chunk_index=376, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622123, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='as suppliers submit them. For large or complex RFQs, you can use filters to narrow the view to specific suppliers,\nitems, or bidding terms. After the RFQ event ends, you compare bids, award the business to a supplier, and create a\nrequisition to purchase the quoted items or services.\nYour professional buying group can add or replace line items or suppliers as needed. They also might be able to', page_no=81, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('db6d2227-00af-41f5-8e5a-31bc8564e8cb'), chunk_index=377, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622126, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='perform multiple awarding (awarding an RFQ to multiple suppliers by quantity or percentage) and partial awarding\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting Quotes from Suppliers\nPUBLIC\n81', page_no=81, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('888df421-1ea7-4ea9-a253-7777d2704866'), chunk_index=378, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622187, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='(awarding only part of an RFQ to a supplier). Guided buying displays these awarding scenarios. It supports multiple\nawarding and partial awarding for new-style RFQs or sourcing requests, not for legacy single-line RFQs or sourcing\nrequests.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nIf your professional buying group takes over your RFQ, it monitors the RFQ event and awards suppliers. After', page_no=82, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('187a03ab-5dca-4905-8e7d-55582f1b7551'), chunk_index=379, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622191, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='the RFQ event ends, you can examine the awarded quote and create a requisition from it. In this case, legacy\nsingle-line RFQs display only awarded quotes and new-style, single- and multi-line RFQs display both awarded\nquotes and not-yet-awarded quotes.\nYour organization might allow suppliers to add items or services to their quotes and guided buying displays them', page_no=82, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('29103b0e-377f-4c8f-9bc2-8173eede7768'), chunk_index=380, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622195, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='in the RFQ results. For example, suppliers might add line items that make sense for the business scenario, such as\nspecialized services or parts recommended for an item. Or, they might offer a promotional item as part of their bid.\nAdditionally, your organization might allow suppliers to submit multiple bids for variations of their offerings. For', page_no=82, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('f00e9601-1c86-4877-824e-a211cc11f470'), chunk_index=381, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622199, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='example, they might provide three quotes for an item with one-, two-, and three-year warranties. Or, they might\noffer alternative bids with different term values, such as delivery time or quality.\nProcedure\n1.\nGo to Your requests and click the Quotes tab.\nAlternatively, you can click the notification bell icon (\ue23a\xa0) at the top of the guided buying window.\n2. Click the RFQ that you submitted.\n82\nPUBLIC', page_no=82, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('09d40332-fd8d-431f-ac74-eaa8ec200aa1'), chunk_index=382, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622203, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Guided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting Quotes from Suppliers', page_no=82, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a2cd932e-c5f0-4056-aff1-46a12eace61c'), chunk_index=383, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622248, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Guided buying displays the RFQ and its current status. The following figure shows the top section of an\nexample RFQ:\nEach step in the process flow displays information and instructions.\nBasic information about the RFQ displays below the process flow:\nField\nDescription\nRequester\nThe user who submitted the RFQ\nShip to\nThe ship to address for the requested items or services\nRespond by date', page_no=83, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0d3e7574-58c6-4848-85e1-827bec0b9676'), chunk_index=384, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622252, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="The date when suppliers can no longer provide bids. Bidding\nends at midnight (in the requester's time zone) on the\nspecified date.\nEstimated budget\nThe approximate budget entered by the requester for the\nitems or services\n3. Click Show details to see any comments that have been added to the RFQ by the requester or approvers.", page_no=83, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6be24a8c-c325-467e-87f2-fbbaa3428c66'), chunk_index=385, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622256, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='4. Scroll down to Supplier participation. This section displays a real-time count of suppliers that have\nparticipated so you can see the progress of the RFQ:\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting Quotes from Suppliers\nPUBLIC\n83', page_no=83, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('12125df9-1f88-4420-9867-80b37ee06e74'), chunk_index=386, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622292, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Participation field\nThe count of suppliers that have...\nParticipated\nSuccessfully submitted bids\nIntend to participate\nViewed the RFQ and indicated that they plan to bid\nDeclined\nViewed the RFQ, but do not plan to bid\nNo response\nNot viewed the RFQ\nThis section also lists supplier contact information so you can ask questions about the bids.', page_no=84, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ccc6e12f-e856-49c9-a630-5ea102ee55d2'), chunk_index=387, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622296, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='5. Click Show details to see the name of each supplier including contact information. Use this information if you\nneed to contact suppliers about their bids.\nThis section displays primary and alternate bids if suppliers provided multiple bids. For example, they might\nprovide three quotes for an item with one-, two-, and three-year warranties. Or, they might offer alternative bids\nwith different term values, such as delivery time or quality.', page_no=84, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2a85d1c9-91be-487d-941c-afba8c636798'), chunk_index=388, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622300, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='This section also displays the reason suppliers entered if they declined to bid.\n6. Scroll down to Overview:\n84\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting Quotes from Suppliers', page_no=84, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b6316638-46d1-4006-abf3-9d5e588b7a2c'), chunk_index=389, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622342, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='This section displays the bid graph, which is a comparison of all received bids. Complete bids (bids for all items\nin the RFQ) display in blue and incomplete bids (bids for only some of the items in the RFQ) display in orange. A\ntrophy icon displays for the lowest complete bid.\na. You can filter the displayed bids by supplier or rollup terms. If suppliers provided multiple bids, you can', page_no=85, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('aaa8f126-93ea-41c4-ac6b-8cad5a3af7d9'), chunk_index=390, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622346, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='select their primary bids or alternate bids.\nb. Click the download icon (\ue03a\xa0) to download the currently displayed bid graph in PNG format.\nc. Place your pointer over each bid to display bid details:\nBid detail field\nDescription\nTotal bid\nThe bid amount provided by the supplier\nUnder budget\nThe amount below your estimated amount\nSavings\nThe percentage below your estimated amount\nFulfillment', page_no=85, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('81dd6691-aa13-46b2-a4da-525bfbf9466f'), chunk_index=391, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622349, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='The bid quantity compared to your requested quantity\n7.\nScroll down to Compare bids:\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting Quotes from Suppliers\nPUBLIC\n85', page_no=85, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2eee8c33-609e-4552-a982-64c91f156851'), chunk_index=392, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622411, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='This section displays an interactive table for comparing bid details, including all RFQ items. Bid items and\nterms are hierarchical; expand them by clicking them.\nDepending on your configuration, suppliers might be able to add additional items to their bids. If they add\nitems they have a plus symbol (+) and the number of additional items below their names.', page_no=86, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('85591370-d48d-4044-8b37-f16ceb55a736'), chunk_index=393, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622415, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='a. You can filter the displayed bids by items, suppliers, or terms. Click Apply to display the results.\nb. Click Show advanced options for controls that allow you to filter by ranges of terms and display questions\nand outlying bids:\nOption\nDescription\nAdd range filter\nAllows you to filter displayed items by setting a minimum\nand maximum range for bidding terms, such as Price,', page_no=86, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6d02b092-c838-44fa-8772-63d068a6c7c3'), chunk_index=394, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622419, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Tax, or Shipping Cost. Items whose terms fall outside the\nspecified range to do not display. You can add multiple\nfilters, but only one filter per term. Remove a range filter\nby clicking the "x" symbol.\nShow Questions\n(Default = on) Displays terms of type "question"\nand supplier responses, including comments and\nattachments.\nShow outliers\nIf you add range filters, this control enables guided buying', page_no=86, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('7ada26f5-9f88-4fe2-bbed-177dbee18b3c'), chunk_index=395, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622423, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='to display bidding items that display outside the range.\nAfter changing Add range filter or Show Questions, click Apply to display the results.\nc. Click the download icon (\ue03a\xa0) to download the currently displayed table as a spreadsheet.\nd. For large or complex RFQs, click the next icons (\ue066\xa0) and previous icons (\ue067\xa0) at the bottom to go to the next or\nprevious page of the table.', page_no=86, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('40c0fc94-4c1b-4d29-8ab8-5c9fe287bba8'), chunk_index=396, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622426, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='86\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting Quotes from Suppliers', page_no=86, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2bfbf1fd-02bc-4d95-974e-6144f88c777a'), chunk_index=397, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622485, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='8. If the RFQ status has progressed to Award, click Award for a supplier to accept that particular quote.\nGuided buying might prompt you to enter a justification. Enter the business reason for accepting the quote and\nclick Award.\nThe top of the RFQ page displays a new section that lists the awarded items, quantities, prices, and suppliers:', page_no=87, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ab628544-23e7-41aa-a975-cd1e9bb6eebe'), chunk_index=398, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622489, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='If your professional buying group performed the awarding, this section can list multiple suppliers.\n9. Click Create purchase requisition to convert the quote to a new requisition. If multiple suppliers were\nawarded, order from them by creating a single requisition. Guided buying redirects you to the new requisition,\nwhere you can add values and comments, and submit it for approval.', page_no=87, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4785b146-cb49-40a6-bbea-086a78fd8803'), chunk_index=399, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622492, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="When you create a purchase requisition from a quote, you can't change the following values:\n•\nCommodity code\n•\nMaterial group\n•\nQuantity\n•\nUnit price\n•\nUnit of measure\n•\nSupplier\nIf a valid contract is available, guided buying automatically includes its number in the requisition.\nResults\nAfter the RFQ reaches Awarded status, you can keep the quote for use later. If the supplier adds an expiration date,", page_no=87, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('753608a4-67c7-43d4-a794-52b57ef0cc6f'), chunk_index=400, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622496, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='use the quote before the specified date; when it expires, Create purchase requisition is grayed out.\nSuppliers determine whether a quote is valid for multiple purchases, in which case the quote displays the\n"Reusable" icon (\n). Re-order reusable quotes later by displaying the RFQ and clicking Create\npurchase requisition again.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting Quotes from Suppliers\nPUBLIC\n87', page_no=87, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b2c3924c-41a6-41d4-baf0-bcf238cbfed1'), chunk_index=401, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622548, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Duplicating an RFQ\nYou might want to duplicate an existing RFQ, which copies its contents to a new RFQ.\nContext\nDuplicating an RFQ can save you work when you need to get quotes for similar items or services, especially for\ncomplex RFQs or ones that contain many line items.\nYou can duplicate RFQs in any scenario (self-service, low-touch, high-touch, and sourcing requests) and in any\nstate.', page_no=88, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0dc215b1-2952-4920-89b5-e27da074e907'), chunk_index=402, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622552, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Duplicating copies all line items, quantities, and costs, but it doesn't copy comments, attachments, or selected\nsuppliers.\nIf you duplicate an RFQ while you're in an on-behalf-of session, the duplicate uses your on-behalf-of context. If you\nduplicate an RFQ in a regular session, the duplicate uses your default context, not the on-behalf-of context of the\noriginal RFQ.\nProcedure\n1.\nGo to your Your requests page and click an RFQ.", page_no=88, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c9b46da6-2022-4232-8cf1-90d4490a6c18'), chunk_index=403, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622556, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='2. Before or after submitting the RFQ, click the more menu (\ue1f2\xa0) and choose Duplicate:\nGuided buying copies the original RFQ content into a new RFQ and sets the new RFQ to Composing state.\n3. Click Save to save the RFQ.\n4. To edit the copy later, go to your Your requests page, click Quotes, and click the RFQ copy, which is in\nComposing state.\nRelated Information', page_no=88, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a93387c6-600f-43e6-b13c-8a869fa819a4'), chunk_index=404, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622560, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Saving an RFQ in Composing State [page 78]\n88\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting Quotes from Suppliers', page_no=88, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b39a21f9-ece1-4b4f-84b9-37db6081b6cb'), chunk_index=405, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622647, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Cancelling an RFQ\nYou can cancel RFQs, which cancels the request.\nContext\nCancel an RFQ if you made a mistake or created it in error. If guided buying has sent the RFQ to suppliers, it sends\nthem a notice indicating that you canceled the event.\nYou can cancel RFQs that are in specific states:\nCommunication Channel\nOld-Style Single-Line RFQs\nNew-Style Multiple-Line RFQs\nAPI\n•\nYou can cancel self-service and low-', page_no=89, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('1143b6fb-4389-4431-8ec1-1fd2bb5c40d0'), chunk_index=406, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622651, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="touch RFQs after you submit them\nand they reach Request sent state.\n•\nYou can cancel low-touch and high-\ntouch RFQs if your procurement de-\npartment hasn't yet published the\nevent, which deletes the request in\nSAP Ariba Sourcing.\n•\nYou can cancel sourcing requests\nif your procurement department\nhasn't yet performed action on them\nor started any task, which deletes\nthe request in SAP Ariba Sourcing.\n•", page_no=89, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('71a6d1db-3a09-4451-8fa6-d22e1d7aad9f'), chunk_index=407, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622655, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="You can cancel RFQs that were\nsaved before submission by editing\nthem and clicking Cancel.\n•\nYou can cancel self-service and low-\ntouch RFQs after you submit them\nand they reach Request sent state.\n•\nYou can cancel low-touch and high-\ntouch RFQs if your procurement de-\npartment hasn't yet published the\nevent, which deletes the request in\nSAP Ariba Sourcing.\n•\nYou can cancel sourcing requests", page_no=89, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6bd8d48b-af3d-48da-a8de-fd3fcf3aeb5b'), chunk_index=408, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622658, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="if your procurement department\nhasn't yet performed action on them\nor started any task, which deletes\nthe request in SAP Ariba Sourcing.\n•\nCanceling isn't available for inter-\nmediate states, such as Submitting\nor Awarding.\ncXML\n•\nYou can cancel self-service and low-touch RFQs after you submit them and\nthey reach Request sent state.\n•\nYou can cancel low-touch and high-touch RFQs if your procurement depart-", page_no=89, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0ee616fc-485e-4329-9a07-4a8e30865feb'), chunk_index=409, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622662, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="ment hasn't yet published the event, which deletes the request in SAP Ariba\nSourcing.\n•\nYou can cancel sourcing requests if your procurement department hasn't yet\nperformed action on them or started any task, which deletes the request in SAP\nAriba Sourcing.\nProcedure\n1.\nWhile editing an RFQ, if you haven't saved it, cancel it by clicking the more menu (\ue1f2\xa0) and choosing Cancel:", page_no=89, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('fb3fdf48-9eaa-4306-a0f5-3ee81de608fa'), chunk_index=410, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622666, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Guided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting Quotes from Suppliers\nPUBLIC\n89', page_no=89, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('8d88169a-eef2-4b3a-bbf3-d51989a8e019'), chunk_index=411, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622689, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='2. If you saved an RFQ, you can delete it in Composing state by opening it, clicking the more menu (\ue1f2\xa0), and\nchoosing Delete:\n3. To delete only your current changes while editing, click the more menu (\ue1f2\xa0) and choose Cancel edits:\n4. To cancel an RFQ after it reaches Request sent state but before it reaches Receive quotes state, display the\nRFQ and click Cancel request:\n90', page_no=90, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('cd6ca7ed-831d-46ee-9d38-0a59a5e0a42b'), chunk_index=412, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622693, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='PUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting Quotes from Suppliers', page_no=90, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d528b043-a6c7-40d3-a5b9-552b0adb6e50'), chunk_index=413, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622698, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Related Information\nRFQ Statuses [page 109]\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRequesting Quotes from Suppliers\nPUBLIC\n91', page_no=91, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('88211beb-7a05-4ca0-b8b7-7b9365fbe89c'), chunk_index=414, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622747, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Buying on Behalf of Another User, Company\nCode, Purchasing Unit, or Plant\nYou can make purchases on behalf of (OBO) someone else or another location, where you handle the\nadministrative part of the purchase while using the on-behalf-of person's or location's catalog items, delivery\ninformation, and accounting information.\nContext\nWhen buying on behalf of a user, you're the preparer and the person you're buying for is the requester. When you", page_no=92, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('9ea41648-0615-4480-97b1-808f1a0e52ca'), chunk_index=415, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622751, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="buy on behalf of another person or business entity, you see the landing pages, catalog items, and suppliers that\nperson or entity has permission to view.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nYou can use on-behalf-of by user and company code functionality for RFQs. They don't support on-behalf-of by\npurchasing unit or plant. The RFQ is created by the user or company code that you chose. When you award", page_no=92, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('9830e2db-45a6-4b4c-9d6b-32eba5c72560'), chunk_index=416, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622755, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="the RFQ, the award uses the on-behalf-of context of the RFQ. For more information about RFQs, see Requesting\nQuotes from Suppliers [page 73].\nProcedure\n1.\nOn the right side of your dashboard,\n•\nChoose Quick Links.\n•\nIf you don't see Quick Links, click Request on behalf of.\n92\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nBuying on Behalf of Another User, Company Code, Purchasing Unit, or Plant", page_no=92, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('1cd563b0-151d-478a-afea-bd566214e849'), chunk_index=417, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622792, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='2. Choose an on-behalf-of option:\nOption\nDescription\nRequest on behalf of\nSelects another user.\nRequest by company code\nSelects another company code.\nRequest by purchasing unit\nSelects another purchasing unit.\nRequest by plant\nSelects another plant.\nSome of these options might not be available.\n\ue04c\xa0Tip\nIf there are items in your cart when you start an on-behalf-of session, guided buying prompts you to save', page_no=93, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('39be56da-55f6-4dcc-a026-1b852ffe76f6'), chunk_index=418, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622796, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="them in a new requisition in Composing state or clear the cart.\n3. For Request on behalf of:\na. Search for a user by the user ID or name.\nb. Select the user for whom you're buying.\nc. Your configuration might allow you to skip the review step; select a Ship To address and click Start\nrequesting on behalf of.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases", page_no=93, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('18de04ed-08f1-4f74-ba07-1411ed2ccac3'), chunk_index=419, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622800, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Buying on Behalf of Another User, Company Code, Purchasing Unit, or Plant\nPUBLIC\n93', page_no=93, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('db8dd6f3-fa0a-4619-8d4a-ac63332d3a27'), chunk_index=420, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622808, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="The following example shows a request on behalf of session that skips the review step:\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nIf you can't find a user from another procurement unit, ensure the\nparameter Show OBO requesters from limited responsibility procurement units\n(Application.User.ShowOBORequestersFromLimitedResponsibilityPUs) is enabled. This\n94\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nBuying on Behalf of Another User, Company Code, Purchasing Unit, or Plant", page_no=94, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('551063e1-6cd4-444e-afe3-fd069a8feb21'), chunk_index=421, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622856, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='parameter allows you to find and select users from procurement units listed in the Limited Responsibility\nsection of your profile. For more information, see Show OBO requesters from limited responsibility\nprocurement units.\n4. For Request by company code:\na. Select a company code, either by clicking a displayed code or by searching, then click Next.', page_no=95, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('19fdcc77-e04b-4fb4-a598-50f23afffda1'), chunk_index=422, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622860, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='b. Your organization might require you to also select a purchasing unit code. A code might be pre-selected for\nyou; you can manually change it, if needed.\nc. After making selections, click Start requesting.\n5. For Request by purchasing unit or Request by plant:\na. Find a purchasing unit or plant, either by scrolling to a name or by searching.', page_no=95, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('07491dd5-f262-4922-bcf6-41a55096934b'), chunk_index=423, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622864, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="b. Click Choose next to the purchasing unit or plant for which you're buying.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nFor increased flexibility, Request by purchasing unit allows you to select any company code. However, if\nyou use an invalid purchasing unit and company code combination, errors are issued later. To avoid errors,\nuse Request by company code, which provides valid purchasing unit and company code combinations.", page_no=95, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('10b92b03-f307-454f-aa7a-d2c408f990cb'), chunk_index=424, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622868, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='6. Review the selected business entities and make any changes needed.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nBuying on Behalf of Another User, Company Code, Purchasing Unit, or Plant\nPUBLIC\n95', page_no=95, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('bd804a7e-8d2c-4029-a0d6-c8cfbe489a18'), chunk_index=425, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622892, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='The following example shows the review step (the available options depend on the structure of your\norganization):\nSelect a Ship To address. Guided buying displays only addresses that make sense for the selected user or\nbusiness entity.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nIf you selected on-behalf-of by company code or plant, guided buying uses your Ship To address; change it\nto the address of the company code or plant.\n96\nPUBLIC', page_no=96, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('de1e846b-eb28-4f09-a7a9-a9769d215343'), chunk_index=426, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622896, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Guided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nBuying on Behalf of Another User, Company Code, Purchasing Unit, or Plant', page_no=96, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('5dff48ef-ede6-4f4c-bd8f-a4251e9fa4c1'), chunk_index=427, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622972, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="7.\nClick Start requesting on behalf of.\nA banner at the top of the page confirms the name of the user or business entity for which you're buying. If you\nplace your pointer over this name, guided buying displays full session information:\nTo make purchases for yourself again, click Stop within the blue banner at any time.\n8. Search or browse the customer catalog for the needed items.", page_no=97, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('8ea56b67-302e-423d-afce-9a320fb53a41'), chunk_index=428, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622977, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="9. Add items to your cart, and click Check out.\n10. Review all request fields, including line-item accounting information, and correct any errors.\nThe request header doesn't allow you to change the entity value (user, company code, purchasing unit, or\nplant) you selected when you initiated the on-behalf-of session. However, you can change it in line items.", page_no=97, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('92416471-3de9-4010-abe0-1159f82e9b4b'), chunk_index=429, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622980, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Depending on the items you chose, you might need to change the Ship To address, because some categories\nmight have default addresses.\n11. Scroll down to the Approval Flow section to review the approvers.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nDepending on your organization's approval requirements, the person you're buying for is added to the\napproval flow as a watcher, which keeps that user informed about the request.\n12. Submit the request for approval.", page_no=97, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('55e14d11-cd28-4161-89c3-cb0b2142a7ac'), chunk_index=430, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622984, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="\ue04c\xa0Tip\nIf you stop the on-behalf-of session before submitting the request, guided buying prompts you to save the\nrequest in Composing state or clear the cart.\nResults\n•\nIn on-behalf-of sessions, you can't buy for yet another user or business entity (nested on-behalf-of sessions).\nInstead, you must click Stop and then select another user or business entity. Similarly, you can't perform team\nbuying in on-behalf-of sessions.\n•", page_no=97, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('74208e09-1863-4454-8e32-0c8892976546'), chunk_index=431, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622988, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="You (the preparer) can check the status of the request by choosing Your requests on the home page. However,\non-behalf-of users (requesters) can't see it there; instead they see it in their\nYour Approvals\nTo watch\nlist.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nBuying on Behalf of Another User, Company Code, Purchasing Unit, or Plant\nPUBLIC\n97", page_no=97, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4a00b16d-ca48-4527-9c1e-4322bf6c7850'), chunk_index=432, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 622994, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='•\nIn on-behalf-of sessions, you must use the All filter in the Requested-by type filter to find on-behalf-of\nrequisitions, as shown in the following figure:\n98\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nBuying on Behalf of Another User, Company Code, Purchasing Unit, or Plant', page_no=98, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('280b4ea8-18a0-4c2d-9f52-47b7f59e354b'), chunk_index=433, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623083, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Approving Someone Else's Request, Document,\nor Task\nIf you're an approver of a request, document, or task created by someone else, you need to approve or deny it.\nContext\nYou might be an approver or a watcher. Approvers receive notifications on their dashboard when it's their turn to\nreview an item and approve or deny it. Watchers also receive notifications, but they can only review items; they", page_no=99, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e3419df3-1921-4118-abb1-494eb402f271'), chunk_index=434, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623087, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="can't approve or deny them.\nIf your organization allows approval through email, you can choose to approve or deny items without having to sign\nin and view them. Otherwise, you need to choose the View option in the approval email to open each item. The\nfollowing process applies to approving or denying items while signed in.", page_no=99, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('3a9bcf80-dd78-4d1a-9fe1-93e5d3ea481b'), chunk_index=435, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623091, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="If the invoice or service sheet was created in SAP Ariba Buying and Invoicing, your session is redirected to SAP\nAriba Buying and Invoicing where you can approve or deny the request. After reviewing the document, you're taken\nback to the Your approvals page in guided buying.\nProcedure\n1.\nTo review a request, document, or task, do one of the following:\n•", page_no=99, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('1d29ee5c-0876-48c6-8438-c1dcb1fdead5'), chunk_index=436, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623095, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='In the upper right corner, click the notification bell icon (\ue23a\xa0) and choose an item that is pending your\naction.\n•\nTo see a full list of items waiting to be approved, go to the home page and choose Your approvals. Scroll\nthrough the To approve, To watch, or Custom forms list, filter by date, or use the Find a request search', page_no=99, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0461c56f-d268-4054-b7c8-e406fcf938c5'), chunk_index=437, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623098, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='box to locate a request that requires your action.\n•\nThis list can display the following types of items:\n•\nAll: all document types\n•\nRequisition: purchase requisitions (PR)\n•\nUser profile: user profile change requests (UP)\n•\nInvoice: invoice and invoice reconciliation documents (INV) or (IR)\n•\nService sheet: service entry sheets (SS)\n•\nTask: approval tasks from SAP Ariba Strategic Sourcing and Supplier Management solutions:\n•', page_no=99, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('3ca02906-6ac8-48f4-8e91-59d478cae3ed'), chunk_index=438, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623102, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Sourcing project: sourcing projects (WS)\n•\nSourcing request: sourcing requests (SR)\n•\nSupplier project: supplier projects (SP)\n•\nContract request: contract requests (CR)\n•\nContract workspace: contract workspaces (CW)\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nApproving Someone Else's Request, Document, or Task\nPUBLIC\n99", page_no=99, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a8534f6d-526b-45bd-986d-0a7caac177fc'), chunk_index=439, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623208, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="•\nProcurement workspace: procurement workspaces (PW)\n•\n(Form name): custom forms designed specifically for your organization (CF)\n2. Do one of the following:\n•\nChoose Approve next to the request, and then enter comments that explain why you're approving it.\n•\nClick See details next to the request to take a closer look before deciding how to handle the request.\nAfter you click See details, the following options are available:", page_no=100, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2b3cc5c1-daaa-4b0b-9395-52acbb7dfbaf'), chunk_index=440, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623213, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Option\nDescription\nApprove\nApproves the request\nDeny\nDenies the request and sends it back to the requester.\nIf you deny the request, you must add comments explaining\nwhy you withheld approval. Requesters and approvers read\nyour comments to understand what subsequent steps they\nmust take.\nEdit\nOpens the request in edit mode.\nThis option is available only if you are a member of both the', page_no=100, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('69c322da-d084-446b-87d6-81c5c7c50164'), chunk_index=441, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623216, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Purchasing User group and a group that gives you edit\npermission; otherwise it's greyed out.\n•\nIf you don't see these options, click the more options menu (\ue1f2\xa0) to access more options.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nIf you deny or reject an item, make it clear to the requester why you didn't approve it and include\ninstructions for how to correct any issues. The following are examples of helpful comments:\n•", page_no=100, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ddd5dd77-444e-486e-ac33-8bdc1a709662'), chunk_index=442, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623223, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='"Denying requisition because we already have this item. Check the supply cabinet."\n•\n"Please change line item #2 to part number 276, and resubmit the request. We tried the original part\nnumber, but it doesn\'t fit."\n3. On the document details page, do any of the following:\n•\nTo add a comment, enter text in the Comments box at the bottom of the document and click Add. If', page_no=100, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d2f468e6-d6ab-4558-9e7a-513c3f15bc7f'), chunk_index=443, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623227, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="there's a header and line items, click Header actions or Line item actions and choose Add comment.\n•\nTo add an attachment, drag a file to the Attachments box at the bottom of the document (or click browse)\nand click Add. If there's a header and line items, click Header actions or Line item actions and choose\nAdd attachment.\n•", page_no=100, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('56b43044-0176-4550-aec9-9a316a65188d'), chunk_index=444, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623231, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="To share your comment or attachment with the supplier, click Share with supplier. If you don't share with\nthe supplier, your comment and attachment are visible only within your organization.\n•\nIf you were added to resolve an invoice exception on an invoice reconciliation document, do one of the\nfollowing:\n•\nResolve the exception according to your organization's processes, and click Submit to route the", page_no=100, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('af96a10d-5572-4e54-9ec5-6b703574a6d6'), chunk_index=445, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623235, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="invoice reconciliation to the next approver.\n•\nClick Refer to refer the exception to another user.\n•\nClick Manual match to manually match the information on the invoice with a purchase order or\ncontract.\n100\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nApproving Someone Else's Request, Document, or Task", page_no=100, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a769e60f-9985-4e4d-9419-33178884dc3b'), chunk_index=446, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623302, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="\ue05c\xa0Note\nFor more information on handling invoice exceptions, see the Reconciling Invoices guide or refer to your\norganization's custom invoice processing help resources.\nResults\nAfter you take action on an item, you are returned to the Your approvals page.\nNext Steps\nTo view items that you recently approved or denied, view the Recent approvals list on the Your approvals", page_no=101, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e288709c-8f58-4d1c-99bf-a532cd71226b'), chunk_index=447, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623306, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="page. (Note that this page doesn't list custom forms.) Depending on your permissions and based on what your\norganization allows, you might be able to:\n•\nEdit items that you previously approved or denied.\n•\nApprove items that you previously denied.\nDelegating Your Approval Authority\nIf you need someone to take over your approval duties temporarily, such as when you go on vacation, you can", page_no=101, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a3bd4324-2d9f-4682-b45b-312f38cdd816'), chunk_index=448, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623310, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='delegate your approval authority to your manager or a coworker.\nContext\nWhen you delegate authority, you are the delegator, and the user to whom you delegate authority is the delegatee.\nThe delegatee receives email notifications regarding requests that require your attention. That user can sign in and\nact as you in order to review, approve, and deny those requests on your behalf.', page_no=101, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('5edef566-e6f5-406e-be77-4e74e9f454fb'), chunk_index=449, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623314, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='When a delegatee receives a notification on behalf of a delegator, the notification mentions the delegation so the\nuser knows why the notification was sent. If a request is approved by a delegatee, the name of the delegatee is\nshown in the approval flow diagram for the request, followed by the name of the delegator in parentheses.\n\ue05c\xa0Note', page_no=101, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('66a35f9b-b033-4f87-9d7e-4d329f7dced9'), chunk_index=450, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623317, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='The "Reminder Envelope email notification" (for notification of RFQ envelope opening) is sent to only the\ndelegator, not the delegatee.\nThe following are important factors to keep in mind about delegations:\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nApproving Someone Else\'s Request, Document, or Task\nPUBLIC\n101', page_no=101, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('cabce3fa-df39-4783-83a4-5e299ddebea5'), chunk_index=451, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623409, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="•\nDelegation gives the delegatee access to documents only when the delegator is an active approver in the\napproval flow.\n•\nThe delegatee can't delegate authority back to the initial approver if the start date is only one day away.\n•\nYou can have only one delegation configured at a time. If you create a delegation, you can't create another one", page_no=102, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c87e3e3f-657f-4af9-8c47-8192cb81834f'), chunk_index=452, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623413, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='until the time period for the first delegation has passed.\n•\nYour organization might prevent delegatees from approving their own requests when the delegator is their\nsupervisor.\n•\nIf you have delegated your approval authority to another user, you can modify the delegation settings anytime.\nFor example, you might want to change the dates of the delegation period.\n•', page_no=102, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d73d3e87-3151-421f-9b0c-3c2e115c1202'), chunk_index=453, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623417, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="If you have delegated your approval authority to another user, you can stop the delegation manually at any time\nby signing in and choosing Stop. If you don't stop the delegation manually, it stops automatically on the end\ndate specified in the delegation.\n•\nDelegatees cannot delegate to other users; only one level of delegation is allowed.\nProcedure\n1.", page_no=102, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('fbc10618-507d-4874-8820-4e9dfae08b35'), chunk_index=454, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623421, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='On the guided buying home page (your dashboard), click the user icon at the top.\n2. Choose\nApp settings\nDelegate authority\nfrom the menu.\n3. Provide the details of the delegation as described in the following table.\nOption\nAction\nDelegatee\nChoose a name from the available choices, or click Search more to choose a different name.\n\ue04c\xa0Tip', page_no=102, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0fa8955a-1939-4b1e-8108-69871be31a83'), chunk_index=455, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623425, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="The delegatee doesn't get notified when the delegation is created. It's a good idea to inform\nthe delegatee yourself so that he or she will know to expect approval notifications on your\nbehalf.\nDelegation Start Date\nSelect the start date and time.\nDelegation End Date\nSelect the end date and time.\nDelegation Reason\nEnter the reason you are delegating your approval authority to the user.\nNotification", page_no=102, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('448287da-3004-4c5f-a02b-54a6760d89c1'), chunk_index=456, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623429, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Choose the check box to continue to receive email regarding approval requests during the time\nyour authority is delegated to the other user. The user to whom you delegate your approval\nauthority also receives the email.\n4. Click Next.\n5. Review the approval flow required to let you delegate authority. You can add approvers if needed.\n6. Click Next.', page_no=102, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d2a626b6-a468-4ef0-bd07-a5dc8fe02c0d'), chunk_index=457, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623433, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Review the details of your delegation. To make changes, click Prev to return to previous pages.\n7.\nClick Submit.\n102\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nApproving Someone Else's Request, Document, or Task", page_no=102, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e5d6f95d-aba5-4770-bff2-67791592f40b'), chunk_index=458, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623463, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Results\nThe delegation request is submitted for approval. The delegation takes effect only if the request is fully approved.\nIf you sign in during the delegation period, you are asked whether to continue or stop the delegation.\nWhen the delegatee signs in, guided buying immediately displays the Act as User page, which lists the names of', page_no=103, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('7d2b465b-d614-4751-a954-5ee1e7e81823'), chunk_index=459, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623467, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="the delegator and delegatee. The user selects the delegator to act as that user, or the delegatee to start a normal\nsession under the delegatee's own name. If the user selects the delegator, the user icon in the upper right indicates\ndelegator's initials. The user can stop the session by either signing out or selecting the user icon and clicking Stop\nacting.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases", page_no=103, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b4e193fc-6c1c-4df8-9db8-c4b6e91c0c3a'), chunk_index=460, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623471, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Approving Someone Else's Request, Document, or Task\nPUBLIC\n103", page_no=103, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2de1b03b-c986-401e-888a-478dda3a93b9'), chunk_index=461, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623554, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Transferring Ownership of Documents\nTransferring ownership of an approvable document is helpful if an employee leaves the organization, changes roles,\nor takes an extended leave of absence.\nContext\nYour administrator must first create a transfer of ownership form based on your organization's requirements for\ntransferring ownership of documents. Once the form is ready, it displays as a tile on your home page.", page_no=104, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6d0f35f2-5416-43dd-bbef-192742e4fad2'), chunk_index=462, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623558, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Consider the following when working with transfer of ownership documents:\n•\nYou can submit a transfer of ownership request for documents created by other users.\n•\nOwnership of a document can be transferred between users in your organization, regardless of a user's\nassigned team or group\n•\nIf a user has left the organization (inactive user), ownership of that document can be transferred to an existing\nemployee.\nProcedure\n1.", page_no=104, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e18e8bb0-1a8f-46b5-84b6-f4c04820d091'), chunk_index=463, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623562, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Click the "Transfer of Ownership" tile on the guided buying dashboard to open the form.\n2. In the From user field, type the first few letters of the user, and then choose from the list of suggested users.\n3. In the To user field, choose the new owner of the approvable.\n4. From the Approvable type dropdown, select the approvable type.', page_no=104, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a9e6b8c3-a850-4809-8ba2-a32d12d91aa5'), chunk_index=464, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623565, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='5. From the Approvable status dropdown, select the status of the approvable.\n6. From the Date range dropdown, select the date range for when the approvable was created: All, Last One\nWeek, Last One Month, Last Six Months, or Last One Year.\n7.\nFrom the Reason dropdown, choose the reason for transferring the approvable.\n8. (Optional) In the Additional Comments field, add comments.', page_no=104, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('785e8411-9ca7-478f-bf91-6c182355b1d4'), chunk_index=465, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623569, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='9. Click the Apply button to search for approvables.\n10. Click the checkbox for the approvable document that you want to transfer. You can select one or multiple\ndocuments.\n11. In the Approval section, add approvers to the approval flow. Transfer of ownership forms must have at least\none approver.\n12. Click Submit to submit the transfer request.', page_no=104, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2fe27738-fd2d-435f-b896-baf9102f2b30'), chunk_index=466, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623578, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='The submitted transfer request is displayed in a non-editable mode. The transfer is complete once all the\napprovers have approved the request.\nEditing Transfer of Ownership Requests [page 105]\nApproving a Transfer of Ownership Request [page 105]\n104\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nTransferring Ownership of Documents', page_no=104, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('cc26d2a3-4b34-47da-9b06-13e7d65ae6c9'), chunk_index=467, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623639, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Editing Transfer of Ownership Requests\nIf you created a transfer of ownership request, you can withdraw, edit, submit, or delete it, if needed.\nContext\nConsider the following when working with transfer of ownership requests:\n•\nSubmitted requests can be withdrawn by requesters anytime before they're fully approved.\n•\nDenied requests can be edited by requesters and resubmitted.\nProcedure\n1.", page_no=105, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2ecbc026-f1a9-4f1b-a1f2-bee3ba79c17d'), chunk_index=468, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623643, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Click the My Requests link in the guided buying dashboard to view the requests.\n2. Do one of the following:\n•\nTo withdraw a submitted request, look for requests in Submitted state and open the request. Click\nWithdraw, make changes, and then click Submit.\n•\nTo edit a denied request, look for requests in Denied state, open the request, and then click Edit. Make\nchanges and then click Submit.\n•', page_no=105, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('73c09d03-f2f9-42b3-9f3c-9f067a9b3d2b'), chunk_index=469, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623646, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="To delete a draft request, look for requests in Composing state, open the request, and then click Delete.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nTransfer of ownership requests can only be deleted if they're in Composing state.\nApproving a Transfer of Ownership Request\nContext\nThe transfer request goes through a pre-defined approval flow that includes the original owner, the original owner’s", page_no=105, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6ff9d857-0507-49a6-b05a-23f5acc20467'), chunk_index=470, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623650, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='supervisor, the new owner, and the new owner’s supervisor, in that order. The user requesting the transfer can add\nmore approvers to the default approval flow.\nProcedure\n1.\nClick the Approve requests link at the top left of the guided buying dashboard to open the Approve requests\npage.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nTransferring Ownership of Documents\nPUBLIC\n105', page_no=105, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a0beb088-bf6f-4206-bfe7-46423681061a'), chunk_index=471, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623670, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='2. Click the Custom forms tab.\nThis tab displays all the custom forms awaiting approval.\n3. Click the Approve button on the transfer request. You can opt to view details about the request by clicking See\ndetails.\n4. The transfer request is displayed with the Approve and Deny buttons. Click Approve and then add comments\nin the popup and click Submit to approve the request.\n106\nPUBLIC', page_no=106, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('8391bfd5-c0df-4ab1-a407-bd6eb8289f24'), chunk_index=472, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623674, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Guided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nTransferring Ownership of Documents', page_no=106, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0486bc40-59bb-4524-b61b-17cdd2193591'), chunk_index=473, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623752, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Finding the Status of Your Requests\nYou can check the status of your requests to see when they're fully approved, or to find out when you'll receive the\nitems or service. You can also view a request's history to see if the order was sent successfully to the supplier.\nContext\nConsider the following when you search for a request:\n•\nItems are sorted by the date they were last changed.", page_no=107, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('364bb11d-f208-465a-a097-e9166f6936b5'), chunk_index=474, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623756, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='•\nRequests that are in Ordered, Receiving, or Received status display one or more purchase order numbers.\nClick these numbers to display complete information about an order, such as the status of each line item; for\nmore information, see Finding POs [page 112].\n•\nWhen there are multiple purchase orders associated with individual requisitions, fewer than 200 results may\ndisplay in Your Requests.\n•', page_no=107, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('fb60dd03-3a17-4f7e-937b-2f9ed54b847c'), chunk_index=475, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623760, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='If there are many line items, guided buying shows only the first 200. If there are more than 100 comments,\nguided buying indicates that there are too many comments to display.\nProcedure\n1.\nOn the home page, choose Your requests.\n2. Scroll through the list of all types of requests (All), view the Quotes or Custom forms list, or filter by date. You', page_no=107, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ec69371d-218d-4f74-88eb-4fbf79a4b666'), chunk_index=476, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623764, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='can also use the Find a request search box to locate a request by one of the dropdown options: Request ID,\nOrder ID, Request title, Supplier ID, or Supplier name. When using the search filters, the search returns any\nrequest that contains the searched string of text.\n3. Click the request number or title to open it.', page_no=107, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('855a4693-1f6c-4e27-945f-174aeaef05c8'), chunk_index=477, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623767, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='4. Review the Approval Flow section for requests or the Process diagram and Invited suppliers sections for\nquotes to see where it is in the quote, approval, or fulfillment process.\nA quote shows a message similar to the following that indicates how many suppliers have responded so far:\nYou have received 0 quotes from 3 invited suppliers.\nFor a request, the following is an example of an approval flow diagram:', page_no=107, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0f325d5e-6715-4037-addb-e31fb51b2105'), chunk_index=478, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623771, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Figure 7: Approval Flow diagram with no approvals\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nFinding the Status of Your Requests\nPUBLIC\n107', page_no=107, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('080045d9-d2c3-496d-88a4-412ae0fa9838'), chunk_index=479, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623813, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='In this example of a request approval flow, the first approver is highlighted in blue because they are currently\nreviewing the request. After someone approves a request, their node in the approval flow shows a green\ncheckmark:\nFigure 8: Approval Flow diagram with one approval\nFigure 9: Process diagram for a quote\nThe explanation of the current status below the process diagram helps you understand what is happening to', page_no=108, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('240157ad-e1fe-4b80-8e75-6e03c2143b59'), chunk_index=480, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623817, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='your quote request.\n5. Scroll down to the History section to find out more information about who submitted, edited, or approved the\nrequest.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nThe History section also tells you whether and when the order made it to the supplier.\n6. Use the Optional comment box to request an update from an approver, or check Share with supplier and add\na comment to send information to the supplier.', page_no=108, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('51536802-f565-4e86-b89d-cd2eebfe9b9e'), chunk_index=481, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623821, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='RFQ Statuses [page 109]\nRequisition Statuses [page 110]\nRelated Information\nRFQ Statuses [page 109]\nRequisition Statuses [page 110]\n108\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nFinding the Status of Your Requests', page_no=108, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('24c6da37-156d-4e06-8ab0-7829afdbd429'), chunk_index=482, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623864, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='RFQ Statuses\nThe RFQ flow depends on the item or service you requested. Guided buying evaulates each RFQ and triggers\nself-service, low-touch, high-touch, or sourcing request scenarios.\nThe available RFQ statuses depend on the scenario:\nScenario\nStates\nSelf-service, low-touch\nComposing\nRequest sent\nReceive quotes\nAward\nRequisition completed\nHigh-touch\nComposing\nRequest sent\nReceive quotes\nAwarding\nConfirm award\nRequisition completed\nSourcing request\nComposing\nRequest sent\nRequest for quote created\nReceive quotes\nAwarding', page_no=109, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('98afd97b-599e-46f5-be2e-5d319bcc5184'), chunk_index=483, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623868, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Confirm award\nRequisition completed\nThe following table describes these statuses:\nStatus\nDescription\nComposing\nYou saved the RFQ before submitting it.\nRequest sent\nYou submitted the request and approvers are reviewing it.\nReceive quotes\nThe invited suppliers received the RFQ and are submitting their quotes.\nAward, Awarding\nAll invited suppliers submitted their quotes and you or your procurement group are evaluating\nthem to determine which supplier to award.\nConfirm award', page_no=109, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('256a309e-8e0c-4a23-a396-c02956d6fd5b'), chunk_index=484, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623872, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='You or your procurement group chose a supplier to award.\nRequisition completed\nThe supplier quote has been used in a requisition.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nFinding the Status of Your Requests\nPUBLIC\n109', page_no=109, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('8da39d5a-656c-4a43-9363-468768b485a0'), chunk_index=485, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623989, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Requisition Statuses\nA requisition's status describes where it stands in the approval and fulfillment process.\nRequisitions have the following statuses:\nStatus\nDescription\nComposing\nYou're still working on the requisition.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nIf you submit a requisition and then withdraw it, the requisition moves back to Composing\nstatus.\nSubmitted\nYou've submitted the requisition, and approvers are reviewing it. You can withdraw and edit a\nrequisition in Submitted status.\nDenied", page_no=110, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('74c661c0-1c86-4a74-ae5c-5675be6639ab'), chunk_index=486, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623993, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='An approver denied your requisition. You can delete the request or edit and resubmit it.\nApproved\nAll the necessary people approved your requisition.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nRequisitions typically move from Approved status to Ordered status within a few seconds,\nwhich is the time it takes to automatically send the purchase orders to suppliers. If the\nrequisitions remains in this status for an extended time period, it likely means that you', page_no=110, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('838b74f7-89c4-4c4a-ba65-b817c1c5147e'), chunk_index=487, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 623997, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='chose to delay the purchase by setting a value for the Delay purchase until date field. If\na requisition in Approved status is awaiting a Delay purchase until date, you can edit the\nrequisition and resubmit it.\nOrdering\nThe requisition generated a purchase order, and the order is being sent to the supplier. Contact\nyour internal help desk if a requisition remains in Ordering status for an extended time period.', page_no=110, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('726afcc3-e3f9-4683-ba5f-64c1838b2d83'), chunk_index=488, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624001, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Ordered\nThe requisition generated a purchase order, and the order was sent to the supplier.\n\ue04c\xa0Tip\nIf your site is integrated with SAP S/4HANA,\u202fafter a requisition reaches Ordered status, sub-\nsequent updates are processed through inbound notifications from SAP S/4HANA. During\nthis processing, the system uses in-memory requisition details. If the requisition details are\noutdated, processing errors can occur, such as Out-of-Date Exceptions (OODE) or timeout\nerrors.', page_no=110, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a0177446-c6a5-431e-9f84-38de46f2dc3f'), chunk_index=489, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624005, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='To ensure reliable processing, enable the Use recent requisition data for SAP S/4HANA\nnotifications\n(Application.GuidedBuy.UseRecentRequisitionDataForS4HANANotifi\ncations) parameter. For more information, see Use recent requisition data for SAP S/\n4HANA notifications.\nReceiving\nYou received some of the items you ordered.\nReceived\nYou received all of the items you ordered.\nCanceling\nThe requisition is in the process of being canceled.\n110\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases', page_no=110, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0d629ecb-f6cd-43f6-8dca-ec59b889b19c'), chunk_index=490, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624009, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Finding the Status of Your Requests', page_no=110, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('5bbe119f-3483-4f87-acfb-5de2f85ed187'), chunk_index=491, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624014, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Status\nDescription\nCanceled\nYour requisition has been canceled.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nFinding the Status of Your Requests\nPUBLIC\n111', page_no=111, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('7f6912eb-8486-40e2-b8d5-5a6c32e026cd'), chunk_index=492, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624055, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Working with Purchase Orders\nYou can view a PO to find the status of the ordered item or service, make changes to the PO, or cancel the PO if\nneeded.\nFinding POs [page 112]\nChanging Requests or POs [page 116]\nCanceling Requests or POs [page 117]\nFinding POs\nFind your purchase orders (POs) to display the status of ordered items or services.\nContext', page_no=112, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('9d242fca-f63f-4e1c-97d5-cbb67b281e1b'), chunk_index=493, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624060, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='After requisitions have been fully approved, guided buying creates POs (one per supplier), sends them to suppliers,\nand sets their status to Ordered. PO numbers display below requests after they reach Ordered state, as shown in\nthe following figure.\nPOs display information from order confirmations and ship notices sent by suppliers, and from your receipts and', page_no=112, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('46cc6ed6-dc4c-4427-8159-7b3e56ee8ee7'), chunk_index=494, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624063, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='service entry sheets. Find this information to determine the location of your ordered items or when services will be\nsupplied.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nOrder confirmations display for material orders, not service orders.\n112\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nWorking with Purchase Orders', page_no=112, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('28c6ddd7-23a1-4d93-9974-e4f65af06c7c'), chunk_index=495, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624122, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Procedure\n1.\nOn the home page, choose Your requests.\n2. Find the PO by doing any of the following:\n•\nScroll through the list of all types of requests on the Recent requests page.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nRequests are sorted by the date they were last changed.\n•\nFind the PO in the Purchase orders tab or the To receive tab. The POs available in To Receive are the same', page_no=113, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d3d2d244-ed1b-499a-bcb3-c84632541b8d'), chunk_index=496, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624125, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='POs available in Purchase orders.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nThe filters Request ID, Order ID, Request title, Supplier ID, and Supplier name return any requests\nthat contains the searched string of text.\n3. Review the PO status and basic information, as shown in the following figure.\nThe following table lists the sections in this area:\nSection\nDescription\nStatus', page_no=113, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4ed20b84-b1e1-4c9d-8493-3f5c6e421689'), chunk_index=497, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624129, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Graphic indicators of the fulfillment status of the PO. Each graphic represents the total quantity of all line\nitems in the PO.\nThe following information is displayed:\n•\nConfirmed: The number of ordered items or services that the supplier can deliver. If the supplier\nrejected items, they display here, too.\n•\nShipped: (For material POs) The number of ordered items that have been shipped by the supplier.\n•', page_no=113, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('bae62629-4149-4cb2-82fe-8c90683712e5'), chunk_index=498, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624133, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Received: (For material POs) The number of items or amount that you have received. To receive\nordered items or by amount, go to the Your requests page and choose the To receive tab.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nWorking with Purchase Orders\nPUBLIC\n113', page_no=113, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('553c565f-fc1b-4c82-a5de-3b18d2e3f9f1'), chunk_index=499, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624196, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Section\nDescription\n•\nServiced: (For service POs) The amount of work performed or services delivered.\n•\nEstimated delivery/Serviced date: The date when the ordered items or services will be delivered.\nSupplier\nThe name, address, and contact information of the supplier.\nBill to\nThe address to which the supplier sends invoices.\nShip to /\nDeliver to', page_no=114, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('77502a4f-525e-4ed6-bfa8-074832753173'), chunk_index=500, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624200, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='The address and contact to which the supplier will send the items or perform the service. If the PO\ncontains multiple ship-to or deliver-to addresses, choose more locations to display them.\nPayment\nterms\nPayment terms agreed upon by the supplier and your organization. This section also lists the gross\namount of the PO.\nChoose Details to see the monetary amount ordered, received, and invoiced.', page_no=114, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('79ef5c04-517f-4192-bfa0-86fc1cb1d506'), chunk_index=501, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624204, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='4. Scroll down to display the line item details, as shown in the following figure.\nThe following table lists the sections in this area:\nSection\nDescription\nItems\nThe line items in the PO including their descriptions.\nMaterial items display quantity, price, and amount.\nService items display start date, end date, expected amount, maximum amount, net amount, and\ngross amount.\nLine items might also display delivery addresses, comments, and attachments..', page_no=114, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a9736bb9-4445-4d27-a508-92d26ce67b1e'), chunk_index=502, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624208, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Terms and\nconditions\nPurchasing terms and conditions agreed upon by the supplier and your organization.\nGuidelines for\nsuppliers\nOptional, predefined notes that provide additional information for suppliers that you can add to\nrequests.\n5. Scroll down to display related documents and history, as shown in the following figures:\nFigure 10: Related documents and history sections\n114\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nWorking with Purchase Orders', page_no=114, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('202d4e91-efa7-4e6b-8f5b-c2681af90598'), chunk_index=503, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624267, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='The following table lists the sections in this area:\nSection\nDescription\nRelated\ndocuments\nA list of documents that affect the PO, the dates they were created, and their current status; choose them\nto display them.\nThe available documents are:\n•\nOrder confirmations: sent by the supplier to indicate that they received PO and whether they can\ndeliver the ordered items or services. Order confirmations display for material orders, not service', page_no=115, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6cf9f434-d54a-49f7-b255-f55586b4a476'), chunk_index=504, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624271, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='orders.\n•\nShip notices: sent by the supplier either before or after shipping to indicate the name of the shipper\nand provide a delivery date.\n•\nReceipts: created by you or your organization to accept delivered items.\n•\nService entry sheets: created by the supplier or your organization to indicate that services were\ndelivered. These documents display in SAP Ariba Procurement solutions.\nHistory', page_no=115, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b0cf691e-4e9e-4aa5-bb10-eea5f8e04f3b'), chunk_index=505, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624275, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='A table that lists actions taken on the PO, including the date and time, user, action, and summary.\nActions performed by guided buying display as the user aribasystem.\n6. Choose View in SAP Ariba Procurement to display the PO in SAP Ariba Procurement solutions. You can then\nsave or print the PO. Choose Back to return to the PO in guided buying.\n7.', page_no=115, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('61d922ab-7116-4d1d-a65b-92c52f98f046'), chunk_index=506, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624279, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Choose the left arrow icon (\ue067\xa0) to return to Your requests.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nWorking with Purchase Orders\nPUBLIC\n115', page_no=115, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('fb738301-aafd-4c23-b38f-0d9a6460b00d'), chunk_index=507, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624359, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Changing Requests or POs\nIf you need to change a request or PO, you can do it after the PO reaches Ordered status. After your change has\nbeen approved, guided buying automatically sends the supplier a PO containing details of the change.\nPrerequisites\nIf your SAP Ariba solution is integrated with an ERP system, ensure that the Use\u202fERP purchase order\nnumber\u202ffrom database (Application.GuidedBuying.UseERPPONumberFromDB) parameter is enabled. This', page_no=116, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e3da0b4a-1b5e-4d34-8238-f11e58628447'), chunk_index=508, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624363, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="prevents change order failures caused by a missing ERP purchase order number in the integration message. For\nmore information, see Use\u202fERP purchase order number from database.\nContext\nConsider the following when changing requests or POs:\n•\nYou can change material or services items, quantities or amounts, or accounting information.\n•\nYou can't change spot buy line items, because you pay for them immediately upon ordering; however, you can", page_no=116, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('3594c460-07af-4277-bc21-d5bbc57b982d'), chunk_index=509, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624367, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="change accounting information.\n•\nTo change items from a supplier's external site, go back to the site from the request. After you make changes\non the site and check out again, the line item is changed in the request.\n•\nIf you already received some of the ordered quantity or service, guided buying doesn't allow you to change the\nquantity to less than the amount you already received or serviced.", page_no=116, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('760b9fbe-1427-487b-81d5-7214bdbaa5dc'), chunk_index=510, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624371, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='•\nIf you delete line items, they appear in the Canceled items section. You cannot delete lines that have been\npartially or fully received.\nProcedure\n1.\nOn the guided buying home page, choose Your requests.\n2. Scroll through the list of all types of requests (All) or filter by date. You can also use the Find a request search', page_no=116, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('518a060c-d402-4aa1-a3c9-7b9dcba45c99'), chunk_index=511, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624375, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='box to locate a request by one of the dropdown menu options: Request ID, Order ID, Request title, Supplier\nID, or Supplier name. When using the search filters, the search returns any request that contains the searched\nstring of text.\n\ue04c\xa0Tip\nItems are sorted by the date they were last changed.\n3. Choose the request ID to open it.\n4. Choose Change request.\n116\nPUBLIC', page_no=116, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('915c408f-11cd-4e40-8939-af4f48cd6738'), chunk_index=512, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624378, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Guided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nWorking with Purchase Orders', page_no=116, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('5cd1c3be-41c9-4bae-8fec-aa344e506580'), chunk_index=513, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624461, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="\ue201\xa0Caution\nThis button displays only after the request has reached Ordered state. It doesn't dispaly if the business\nprocesses defined in SAP Ariba Procurement solutions doesn't allow changes. For example, if changes\naren't allowed after orders are shipped or received, of if the supplier doesn't allow changes.\n5. Choose Confirm in the confirmation dialog box.\n6. Optional: On the Checkout page, you can do any of the following:\n•", page_no=117, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('cb7b6cc2-5248-4da2-a334-e2a0abdb719c'), chunk_index=514, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624465, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Edit the line items and other information you want to change.\n•\nTo add more items to the request, choose Continue shopping.\n\ue04c\xa0Remember\nIf the Continue shopping option isn't available, or if you're unable to delete items, it's because your\norganization doesn't allow it.\n7.\nChoose Check out to submit the changed request.\nResults\nThe request displays the status Change in progress.", page_no=117, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b80c69d7-c353-4094-83f0-63fb1b9fc7a4'), chunk_index=515, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624472, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Guided buying appends the version number to the request ID; for example, PR100-V2. A change order is sent to the\nsupplier to inform them about the changed item.\nCanceling Requests or POs\nIf you need to cancel a request or PO, you can do it after the PO reaches Ordered status. Guided buying then\nautomatically sends the supplier a notification stating that you don't want the PO fulfilled.\nContext", page_no=117, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2f6ff7b3-3e91-4958-aa05-c55ffcb6b06a'), chunk_index=516, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624476, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="If you're a regular user, you can cancel a request, which cancels all associated POs. If you're in the procurement\nmanager or purchasing manager group, you can also cancel specific POs, which leaves other POs in the request\nunchanged.\nBefore you can cancel a request or PO, guided buying must send the PO to the supplier and it must be in Ordered", page_no=117, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('dd0c328d-6540-4ee8-b682-ea8efc97b450'), chunk_index=517, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624480, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='status. You can cancel requests only after all POs from the request have been sent.\nWhen you cancel a request or PO, you have the following options:\n•\nYou can enter the cancellation reason. The text you enter is stored with the canceled PO.\n•\nYou can indicate whether to include the cancellation reason in the cancel notification sent to the supplier. You', page_no=117, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ec2634c6-5746-4cdf-9abb-7a6ade5c1e14'), chunk_index=518, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624483, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='might want to tell the supplier the business or technical reason for the cancellation. Alternatively, you might\nwant to not tell the supplier and keep the cancellation reason within your organization.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nWorking with Purchase Orders\nPUBLIC\n117', page_no=117, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e84fd078-c93d-4de4-a320-3d2b430f12fe'), chunk_index=519, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624579, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='•\nYou can copy the line items from the canceled request or PO to a new requisition for purchasing later. Copying\nline items allows you to make changes, such as changing item quantities or suppliers, without having to find\neach item again and add it to a request.\n\ue094\xa0Restriction', page_no=118, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('390d5c79-26ea-4cd4-839c-3ffa514f9e11'), chunk_index=520, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624583, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="If you need to cancel a request and then create a copy of the cancelled request, spot buy items and items from\nan external supplier site can't be copied onto the new request. If the request contained only external site or\nspot buy items, the Create a copy of the requisition option won't be available.\nProcedure\n1.\nOn the home page, choose Your Requests.", page_no=118, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('5d10bd20-e3c0-4a83-9644-890865e96149'), chunk_index=521, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624587, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='2. Scroll through the list of all types of requests (All) or filter by date. You can also use the Find a request search\nbox to locate a request by one of the dropdown options: Request ID, Order ID, Request title, Supplier ID, or\nSupplier name. When using the search filters, the search returns any request that contains the searched string\nof text.\n\ue05c\xa0Note', page_no=118, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('da70a2b6-4bff-4167-8d2a-a7dddc459cb4'), chunk_index=522, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624591, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Items are sorted by the date they were last changed.\n3. Choose the request ID to open it.\n4. Cancel the request or PO:\n•\nRegular users can cancel only the request, which cancels all associated POs. Choose Cancel request at\nthe top of the request. If this button isn't available, that means one of the POs from hasn't reached Ordered\nstatus.\n•", page_no=118, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6716beac-eda0-459f-98ec-943b8f079289'), chunk_index=523, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624595, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Users in the procurement manager or purchasing manager groups can cancel specific POs. Hover your\npointer over a PO ID and choose Cancel from the pop-up menu. If this command isn't available, the PO\nhasn't reached Ordered status.\n5. Fill out the Cancel requisition page (for requisitions) or Cancel PO page (for POs):\na. Enter the reason for the cancellation and indicate whether to share the reason with the supplier.", page_no=118, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6462903f-562b-4a68-b147-356fc1da5286'), chunk_index=524, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624599, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="b. Choose Create a copy of the requisition to copy the request contents before canceling the PO. Copying\nline items to a new request enables you to easily make changes and order them later.\nc. Choose Confirm.\n6. Depending on your organization's rules, other users might need to approve your cancellation request. After the\nlast user in the approval process approves the cancellation, the requisition or PO is canceled.\nResults", page_no=118, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0f15df81-02a9-423f-bcfd-764aa8215375'), chunk_index=525, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624603, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Requisitions display canceled items in a section at the bottom named Canceled items. Ordered items display at\nthe top of the requisition.\n118\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nWorking with Purchase Orders', page_no=118, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2cbd352b-56d4-409e-b242-7b19957f6c4f'), chunk_index=526, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624654, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Guided buying sends the supplier a cancel order, which informs the supplier that the PO should not be fulfilled. The\ncancel requisition has "-V2" appended to its ID (Example: PR100-V2), and its status is Cancellation in progress\nuntil it\'s approved, then Canceling, and after notifying the supplier, it changes to Canceled.', page_no=119, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2339ca73-d888-4dea-81ed-785e2b567230'), chunk_index=527, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624658, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="If you choose Create a copy of the requisition when canceling, guided buying creates a copy with a new ID (for\nexample, PR101), and puts it in Composing state in the Your requests page.\nIf you're a procurement or purchasing manager and you cancel a PO from a request that has multiple POs, guided", page_no=119, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('de1067b9-ccc0-4406-bcb0-e5f1c99bc213'), chunk_index=528, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624662, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='buying adds the contents of the canceled PO to a new version of the request and puts it in Submitted status. If you\nalso choose to copy the PO, guided buying copies all of the original request, even line items not in the canceled PO,\nand puts it in Composing status.\nNext Steps', page_no=119, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b7b15e62-176b-44f5-bdb6-4a39194f1eac'), chunk_index=529, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624666, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='If approvers deny the cancellation request, the cancellation (-V2) version is sent back to you. You can select which\nversion to use; you can continue to use the cancellation version or you can go back to the original version (-V1). To\ngo to the original version, choose View previous request then Recover request, and then choose Recover in the', page_no=119, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('34fed85c-6756-480e-88eb-e94a4155f68d'), chunk_index=530, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624670, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='confirmation dialog box. This action makes the original version of the request the active version, so you can change\nand resubmit it.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nWorking with Purchase Orders\nPUBLIC\n119', page_no=119, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0fe4d5af-e329-49aa-9f5a-926217449a95'), chunk_index=531, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624723, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Managing Invoices in Guided Buying\nYou can approve, make changes, or resolve errors on invoices in guided buying. To view invoice reconciliation\ndetails, you must navigate to SAP Ariba Buying and Invoicing.\nApproving Invoices in Guided Buying [page 120]\nChanging Invoices in Guided Buying [page 123]\nChecking Invoice Reconciliation Details in SAP Ariba Buying and Invoicing [page 125]\nResolving Errors on Invoices in Guided Buying [page 126]', page_no=120, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2182cc43-5f70-4273-82e3-c0a03d849bbc'), chunk_index=532, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624728, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Approving Invoices in Guided Buying\nYou can view, edit, and approve non-PO and PO invoices in Your Approvals. From there you can edit and approve\ninvoices.\nIf you're an approver of a request, you're notified of pending requests through email or through your dashboard.\nYou can view all pending approvals through\nYour Approvals\nTo approve\n.", page_no=120, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('04c9b5d0-d4f2-4e99-9916-f9c475e868c1'), chunk_index=533, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624731, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="The Approve button is available for invoices that you're an assigned approver of. When you click the Approve\nbutton, one of the following happens:\n•\nThe invoice is approved and becomes available in Recent approvals. This happens if the invoice doesn't\ncontain any errors.\n•\nThe invoice isn't approved because it contains errors.", page_no=120, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a6e5148d-8624-4348-bab6-8f018550b393'), chunk_index=534, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624735, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='If you had to resolve errors on an invoice, the invoice is sent to the next approver in the flow when you click\nApprove.\n120\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nManaging Invoices in Guided Buying', page_no=120, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ed9f7cd5-9506-456a-a7ff-3eb14f478d92'), chunk_index=535, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624741, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Invoices with unresolved errors open in view mode when you click the Approve button. Click Edit to open the\ninvoice in edit mode and resolve the errors.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nManaging Invoices in Guided Buying\nPUBLIC\n121', page_no=121, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c0bb96ba-9e3b-4309-a084-e304b7159391'), chunk_index=536, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624746, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='122\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nManaging Invoices in Guided Buying', page_no=122, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e578fe39-a8ce-4c99-990a-6bd3af32ec53'), chunk_index=537, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624792, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Changing Invoices in Guided Buying\nYou might want to edit invoices to change quantities, add taxes, or edit discounts. Once the changes are approved,\nthe invoice can be reconciled and the supplier can be paid.\nContext\n1.\nTo add approvers to the approval flow, click the add button (\ue058\xa0). Once all the approvers have approved the\ninvoice, it's sent to SAP Ariba Buying and Invoicing to be reconciled.", page_no=123, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2cecf220-ed9f-407f-865c-061fb290ff4b'), chunk_index=538, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624796, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='2. Click Edit to open the invoice in edit mode, which allows you to add taxes, charges, or discounts.\n3. The supplier address listed in the pay to supplier section is the remit to address, or the address the payment is\nsent to.\nFollow these guidelines when editing invoices in guided buying:\n•', page_no=123, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('9bd83784-1aac-4b4d-8e53-7447e4fb73ae'), chunk_index=539, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624800, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Taxes: You can add, edit, and delete header and line level taxes. If you add a header level tax, you can't add\nline level taxes. Withholding taxes can be edited, but they can't be added or deleted. Your organization decides\nwhich users can add taxes. You can add, delete, and edit taxes on invoices from an invoice conversion service\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases", page_no=123, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('23bedbd4-cf30-425e-a557-e9b8fdf3ec4d'), chunk_index=540, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624804, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Managing Invoices in Guided Buying\nPUBLIC\n123', page_no=123, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('20002883-c8f8-4807-9ecc-a57ea643eb9f'), chunk_index=541, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624888, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="(ICS invoices) and from the Italian interchange system (SDI invoices). However, you can't add or delete taxes\non regular invoices submitted through SAP Business Network.\n•\nCharges and discounts: You can edit charges and discounts, but they can't be added or deleted.\n•\nInvoice types only edited in SAP Ariba Buying and Invoicing: Contract invoices, service invoices, debit", page_no=124, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('cc08d81f-237b-4d96-9a8c-2a84e5222098'), chunk_index=542, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624892, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='memos, credit memos, service invoices, and summary (multi-PO) invoices can only be edited in SAP Ariba\nBuying and Invoicing.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nMaking the same change to multiple line items (mass edit) can only be made in SAP Ariba Buying and Invoicing.\nProcedure\n1.\nOn the guided buying home page, choose Your Requests.\n2. At the top of the page, choose Invoice requests.', page_no=124, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('9dae7bc0-8bda-42e7-ac88-166917fab962'), chunk_index=543, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624896, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='3. Find the invoice you want to work on. To find the request, scroll through the list of invoices or filter by date.\nSearching returns any request that contains the searched string of text. Items are sorted by the date they were\ncreated.\n4. Click an invoice to view the details.', page_no=124, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c1a4ccc4-23e2-453f-a34d-da902ab0887b'), chunk_index=544, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624900, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='The invoice opens with the approval process at the top. If there are errors on an invoice, you can click the\nwarnings or errors to view the details.\n5. Click Edit, and then choose Withdraw to make changes.\n6. To submit your changes for approval or save the invoice, do one of the following:\n•\nClick Send request at the top of the page to submit your changes for approval.', page_no=124, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('89ca4cb9-d22d-421a-b077-a1938318a998'), chunk_index=545, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624904, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="•\nClick the More options menu (\ue1f2\xa0) at the top and choose Save to save your edits without submitting the\ninvoice for approval. Changes that affect calculated fields are saved automatically. If you edit an invoice\nand try to exit with unsaved changes, you're prompted to save your changes before exiting.\n•\nIf you're a requester and an approver of an invoice, click Approve to approve the invoice.", page_no=124, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('16284969-29b3-497f-b2d9-034c85bdb06b'), chunk_index=546, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624908, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Related Information\nResolving Errors on Invoices in Guided Buying [page 126]\nApproving Invoices in Guided Buying [page 120]\n124\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nManaging Invoices in Guided Buying', page_no=124, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('43d1e39e-c363-4715-9bc4-f838b82d4189'), chunk_index=547, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624961, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Checking Invoice Reconciliation Details in SAP Ariba\nBuying and Invoicing\nWhen viewing an invoice in guided buying, you can click a link to check the progress and details of reconciliation in\nSAP Ariba Buying and Invoicing.\nPrerequisites\nYour administrator must enable the parameter, PARAM_ENABLE_EDIT_AND_APPROVAL_OF_INVOICES. For more\ninformation see, Guided Buying Parameters.\nContext\nYou can quickly navigate from guided buying to SAP Ariba Buying and Invoicing to find invoice reconciliation details', page_no=125, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('bf983562-e64f-498a-beff-48799c2329f9'), chunk_index=548, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624966, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='or make changes to the IR.\nProcedure\n1.\nTo find the invoice, open Your Requests from the home page.\n2. Choose Invoice requests.\n3. Use any of the following ways to find an invoice:\n•\nInvoice ID\n•\nInvoice number\n•\nInvoice title\n•\nSupplier name\n•\nInvoice status\n4. Click the invoice to view the details.', page_no=125, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0d4b7383-b9bb-43ed-8301-b3c307497b1a'), chunk_index=549, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 624969, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='5. To view the invoice reconciliation details in SAP Ariba Buying and Invoicing, click the IR document link that\nbegins with "IR", as shown in the following figure.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nManaging Invoices in Guided Buying\nPUBLIC\n125', page_no=125, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6442ea05-914d-424c-91a6-5d37bcf53994'), chunk_index=550, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625019, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='6. (Optional) To perform any reconciliation activities, click Open.\n7.\nTo return to the invoice in guided buying, do one of the following:\n•\nIf you viewed the IR, click the back button (\ue067\xa0) to return to guided buying.\n•\nIf you opened the IR, click Exit, and then click the back button (\ue067\xa0) to return to guided buying.\n•', page_no=126, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('f04b536d-b1d2-444c-93c0-df2fe2773ea6'), chunk_index=551, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625023, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="If you approved or saved the IR, click the Invoice ID to return to guided buying.\nIf you're not returned to guided buying, open guided buying manually.\nResolving Errors on Invoices in Guided Buying\nYou can view, edit, and approve non-PO and PO invoices in Your Approvals. When an invoice contains errors, you", page_no=126, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('8485b017-b2b3-4a40-bcc8-2b1756a23f99'), chunk_index=552, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625027, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='can resolve the errors in guided buying, and then approve the invoice. Errors on invoices in guided buying are\ntriggered by policies in guided buying, standard validations, or by custom validations in SAP Ariba Buying and\nInvoicing.\nInvoices submitted with errors have an error message that contains links to each error on your invoice. At the top', page_no=126, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('dafa6950-4085-4d3f-a93d-1e4dd36ba839'), chunk_index=553, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625031, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='of each error message, the reason for the error or warning is listed. Line items with the same warning or error are\ngrouped together.\n126\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nManaging Invoices in Guided Buying', page_no=126, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6e83ede1-d8ec-47b0-a245-de444e641012'), chunk_index=554, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625054, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="When you select an error on the message, you're taken to that error on the invoice. You must submit or save the\ninvoice to see if the changes you made resolved the errors. Whether you're editing an invoice or creating a new\ninvoice, errors for invalid entries don't appear until you click Submit or Approve. You can't approve invoices with\nunresolved errors or warnings.\nRelated Information", page_no=127, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('060e3d9c-ff0c-43e3-a991-3ea45c628c1f'), chunk_index=555, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625058, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Approving Invoices in Guided Buying [page 120]\nChanging Invoices in Guided Buying [page 123]\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nManaging Invoices in Guided Buying\nPUBLIC\n127', page_no=127, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('8fc9826c-3b82-4934-a3b3-5a2f531012cd'), chunk_index=556, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625109, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Managing Simple Non-PO Invoices\nSimple non-PO invoices are invoices with one line item that were created without a purchase order. You can create,\nchange, delete, and copy simple non-PO invoices in guided buying.\nCreating a Simple Non-PO Invoice [page 128]\nChanging, Deleting, or Copying Simple Non-PO Invoices [page 132]\nCreating a Simple Non-PO Invoice', page_no=128, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('23144668-cc4e-41ae-a2a2-da4bee35492d'), chunk_index=557, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625113, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Create a simple non-PO invoice to pay a supplier for a purchase that you initiated without a purchase order.\nPrerequisites\nYou must belong to one of the following groups to fill out a simple non-PO invoice form:\n•\nInvoice Entry User (non-PO)\n•\nInvoice Entry User\n•\nInvoice Agent\n•\nInvoice Manager\nContext', page_no=128, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ae32addf-5f7e-46b7-9109-6c533c6dcf61'), chunk_index=558, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625117, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='A simple non-PO invoice is a request for payment to a supplier. Create and submit one when you receive a product\nor service, but there is no associated purchase order.\nThey initiate payment for one-off purchases, such as:\n•\nConference fees\n•\nProfessional dues\n•\nCharitable donations\n•\nOne-time services, such as car washing\n•\nItems purchased outside of guided buying', page_no=128, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('651a833a-3746-493d-b6e8-371c64fe26d9'), chunk_index=559, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625121, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='They are for a single item or service and they support taxes (including withholding taxes), accounting information\n(including split accounting), and file attachments.\n128\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nManaging Simple Non-PO Invoices', page_no=128, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('808c688e-dd5f-4b0e-aaca-63115f1b4e0c'), chunk_index=560, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625211, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='\ue05c\xa0Note\nYour administrator might allow you to add additional lines to your invoices. For more information, see Changing\nInvoices in Guided Buying [page 123].\nProcedure\n1.\n(Optional) On the guided buying home page, select a different on-behalf-of user, company code, purchasing\nunit, or plant.\n2. Navigate to the landing page that contains invoice tiles. Click the invoice tile for the type of product or service\nyou purchased.', page_no=129, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('60ec430d-e7b3-4fb4-95e8-7f9a4c7760cb'), chunk_index=561, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625215, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="3. Enter a title at the top of the document. The title should indicate the purpose of the invoice at a glance. You can\nlater find this invoice by searching the title.\n4. Enter complete information for the invoice using data from your organization and the supplier's invoice. Most\nfields allow you to select values from recent invoices.\nField\nDescription\nCharge to\nA section containing the following fields:\n•", page_no=129, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('45bf5ae3-b989-406a-9115-dcd621cdc341'), chunk_index=562, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625219, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Requester: the user who received the product or serv-\nice.\n•\nCompany code: select the company code or account-\ning code that will be charged for the purchase.\nPay to\nA section containing the following fields:\n•\nSupplier: the company name of a supplier.\n•\nSupplier contact: a representative at the supplier.\n•\nRemit to address: the supplier's address for payment.\n•\nRemit to bank: the supplier's bank for payment.", page_no=129, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('785f493c-1d0d-472b-8936-4094865164a9'), chunk_index=563, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625226, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="These fields don't retain selections from previous invoices.\nSupplier Invoice #\nEnter a unique ID of the invoice. Your site might be con-\nfigured to automatically enter an invoice number; you can\nchange it if needed.\nInvoice Date\nSelect the date that appears on the supplier's invoice.\nNet amount\nThe amount of the invoice before taxes are subtracted.\nCommodity Code\nThe code for the purchased product or service.\nFull Description", page_no=129, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c7f3e9d8-32b8-4d37-98a5-724d7415504b'), chunk_index=564, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625230, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Enter a description of the purchased product or service.\nTaxes\nYour organization might allow you to add taxes to the invoice:\n1.\nClick Taxes to expand the Taxes section.\n2.\nClick Add tax.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nIf this control is not available, you can't add taxes to\nthe invoice.\n3.\nChoose Tax type to display a list of tax descriptions, or\nTax code if you know your organization's tax codes. You", page_no=129, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e79e30e3-98b8-4778-bcc1-5dae332be434'), chunk_index=565, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625234, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="can't combine the two kinds in an invoice.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nManaging Simple Non-PO Invoices\nPUBLIC\n129", page_no=129, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('7b7ced33-5556-416a-b310-d14d70c0c969'), chunk_index=566, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625323, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Field\nDescription\n4.\nChoose a tax from the list, such as Sales tax. You can\nalso search for the tax name, ID, or description.\n5.\nFor tax types, enter the tax value. For tax codes, guided\nbuying calculates the tax value automatically.\nYou can add "Withholding tax" if the supplier is config-\nured for that type of tax. If you delete the withholding', page_no=130, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e287d4a6-f696-4d01-bbe3-c6b7449af014'), chunk_index=567, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625327, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='tax line and then want to add it back, you must delete\nand re-add the supplier.\nYou can add multiple tax lines to the invoice by clicking\n+ Add tax. To delete a tax line, click the delete button\n(\ue03d\xa0).\nAccounting\nTo change the default accounting information for the invoice:\n1.\nClick Accounting to expand the Accounting section.\n2.\nChange the Account assignment, GL account, or Cost\ncenter values.', page_no=130, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('5d77e4d4-eb32-491f-bd99-425881019a80'), chunk_index=568, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625331, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='To divide the cost among multiple accounts, specify split\naccounting:\n1.\nClick Split accounting to expand the section.\n2.\nClick Percentage to split by percentages or Amount to\nsplit by monetary amounts.\n3.\nAllocate the cost by entering a percentage or amount\nfor each accounting split. Your values must total 100%\nor the full invoice amount.\n4.\nClick the arrow next to each accounting split and chose', page_no=130, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b048d771-2125-4e15-ab18-8ec294ba028d'), chunk_index=569, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625334, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='the correct account and cost center.\n5.\nClick Add split if you need to split the cost across addi-\ntional accounts.\n6.\nTo remove an accounting split, click the trashcan icon\nbeside it.\nNote that tax costs are allocated to the accounts using\nthe same ratios.\nYou can create up to 20 accounting splits.\nComments\nEnter comments that will help approvers understand the in-', page_no=130, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ac582d8a-7f2b-4a32-8d0c-b7e4f8f12a72'), chunk_index=570, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625338, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="voice. Click Add to save your comments. Afterward, you can\nclick Remove to delete your comments.\n5. You can attach supporting files, such as a copy of the supplier's invoice, by dragging and dropping the files\ninto the Attachments area or top-right of the invoice creation page, or clicking browse to select it from your", page_no=130, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('72c36515-e17f-48fa-81cf-12d4e09ddf29'), chunk_index=571, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625342, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='computer. The file can be in pdf, png, jpeg, jpg, jpe, jfif, gif, or tiff format.\n6. You can add a different approver or watcher to the approval flow by clicking the add button (\ue058\xa0) at the desired\nposition.\n130\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nManaging Simple Non-PO Invoices', page_no=130, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a7347047-c90b-4b90-93a8-a067f5b5c7e7'), chunk_index=572, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625413, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='7.\nTo save the invoice and keep it in Composing state, click Save.\nTo resume editing later:\na. Go to the Your requests area of your account.\nb. Click Invoice requests.\nc. Click an invoice number to display the invoice.\nd. Click Edit.\nAfter you finish editing, you can send the request or save your changes. You can also click the More', page_no=131, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c38ebefc-e6f9-46b0-8df1-ec716b1eeb5f'), chunk_index=573, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625417, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='options icon (\ue1f2\xa0) and delete the request, or add it to a project.\n8. Click Submit to send the invoice for approval and payment.\nThe invoice request is displayed below the approval graph.\n9. Click Done.\n10. A confirmation dialog box displays. Click Done to go to the home page.\nResults', page_no=131, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('1fca81ad-a027-48b2-b343-0b5a10b2e282'), chunk_index=574, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625421, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='When the invoice is fully approved and reconciled, payment is scheduled for the supplier. You can see the current\nstatus of the invoice by going to the Your requests area of your account and clicking Invoice requests.\nA Withdraw button in the invoice allows you to stop the approval process and revert the document to Composing', page_no=131, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ae6d6e0f-cdc6-4ecc-bd9f-77330416f33e'), chunk_index=575, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625424, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="state. When you withdraw a document, you can enter comments that are added to its Comments section.\nIf your organization tracks payments with SAP Ariba, then current remittance status and payment history appear\nat the top of invoices. Payment status is initially Paying and it progresses to either Paid or Payment failed. Before\na remittance is posted, it appears under Scheduled payments; after it's posted, it appears under Completed", page_no=131, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a0fd75da-8a45-4157-abfb-b2fc9d113035'), chunk_index=576, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625428, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='payments. The payment history lists payment date, payment method, bank name, and amount paid. You can click\nthe bank details to see the bank name, bank ID, and bank account ID.\nThe bottom of the page displays the history of the invoice, including date and time of each action, real user,\nuser (which might be different than real user due to on-behalf-of or delegation setting), action (such as Edited,', page_no=131, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6b9efe24-7a00-42bd-982f-ba0324017440'), chunk_index=577, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625432, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Guided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nManaging Simple Non-PO Invoices\nPUBLIC\n131', page_no=131, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c98f9600-6794-4425-a2fe-90b1afb42eaf'), chunk_index=578, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625504, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Submitted, Approved, or Denied), and a brief summary of the action. The History section can have multiple pages\nto show the complete invoice history.\nChanging, Deleting, or Copying Simple Non-PO\nInvoices\nYou can change, delete, or copy simple non-PO invoices.\nContext\nAfter you submit a simple non-PO invoice you can change some of the information, like adding comments or', page_no=132, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('893620b9-8423-4789-8574-df449b844e5c'), chunk_index=579, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625508, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='attachments, or you can delete it. If configured for your site, you can also copy simple non-PO invoices to create\nanother version that uses all the same information. Before you make any changes you must withdraw it, which\nremoves it from the approval process and puts it in Composing state.\n\ue094\xa0Restriction\nComments, attachments, and the approval flow from the previous invoice don’t copy onto the new invoice.', page_no=132, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('37aa9a4e-44d7-4eb9-8680-f4efc7d54f65'), chunk_index=580, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625512, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='You can withdraw invoices that are in only Submitted status.\nProcedure\n1.\nOn the guided buying home page, choose Your requests.\n2. At the top of the page, click Invoice requests.\n3. Scroll through the list of invoices or filter by date. You can also use the Find a request search box to locate an', page_no=132, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('70364bc2-46c2-40a0-91eb-e442b0a9f6e7'), chunk_index=581, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625515, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='invoice by one of the dropdown options: Invoice ID, Invoice number, Invoice title, Supplier name, or Invoice\nstatus. Searching returns any request that contains the searched string of text.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nItems are sorted by the date they were last changed.\n4. To search by status, set the criteria to Invoice status and select a specific status; guided buying automatically\nlists the invoices that have that status.', page_no=132, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('79d1e079-f419-41d9-98bf-7a1b40d5da5a'), chunk_index=582, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625519, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='5. Click an invoice.\nThe invoice displays with the approval process at the top.\n6. Click Edit at the top of the page.\n7.\nIn the Withdraw request window:\na. (Optional) In the text box, enter a reason for withdrawing the invoice. This text is added as a comment to\nthe invoice.\n132\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nManaging Simple Non-PO Invoices', page_no=132, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('62eba37c-78d7-4385-8d2e-2fce964b589e'), chunk_index=583, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625544, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='b. Click Withdraw to remove the invoice from the approval process or click Cancel to cancel the withdrawal\nprocess.\nWhen you withdraw an invoice, it is removed from the approval process and placed in Composing state.\n8. Make any required changes to the invoice. Alternatively, you can delete the invoice by clicking Delete request.\n9. Click Submit.\nResults', page_no=133, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('100c2969-0beb-464d-b32e-53918e90f0f6'), chunk_index=584, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625548, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='If you modified the invoice request, it is submitted and sent to the beginning of the approval process.\nIf you deleted the invoice request, it is removed from guided buying.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nManaging Simple Non-PO Invoices\nPUBLIC\n133', page_no=133, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('09785abe-5b79-49b0-97f0-b94ebf885ce9'), chunk_index=585, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625613, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Filling Out and Submitting an Externally\nManaged Form\nGuided buying might have forms that are labeled Externally Managed that are for tasks specific to your\norganization. You can fill out and submit one of these forms and guided buying sends it to an external application\nfor processing.\nContext\nExternally managed forms are custom forms that your organization might make available to you. The data in them', page_no=134, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('f896aaa9-8af5-4e76-bdef-e1286984ff6d'), chunk_index=586, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625617, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="is meant for external applications.\nAfter submitting an externally managed form, you can withdraw it during the approval process, but you can't cancel\nit.\nIf the form has an approval flow, it must be approved or denied after its submitted. Approvers can't edit it, but they\ncan add comments if the comments box displays.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nApproved custom forms do not display on the Recent approvals page.\nProcedure\n1.", page_no=134, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('9c093f69-b237-41cf-b138-a8cfbf5b932f'), chunk_index=587, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625621, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Click a tile that contains the description Externally Managed. A form displays with Externally Managed and an\nEM number in the header, which lets you know that the form will be sent to an external application.\n2. Select Requester name and choose your own name, or choose another user's name to create the form on\nbehalf of that user.\n3. Fill out the required and optional fields on the form.", page_no=134, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('f68093df-9ad1-4d30-b475-328728987060'), chunk_index=588, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625625, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="4. If the form has a supplier chooser, select one of the suppliers displayed or search for a different supplier.\n5. Click Submit to send the form.\nResults\nGuided buying sends the form to your organization's external application for further processing.\nExternally managed forms can have the following statuses:\n134\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nFilling Out and Submitting an Externally Managed Form", page_no=134, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4240f6de-0924-4107-9579-f517bca6c09c'), chunk_index=589, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625660, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Status\nDescription\nComposing\nThe form has been created but not submitted.\nSubmitting\nThe form is in process of being submitted.\nError\nGuided buying encountered an error when it attempted to\nsend the form to the external application. The form was not\nsubmitted.\nAwaiting Approval\nThe form is waiting for approval by guided buying approvers.\nRejected\nThe form was denied by guided buying approvers.\nSubmitted', page_no=135, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d0b8968e-9f74-438c-a546-62f0eb475b91'), chunk_index=590, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625664, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='The form was sent to the external system.\nNext Steps\nYou can view submitted forms and their statuses by going to the Your requests page and clicking the Other\nrequests tab.\nAfter a form has been processed by an external application, its header displays External status and External\nTransaction Identifier values, which are assigned by the external application. It might also contain other data from\nthe external application.', page_no=135, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b296ffe4-4d01-4ea7-82be-52e86bbe1a73'), chunk_index=591, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625668, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Guided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nFilling Out and Submitting an Externally Managed Form\nPUBLIC\n135', page_no=135, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('74d0e6ce-f86f-43b4-a80b-53c6d3a91260'), chunk_index=592, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625731, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Working with Procurement Workspace Projects\nYour organization might use procurement workspace projects, which can help you meet compliance or financial\ngoals. They allow you to group procurement activities so they can be managed together.\nCreating a Project [page 136]\nAdding a Request or Invoice to a Project [page 137]\nViewing Project Details [page 138]\nCreating a Project', page_no=136, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('98fd91cd-73eb-4783-b759-cd14159c0e8f'), chunk_index=593, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625735, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Your organization might allow you to create procurement workspace projects, which can help you meet compliance\nor financial goals. To create a project, you fill out and submit a project form, which might ask questions about your\ngoals.\nContext\nAfter you initiate a procurement workspace project, it is processed and approved by SAP Ariba Sourcing users,', page_no=136, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c4ccdb77-3ced-4f7a-84d8-d58ca62eaeaf'), chunk_index=594, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625740, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='which might include professional buyers and your sourcing desk. After the project is approved, you add guided\nbuying requests and invoices to it so they can be managed in terms of your goals.\nProcedure\n1.\nOn a landing page, click a project tile. A project form displays.\n2. At the top of the form, click the pencil icon to name the project.', page_no=136, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6c89a50d-c744-4abe-9bbe-3ef71d8b7588'), chunk_index=595, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625743, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='3. Fill in all the required fields and any optional fields.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nA red asterisk (*) indicates that a field is required.\n4. Click Create and continue.\n5. SAP Ariba Sourcing responds with the procurement workspace project ID, which starts with the prefix "PW."\nClick OK to view the project details.\n6. If there\'s a project-specific form for you to complete, perform these steps:', page_no=136, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a7381500-62be-4288-8513-b8ceb66d1d7b'), chunk_index=596, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625747, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='a. Fill in the required fields in the form and click the more options menu (\ue1f2\xa0) at the top and choose Project\nsummary.\n136\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nWorking with Procurement Workspace Projects', page_no=136, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4d1b08f7-3f9e-46f2-a380-ea01031ec5ea'), chunk_index=597, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625808, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='b. In the Documents section, click the name of the project-specific form you just completed.\nc. Review and update any field, then click one of the following commands:\nCommand\nDescription\nSubmit\nSaves the form and submits it for approval\nSave\nSaves the form, but does not submit it for approval\nReturn to project\nReturns to the parent project', page_no=137, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('26b9b9be-d397-42a6-96a1-aa9e5d4d96f1'), chunk_index=598, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625811, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Project-specific forms go through an approval flow in SAP Ariba Sourcing, then guided buying stores them\nin the project details. If you later edit and save them, they go through the approval flow again.\n7.\nIf there's a document for you to update, perform these steps:\na. Choose Upload documents in the Documents section.", page_no=137, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ae7db688-6e74-4e8b-9e2d-97ee617eaccc'), chunk_index=599, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625815, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='b. On the Documents tab in SAP Ariba Sourcing, click the document name and choose either Download\nDraft or Edit Attributes.\nc. Make any changes to the document and submit it.\nd. In the upper left corner, click the back arrow to return to guided buying.\nResults\nYour project form is sent to SAP Ariba Sourcing, which creates a procurement workspace project from it. The', page_no=137, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('de66ece2-22bf-4f47-bcf5-127c8085a6b1'), chunk_index=600, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625819, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='project is sent to other users to add additional data and for approval.\nAdding a Request or Invoice to a Project\nIf your organization uses procurement workspace projects, add your request or invoice to a project before\nsubmitting it so that your organization can track it.\nContext\nProcurement professionals create and approve procurement workspace projects to help organizations meet', page_no=137, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a7634df2-c033-439a-8f6e-5166b79539dd'), chunk_index=601, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625823, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='compliance or financial goals. You add your request or invoice to a project so it can be managed by other users.\nYou can add documents to projects that are in Approved or Approved and Completed status. You see only those\nprojects that you have permission to see.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nWorking with Procurement Workspace Projects\nPUBLIC\n137', page_no=137, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('f85b573b-98a4-43c2-b220-6013ae29e94c'), chunk_index=602, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625894, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Procedure\n1.\nAfter creating a request or invoice, but before submitting it, click the more options menu (\ue1f2\xa0) at the top of the\ndocument and choose Add to Project.\n2. Select a project through one of the following methods:\n•\nBrowse the list of available projects and click a project.\n•\nSearch for a project by Project ID, Project Title, or other project aspects, then click the project.', page_no=138, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('dae916b0-37da-40b0-9d41-91e912adb0fe'), chunk_index=603, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625898, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='3. Click Select to add the document to the chosen project.\n4. Click Confirm. The selected project title displays at the top of the document.\nYou can delete the project link anytime before submission by clicking the project title at the top of the\ndocument and choosing Remove from project.\n5. Click Submit.\nNext Steps', page_no=138, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('3a3f14ae-8cfb-4389-856b-3af270a4f8d2'), chunk_index=604, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625901, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='After you submit the document, neither you nor approvers can change the project assignment. To change the\nproject assignment, click Edit, withdraw the document, assign a different project, and then resubmit it.\nViewing Project Details\nThe Projects tab in the Your requests page lists all of your procurement workspace projects and their statuses. You\ncan click to view a project summary and details.\nContext', page_no=138, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6ce066ea-4409-4135-9b03-3c83ade1f009'), chunk_index=605, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625905, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Use the Projects tab to view all projects to which you have access. You can view project details in guided buying\nand click tasks to view them in SAP Ariba Sourcing, where you can make changes, depending on your group\npermissions.\nProjects can contain an unlimited hierarchy of sub projects, which allows you to organize complex procurement', page_no=138, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('3b928f40-cd28-415a-926d-bac157639c40'), chunk_index=606, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 625909, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='activities. Each project and sub project has its own tasks, documents, team members, requisitions, and invoices.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nYou can also view project details by clicking Project summary in project-specific forms, or by clicking a project\nin the Recent requests box on the guided buying home page.\n138\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nWorking with Procurement Workspace Projects', page_no=138, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2ffd5d5f-7322-4c6b-b920-5a84bf307abe'), chunk_index=607, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626023, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Procedure\n1.\nFrom the guided buying home page, choose Your requests.\n2. Click Projects to narrow the list to your procurement workspace projects.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nGuided buying groups projects by status.\n3. You can filter by Status or number of previous months. You can also search by Project ID, Project Title, or\nother project characteristics to find specific projects. Searching returns any projects that contains the text you\nenter.', page_no=139, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('bce26e6b-e954-46db-bc92-91415682956b'), chunk_index=608, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626027, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="4. To view project details, click the more options menu (\ue1f2\xa0) and choose See details.\n5. In the Project details page, the header displays the project status, form status, process flow, and the first few\nlines of the project overview. Click Show more to expand the header to show all lines.\n6. The page also lists the project's Requisitions & Invoices, Documents, Team, and Process Tasks. Each area", page_no=139, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('9b025100-b116-49c2-a53e-1b974c8c2512'), chunk_index=609, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626031, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='initially displays up to five items. Click View all to see all items in a particular area.\nThe Documents section lists the project-specific form first, then any uploaded documents and subprojects at\nthe current hierarchical level; click View all to display all documents and subproject in the current level.\nThe Team section lists the project owner first.\n7.', page_no=139, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d0681310-4de2-4893-a834-7df3a65e66f8'), chunk_index=610, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626035, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='The Tasks section lists tasks in the project and their status in SAP Ariba Sourcing; Pending, In Progress, or\nCompleted. For more information about a specific task, click the more options menu (\ue1f2\xa0) to the right of the\ntask name and choose View task details. This action displays the task in SAP Ariba Sourcing, where you might', page_no=139, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0865dff1-293c-4166-9123-7190f4bd122b'), chunk_index=611, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626038, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='be able to make edits depending on your group permissions. After a task is Completed, you can view it in\nread-only mode.\n8. To manage the Documents list, click the add documents icon (\n) and choose:\nOption\nDescription\nUpload documents\nAllows you to select documents on your computer to upload to guided buying\nCreate sub-projects Creates new projects within the existing project. Clicking this choice displays the header template', page_no=139, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a0d519a3-f45c-4a18-a4e5-9bbdd90c9602'), chunk_index=612, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626042, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='form for the project; fill it out to create a sub project.\n9. Click an item in the Documents list to navigate to it or download it. Depending on the type of document and\nyour permissions, you might be able to edit it. The icons in the Documents list have different aspects:\nDocument aspect Description\nSub-project', page_no=139, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('f3a7f7b7-6fbb-448a-9ce3-bacb37a51f30'), chunk_index=613, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626046, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Click a sub-project to open it. It displays the parent project's ID; click it to go up one level in the\nhierarchy.\nParent project\nClick the parent project to open it.\nIcon colors\nGreen: the item is finished and has been submitted.\nOrange: the item isn't finished and hasn't been submitted, yet.\nBlue: The item is a document file; click it to download it.", page_no=139, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b82e00ed-8d08-4d99-9967-bab8df55b751'), chunk_index=614, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626050, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='10. To manage the Team list, click the plus icon (\ue058\xa0) and choose:\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nWorking with Procurement Workspace Projects\nPUBLIC\n139', page_no=139, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2a8d79e7-f41b-4227-be8a-6e04d19b3e55'), chunk_index=615, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626073, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Option\nDescription\nAdd member\nAdds a user to the team\n11. To add a new transaction, click Create transactions in the Requisitions & Invoices section. Guided buying\ntakes you to the home page where you can create a request or invoice that is automatically added to the\nproject.\n12. To close the Project details page, click the back button (\ue067\xa0). Guided buying return you to the previous page.\n140', page_no=140, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('30bcfb86-ef4a-4a2b-8361-81001e0c5c37'), chunk_index=616, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626077, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='PUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nWorking with Procurement Workspace Projects', page_no=140, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('dff10087-7f75-44ed-a6f3-622bc1fadbc7'), chunk_index=617, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626156, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Acknowledging Receipt of Items or Completion\nof Services\nEnter receipts to acknowledge that the items you ordered have arrived. If you ordered services, you can indicate\nthat the supplier performed the requested service.\nContext\nSome organizations allow each employee to enter receipts for the items they've ordered, while others choose to\nreceive everything in a central location. Your organization's receipt-approval flow notifies the right individual or", page_no=141, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b41a5b66-cff3-45ae-8f45-e209fe310c5c'), chunk_index=618, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626160, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='group when action is required.\nA purchase order can have more than one receipt. For example, an order might be only partially received due to the\nitems being on backorder, or you might reject some items due to damage incurred during shipping. If the order is\npartially received and remains open, you enter additional receipts as the remaining items are delivered.', page_no=141, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('bfafab20-c063-465e-9150-31e1d6035fc2'), chunk_index=619, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626164, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="The To receive list displays purchase orders to the requisition preparer and the requester (for buying on-behalf-of\nsomeone else) only.\nIf your organization uses automatic receiving, purchase orders configured for auto-receiving display in the\nnotification bell and in the To receive list. You can't manually receive them.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nIf you don’t have permission to perform receiving for the order, the Receive and Receive all buttons aren't\navailable.", page_no=141, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('655419dc-a0b2-4325-bad5-321142b783ce'), chunk_index=620, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626168, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Preparers for on-behalf-of orders cannot receive such orders, even if they belong to the Receiving Agent group.\nProcedure\n1.\nTo begin the receiving process, do one of the following:\n•\nIn the upper right corner, click the notification bell icon (\ue23a\xa0) and choose a request that is pending a receipt.\n•\nTo see a full list of items waiting to be received, go to\nYour requests\nTo receive\n.', page_no=141, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a4cad463-d208-432b-9214-ca4154e673c0'), chunk_index=621, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626172, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Filter by date or enter text in the Find an order search box. When searching, enter only the number, not the\nprefix of the order. For example, enter 123 to find order PO123.\nGuided buying lists Material orders, then Service orders, and then Material and service orders.\n2. Perform one of the following actions:\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nAcknowledging Receipt of Items or Completion of Services\nPUBLIC', page_no=141, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('10eb6092-517d-493d-b36b-2eb9e38f79f8'), chunk_index=622, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626176, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='141', page_no=141, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('3de4308d-1360-4f4b-8a5f-050f0e1d5999'), chunk_index=623, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626247, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='•\nTo receive all material items in an order, click Receive all to populate\nthe full quantities or amounts in the Accepted field for each line item.\n•\nIf you’re receiving some material items in an order, enter the quantity or amount you’re receiving in the\nAccepted field.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nIf you previously accepted the wrong quantity or amount, you can enter a negative value in the', page_no=142, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('5f22792d-2658-4e82-8423-c31709055f95'), chunk_index=624, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626251, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Accepted field (for example, -3) to correct the mistake.\n•\nIf you’re receiving a service, click Receive.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nYou must belong to the Service Sheet Entry User group to create a service sheet against service\norders.\nGuided buying opens a page in SAP Ariba Procurement solutions. Click Create Service Sheet, click Add', page_no=142, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('43293c28-fd85-477a-9c42-679e4953635a'), chunk_index=625, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626255, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='items to add items to the service entry sheet, fill in the required fields on the service sheet, and click\nSubmit.\n•\nClick the purchase order number to view the purchase order, including the status of each line item; for\nmore information, see Finding POs [page 112].\n3. Click Submit to submit the receipt.\nResults', page_no=142, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('da4325c3-224a-485c-a258-6acd97745b01'), chunk_index=626, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626259, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="If you enter a partial receipt, the order status changes from Ordered to Receiving. It remains in the To receive list\nuntil it's fully received. After you receive all the items from the order, the order status changes to Received.\nOrders can contain a mix of material items and service items, but guided buying allows you to receive only material", page_no=142, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('fabbf6aa-1f6c-45b0-8395-c164ac508a83'), chunk_index=627, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626262, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='items. To receive service items, click Receive; guided buying sends you to SAP Ariba Procurement solutions where\nyou create a service entry sheet.\n142\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nAcknowledging Receipt of Items or Completion of Services', page_no=142, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6b3a1d94-92d6-400a-a04b-509d0fd9ceac'), chunk_index=628, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626335, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Related Information\nReopening an Order for Receiving [page 143]\nReceiving Orders On Behalf of Others [page 144]\nReopening an Order for Receiving\nIf an order is fully received (Received status) but you need to add additional receiving information, you can reopen\nit for receiving. Reopening an order is useful if it was received (accepted or rejected) in error.\nProcedure\n1.', page_no=143, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6feb247d-7603-4fa1-bf41-fd09a718b022'), chunk_index=629, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626340, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='To reopen an order for receiving, go to the home page and choose Your requests.\n2. Choose the All tab.\n3. Search for the order by Request ID, Order ID, Request title, Supplier ID, or Supplier name. When searching,\nenter only the number, not the prefix of the request or order. For example, enter 123 to find order PO123.', page_no=143, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('738c81de-439a-49d3-8d1a-f6caa3d32b21'), chunk_index=630, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626344, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='4. In the search results, click the Order ID, which appears below the Request ID.\n5. On the Select Receipt step, click Reopen Order.\n6. Specify values in the Accepted and Rejected fields.\n\ue16d\xa0Example\nIf you previously accepted all items in an order for 10 items, but now you want to accept only 8 and reject', page_no=143, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('9be8b3c4-a725-48fd-8c62-cb82c6c3ef3f'), chunk_index=631, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626347, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="the remaining 2, enter -2 in the Accepted field and 2 in the Rejected field. This means that out of the 10\nthat were originally accepted, you now want to accept only 8. This is why you enter a negative value in the\nAccepted field.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nA negative value in the Accepted field doesn't automatically mean this value has been rejected, unless it is", page_no=143, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('9a156127-264b-43c2-a04c-53b780f4fc5a'), chunk_index=632, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626351, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='explicitly specified in the Rejected field.\n7.\nIf you rejected some items on the order, complete the Goods Return Tracking Number field.\n8. Click Submit.\n9. On the Additional Info page, click Summary.\n10. Click Submit.\nResults\nAfter you submit the receipt, you are taken back to the To receive section.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nAcknowledging Receipt of Items or Completion of Services\nPUBLIC\n143', page_no=143, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4a7f46bf-5d95-4826-aed6-bdc119058120'), chunk_index=633, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626415, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Receiving Orders On Behalf of Others\nYour organization might allow you to accept or deny other people's orders when you're an approver in the receipt\napproval flow.\nProcedure\n1.\nOn the home page, choose Your requests.\n2. Click To receive and then click Receive orders on behalf of others.\nYou are taken to the page where you can search for an order that needs receiving.\n\ue05c\xa0Note", page_no=144, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('bb7cd128-6c40-465d-a02c-13a66b586ddb'), chunk_index=634, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626419, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="If this command isn't available, your organization doesn't allow you to receive on behalf of others.\n3. On the Select Request step of the receiving wizard, do one of the following:\n•\nClick Search to find everything that needs receiving.\n•\nSearch by a particular order ID or other document number.\n4. Click the link for one of the orders in the Order ID column.", page_no=144, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('5cece8fa-35bb-4c99-b5b0-66dc8209b891'), chunk_index=635, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626423, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="5. (Optional) If there's more than one receipt for the order, choose the receipt on the Select Receipt step.\n6. On the Receive step, do one of the following:\n•\nIf the order hasn't been fully received yet, click Accept All to mark all the items as received or enter\nreceiving information for the line items on the order, and then click Submit.\n•", page_no=144, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('3e755972-4531-4c37-b348-fd9bd09bc2f1'), chunk_index=636, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626426, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="If the order was fully received, click Approve or Deny to accept or reject the receiving totals entered by\nanother user in the receipt approval flow.\n•\nIf you don’t have permission to perform receiving for the order, the Receive button isn't available.\nResults\nAfter you take action on a receipt, guided buying returns you to the Your requests page.\n144\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases", page_no=144, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ac91b1f3-732f-43a5-b2c5-ff87c31001f5'), chunk_index=637, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626430, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Acknowledging Receipt of Items or Completion of Services', page_no=144, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('5316f8cc-1bbb-4dc7-86c7-1870bce28860'), chunk_index=638, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626501, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Team Buying and Receiving\nGuided buying allows you to collaborate when purchasing, which leverages the combined procurement skills of\nindividuals.\nYou and your administrators create teams of users who work together to create RFQs, requisitions, and receipts for\na common organizational goal.\nTeam buying enables you to cooperate during procurement, for example:\n•\nTeams perform the procurement work for particular organizational projects or programs.\n•', page_no=145, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2b25266a-ebb1-48cd-b88f-9185924b6d8a'), chunk_index=639, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626505, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Teams can ensure continuity of business processes if requesters aren't available to manage requisitions or\nreceipts.\n•\nCentral purchasing groups can work collaboratively as teams to process requisitions.\nTeam buying is implemented for RFQs, requisitions, and receipts. Other types of requests aren't affected; for\nexample, non-PO invoices are created by individual users, not teams.\n\ue05c\xa0Note", page_no=145, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c5124dc1-6d1a-4540-b85c-25deb6300bfb'), chunk_index=640, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626509, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Guided buying teams are completely separate from teams in SAP Ariba Procurement solutions. Guided buying\nteam requisitions aren’t supported in SAP Ariba Procurement solutions; similarly, SAP Ariba Procurement\nsolutions team requisitions aren't supported in guided buying.\nTeam requests use the company code, purchasing unit, and plant of the team owner. The on-behalf-of (OBO)", page_no=145, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('7f6bf58f-1fa5-45ba-a311-1350a4b5a39c'), chunk_index=641, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626513, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="functionality is disabled and the Requester or Preparer field in team requests is set to the name of the team owner\nand can't be changed. To buy on behalf of other users, company codes, purchasing units, or plants, you must first\nturn off team buying in your account.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nYour administrator might not make team creation available to you.\nTurning on Manual Team Buying and Receiving [page 146]", page_no=145, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('da42bede-626a-4c2a-9ca1-3b0e99f7b584'), chunk_index=642, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626517, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Turning on Automatic Team Buying [page 148]\nManaging Your Teams [page 149]\nCreating a Team RFQ [page 155]\nBuying with a Team [page 157]\nReceiving with a Team [page 160]\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nTeam Buying and Receiving\nPUBLIC\n145', page_no=145, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e4b78476-f7b6-4e51-805d-508803e66906'), chunk_index=643, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626563, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Turning on Manual Team Buying and Receiving\nYou can turn on team buying manually before starting an RFQ or request.\nContext\nIf you've been added to a team, you can quickly select it before buying.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nYour administrator might not make team creation available to you.\nTeam buying and receiving affects only RFQs, requests, and receipts. Other types of documents aren't affected; for", page_no=146, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c3fb5b83-8d68-4471-80ea-f2f1c6b0d48f'), chunk_index=644, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626567, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='example, non-PO invoices are created by individual users, not teams.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nManual team buying turns off for your account when you submit the RFQ or request. To set your account to use\nteam buying every time you sign in, see Turning on Automatic Team Buying [page 148].\nTo turn on team buying for individual RFQs or requests as you create them, see Buying with a Team [page 157].', page_no=146, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('df59c0b9-5872-4ff6-9490-7d9954afb921'), chunk_index=645, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626571, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='When you buy for a team, the RFQ or request uses the company code, purchasing unit, and plant of the team\nowner. The on-behalf-of (OBO) functionality and the Requester field in requests are disabled.\nProcedure\n1.\nIn the guided buying home page, select\nQuick Links\nBuy with a team\n.\n146\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nTeam Buying and Receiving', page_no=146, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('73d522ba-d465-44d8-86ad-04591c7bfa3d'), chunk_index=646, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626649, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="If the choices in the Quick Links menu are grayed out, you are already buying on behalf of another user, plant,\ncompany code, or team. To turn of the on behalf of mode, click Stop in the banner.\n2. Click the down arrow, scroll to the team you want, and click to choose it.\nGuided buying displays only the teams on which you're an owner or contributor.", page_no=147, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4ed5c1bc-4df7-433e-972f-2ec1296a78df'), chunk_index=647, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626653, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Up to 50 teams display and they're ordered alphabetically. You can't view or select teams beyond team 50.\nIf there are no teams listed, your organization might allow you to create one. For more information, see\nManaging Your Teams [page 149].\n3. The Turn on Team Receiving button is Yes by default, which means that any team contributor can perform", page_no=147, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('de315f6e-e786-4438-a7b8-62634a4b266e'), chunk_index=648, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626656, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="receiving. If you set this control to No, then receipts you create for the request are regular receipts, not team\nreceipts.\nNote that this setting is for only one request and doesn't affect other requests.\n4. Click Start, which turns on team buying and receiving.\nThe banner at the top of the guided buying window indicates that you've turned on team buying:", page_no=147, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('16a8ff47-748e-47af-84e8-ae17bbf90ab0'), chunk_index=649, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626660, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='5. You can turn off team buying by clicking Stop in the banner at the top of the guided buying window.\nResults\nAfter submitting a RFQ, request, or receipt, guided buying turns off team buying. To have it stay on, use automatic\nteam buying; for more information, see Turning on Automatic Team Buying [page 148].', page_no=147, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0898c260-812d-4662-9d41-bd5c42683719'), chunk_index=650, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626664, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='To manually turn off team buying click Stop in the banner at the top of the guided buying window.\nTeam buying also stops when you sign out.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nSome organizations display fields named Is Team Requisition and Is Team Received in requisitions. These\nfields display the team buying setting from SAP Ariba Procurement solutions, such as SAP Ariba Buying, not', page_no=147, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4f14fe31-de05-4ec3-b3f0-f272746c8ab1'), chunk_index=651, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626667, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='guided buying. To change team buying in guided buying, use the team buying and receiving control described\nabove.\nTask overview: Team Buying and Receiving [page 145]\nRelated Information\nTurning on Automatic Team Buying [page 148]\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nTeam Buying and Receiving\nPUBLIC\n147', page_no=147, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('28f96b51-48dd-4e01-8e2b-456ae8d523ad'), chunk_index=652, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626709, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Managing Your Teams [page 149]\nCreating a Team RFQ [page 155]\nBuying with a Team [page 157]\nReceiving with a Team [page 160]\nTurning on Automatic Team Buying [page 148]\nBuying with a Team [page 157]\nTurning on Automatic Team Buying\nYou can turn on automatic team buying, so that you use it every time you sign in.\nPrerequisites', page_no=148, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b1309c0f-be6e-499a-9123-466c374bfd77'), chunk_index=653, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626713, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Before turning on automatic team buying, you must select a default team so that guided buying knows which team\nto use. For more information, see Managing Your Teams [page 149].\nContext\nAutomatic team buying enables you to use your default team every time you sign in; you won't have to select a\nteam before purchasing.\nProcedure\n1.\nIn the upper right corner of your dashboard, click your name.", page_no=148, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('707ff2c0-58ab-4c60-bd9a-b21d9acd4d0c'), chunk_index=654, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626717, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='2. Choose Manage your teams from the menu.\n3. Turn on the Automatic team buying slider:\n4. When you enable automatic team buying, team receiving is disabled by default. To enable team receiving, you\nmust edit the team buying settings for the requisition during check out. On the Checkout page, click Edit team\nbuying setting to enable team receiving.\n148\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases', page_no=148, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('660affcf-3429-422b-b772-3e7bde05751f'), chunk_index=655, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626721, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Team Buying and Receiving', page_no=148, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0f75c166-c333-49bf-b605-1a3fb6df71f4'), chunk_index=656, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626768, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Results\nYou can turn off team buying for the session by clicking Stop in the banner at the top of the guided buying window.\nTask overview: Team Buying and Receiving [page 145]\nRelated Information\nTurning on Manual Team Buying and Receiving [page 146]\nManaging Your Teams [page 149]\nCreating a Team RFQ [page 155]\nBuying with a Team [page 157]\nReceiving with a Team [page 160]', page_no=149, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b39a1d79-535b-4fa1-acec-c3b59bbe68a3'), chunk_index=657, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626772, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Turning on Manual Team Buying and Receiving [page 146]\nBuying with a Team [page 157]\nManaging Your Teams\nYour administrator might have assigned you to one or more teams. In addition, you can create new teams and\nassign users to them.\nContext\nYou can set your default team, which determines which team you use if you turn on automatic team buying and\nreceiving.\n\ue04c\xa0Remember', page_no=149, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('12c6b244-9f7b-4439-b36e-fec9f9986d06'), chunk_index=658, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626776, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Your organization might not allow you to create or manage teams. In this case, your administrator creates and\nmanages teams and you can't add, manage, or delete team memberships.\nProcedure\n1.\nChoose your name in the upper right-hand title bar and choose Manage your teams.\nGuided buying displays the Manage your teams page.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nTeam Buying and Receiving\nPUBLIC\n149", page_no=149, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4854510d-3067-4272-8c08-4c12fa8c6ae2'), chunk_index=659, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626818, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='2. The Your teams section lists the teams that you own and your default team. The most recently added one\ndisplays first in the list after your default team (if you selected a default). To create a new team, choose the add\nicon ( \ue058\xa0).\n\ue094\xa0Restriction\nYour organization might make this control unavailable.', page_no=150, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('225432cd-0384-4920-96f2-187d1f20fd71'), chunk_index=660, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626822, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='a. The first page of the Create a team window displays, as shown in the following figure.\nThis page contains the following fields:\nField\nDescription\nTeam name\nAn arbitrary title for the team. This name is visible to\nteam members.\nDescription\n(Optional) A brief explanation of the purpose of the team.\nSet as your default team\nIf you have Automatic team buying turned on, guided', page_no=150, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('78661507-0114-4c7b-991c-234bca27d10f'), chunk_index=661, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626825, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='buying uses this team each time you sign in. For more\ninformation, see Turning on Automatic Team Buying\n[page 148].\nb. Choose Next.\nThe second page displays the Create a team window, as shown in the following figure.\n150\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nTeam Buying and Receiving', page_no=150, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('1bfc0444-a734-489a-a529-2a28c0b21d4c'), chunk_index=662, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626855, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="You can do the following from the Create a team window:\nField\nDescription\nAdd team members\nThe name of the team member to add.\nEnter the first few characters of the user's name and\nguided buying automatically finds matches.\nTeam members\nThe names of users who are part of the team.\nRole\nThe job or responsibility of the team member.\nYou can assign team members the following roles:\n•", page_no=151, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4cbae30b-3bd6-4de3-9e08-6e472627ee8a'), chunk_index=663, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626859, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Team owner: Creates and manages the team. Can\nadd and remove members to the team. There is only\none team owner. Only administrators can change the\nteam owner.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nTeam Buying and Receiving\nPUBLIC\n151', page_no=151, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('11960ce4-a7f6-4cc9-9217-743772b67090'), chunk_index=664, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626923, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Field\nDescription\n•\nContributor (default): Adds and edits procurement\ndocuments and receipts for the team. Contributors\ncan't copy or delete line items. To perform\nreceiving, contributors must belong to the group\nnamed Receiving agent, Receiving Administrator,\nor Receiving manager. Contributors that are also\nadministrators can add and remove team members\nand change their roles.\n•\nViewer: Views the procurement activities performed\nby other team members. Cannot create or edit", page_no=152, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('206653b0-4004-46da-8e87-e8ce997bee7e'), chunk_index=665, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626927, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='requisitions or receipts, and cannot add members to\nthe team.\nc. Choose Create.\nA new tile for your team displays in the Your teams list, as shown in the following figure.\n3. After adding a team, you can choose the more options menu (\ue1f2\xa0) to perform the following operations:\nCommand\nDescription\nEdit team info\nAllows you to change the team name and description.\nAdd team members', page_no=152, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('502e4f0e-e3bf-439d-a91c-d081c4b9d514'), chunk_index=666, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626930, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Allows you to add and remove team members and change\ntheir roles.\nManage team members\nAllows you to add and remove team members and change\ntheir roles.\nSet as default team\nSets this team as your default team. If you turn on\nAutomatic team buying, guided buying uses this team\neach time you sign in. For more information, see Turning\non Automatic Team Buying [page 148].\nCancel default team', page_no=152, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('976a3afd-e914-449b-b842-f441cf74a568'), chunk_index=667, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626934, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="(Available if the team is the default) Turns off the default\nteam setting for this team.\nDelete the team\nRemoves the team and its team members. Note that you\ncannot delete a team after it's used in a requisition or\nreceipt.\n152\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nTeam Buying and Receiving", page_no=152, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('79a2a4bf-1a56-461a-82e6-de2a0fc43be7'), chunk_index=668, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626986, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="4. The Teams in which you participate section lists the teams on which you're a member (contributor or viewer).\nThe most recently added team displays first on the list.\n5. Find a specific team by filtering by whether you're a contributor, viewer, or both, or by searching for a specific\nteam name.", page_no=153, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e73b0763-71c7-4492-90cc-772e073edde9'), chunk_index=669, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626990, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='6. Choose the arrow icon (\ue066\xa0) to the right of the team to display information about the team.\nThe Team information window displays, as shown in the following figure.\nChoose the close icon (\ue03e\xa0) to collapse the team information.\n7.\nClick the more options menu (\ue1f2\xa0) and choose one of the following commands:\nCommand\nDescription\nSet as default\nteam', page_no=153, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('5d04c6e7-a324-4764-93fd-c1c87f6a1648'), chunk_index=670, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626994, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Sets this team as your default team and adds it to the Your teams section of the page. If you turn on\nAutomatic team buying, guided buying uses this team each time you sign in. For more information, see\nTurning on Automatic Team Buying [page 148].\nCancel default\nteam\n(Available if the team is the default) Turns off the default team setting for this team and removes it from', page_no=153, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('eb6cac37-9b23-4ad5-a617-37cd27cd7b29'), chunk_index=671, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 626997, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='the Your teams section of the page.\nLeave team\nRemoves your name from the team. Note that your organization might make this control unavailable.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nTeam Buying and Receiving\nPUBLIC\n153', page_no=153, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('19bc623c-a4a9-4984-8666-e07d2ad98327'), chunk_index=672, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627027, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="8. Click the add icon (\ue058\xa0) to edit team membership and the Add team members window displays, as shown in the\nfollowing figure.\n\ue201\xa0Caution\nYour organization might not allow you to edit team memberships.\nYou can perform the following operations from this window:\nOperation\nDirections\nAdd a new team member\nEnter a user's name in the text box. Guided buying finds", page_no=154, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('3d8d7c61-e124-436f-984d-7661f14a45c6'), chunk_index=673, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627031, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="matching users as you type; select one to add it to the team\nas a contributor.\nChange a team member's role\nClick the role beside the user's name and select\nContributor or Viewer.\n154\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nTeam Buying and Receiving", page_no=154, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('f9638a47-caa7-4c3c-afb4-a35f595dfaf1'), chunk_index=674, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627073, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Operation\nDirections\nRemove a team member\n(Available after you select a team member, but before you\nclick Add) Place your mouse pointer on the user\'s name\nand click the red "x" that appears.\n9. Click Add.\n\ue094\xa0Restriction\nYou can add new team members, but only the team owner or your administrator can remove team\nmembers.\nResults\nAny team or member changes made are immediately visible to users.', page_no=155, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e1d9ac5f-80d7-4c45-aa5f-410d3ee51ae4'), chunk_index=675, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627077, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Task overview: Team Buying and Receiving [page 145]\nRelated Information\nTurning on Manual Team Buying and Receiving [page 146]\nTurning on Automatic Team Buying [page 148]\nCreating a Team RFQ [page 155]\nBuying with a Team [page 157]\nReceiving with a Team [page 160]\nCreating a Team RFQ\nTeams can collaborate to create RFQs and send them to suppliers.\nPrerequisites', page_no=155, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('3a640c36-f82f-45fa-be93-30c7fdee1110'), chunk_index=676, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627080, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Turn on team buying, either through Quick Links [page 146] or by turning on automatic team buying and receiving\n[page 148].\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nTeam Buying and Receiving\nPUBLIC\n155', page_no=155, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0b98df54-eeb3-4463-aaa6-d73d0ed9c519'), chunk_index=677, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627136, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Context\nTeams can edit RFQs when they are in Composing state.\nAfter awarding a team RFQ, the resulting requisition uses the same team as the RFQ. It doesn't retain the team\nreceiving setting, but you can set it manually.\nThis feature supports self-service, low-touch, and high-touch RFQs. It doesn't support sourcing requests.\nProcedure\n1.\nOn the guided buying home page, select\nQuick Links\nBuy with a team", page_no=156, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('463d96f3-7c22-4f80-bfa9-dca2e38d463f'), chunk_index=678, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627140, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='and select a team. Alternatively,\nyou can use automatic team buying to use the same team for all requests.\n2. Start an RFQ. Guided buying displays icons for the team members on the top right corner of the RFQ:\n3. At any point while editing, click Save to save the RFQ. The RFQ becomes available to others in your team for\nviewing or editing, depending on their team role.', page_no=156, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('21088e55-6cf7-416c-aa84-a100c59e46f7'), chunk_index=679, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627144, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="4. You or any team member with the contributor role can click Submit to send the RFQ.\nGuided buying records your name as the preparer and the team owner is the requester.\nResults\nUnlike team buying and receiving, users can't change the team after they create an RFQ. To change the team, they\nmust delete the RFQ and create a new one.", page_no=156, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ecca4bfe-0386-461d-8b51-c91f1cabac90'), chunk_index=680, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627148, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="After the RFQ has been awarded, you or any contributor can create a purchase requisition (PR) from it. The\nresulting purchase requests are available in the Awarded quotes section. To view one, click View PR and choose it\nfrom the list.\nThe team assigned to these purchase requisitions can't be changed.\nTask overview: Team Buying and Receiving [page 145]\n156\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases", page_no=156, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('49e7a37a-2dcb-4a5b-84f3-2f3842c64d7e'), chunk_index=681, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627152, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Team Buying and Receiving', page_no=156, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('def02dfa-69cb-45de-98c1-8defa66c091c'), chunk_index=682, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627215, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Related Information\nTurning on Manual Team Buying and Receiving [page 146]\nTurning on Automatic Team Buying [page 148]\nManaging Your Teams [page 149]\nBuying with a Team [page 157]\nReceiving with a Team [page 160]\nRequesting Quotes from Suppliers [page 73]\nBuying with a Team\nTeam buying allows you to collaborate with other users when purchasing.\nPrerequisites', page_no=157, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('78246b71-5700-4a47-b649-683f45b528d7'), chunk_index=683, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627218, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Turn on team buying, either through Quick Links [page 146] or by turning on automatic team buying and receiving\n[page 148].\nAlternatively, you can turn on team buying for individual requests by following the instructions below.\nContext\nWhen you buy with a team, you allow other users in your team to edit your request before submission. They can', page_no=157, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('9fb0a49a-8093-47a8-847d-dc9326edb409'), chunk_index=684, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627226, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='change fields, delete items, or add additional items. All contributors in the team have the same permissions as the\npreparer or requestor. While the requisition is in Composing state, any contributor can make any edits.\nAll contributors and the team owner can submit a requisition.\nWhen you buy with a team, the request uses the company code, purchasing unit, and plant of the team owner. The', page_no=157, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('7ed8e2de-d7d9-4305-a817-e3891a5492a0'), chunk_index=685, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627230, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="on-behalf-of (OBO) functionality is disabled and the Requester or Preparer field in requests is set to the name of\nthe team owner and can't be changed.\nProcedure\n1.\nStart purchasing an item or service through one the following methods:\n•\nCatalog; for more information, see Finding an Item or Service [page 28].\n•\nNon catalog; for more information, see Requesting a Non-Catalog Item or Service [page 53].", page_no=157, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('786227ba-49f0-45d7-afc3-5935f2f5ef2a'), chunk_index=686, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627234, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='2. After adding line items, click Check out.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nTeam Buying and Receiving\nPUBLIC\n157', page_no=157, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c6782aef-16b3-4238-9887-3b7194d9774e'), chunk_index=687, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627281, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='3. On the Checkout page, you can start or stop team buying for the request:\na. Click the more options menu (\ue1f2\xa0) and choose Edit team buying setting.\nb. In the Edit team buying setting window, set Turn on team buying? and Turn on team receiving? to Yes or\nNo.\nc. Use the Your team for this requisition? menu to select a team.', page_no=158, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e7138919-f49e-41ef-8196-de77917f435f'), chunk_index=688, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627285, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Up to 50 teams display and they\'re ordered alphabetically. You can\'t view or select teams beyond team 50.\nd. Click Save.\nIf you turn on team buying, the phrase "Team buying checkout" appears at the top of the request and\ncolored circles display for the first four members of the team. A fifth circle indicate the number of\nadditional team members.', page_no=158, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d5b551e2-a24d-492a-a1fb-02b5a8bd97d2'), chunk_index=689, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627289, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="4. Continue filling out required and optional fields in the request.\n5. Click Save and exit, which saves the request in Composing state. Tell other team members about the request.\nRequests can be edited by other team members only when they are in Composing state; they can't be edited\nafter they reach Submitted state. However, the preparer can click Withdraw, which changes the status to", page_no=158, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('27ac61e3-9f25-4089-a1df-0b8dc7c873c6'), chunk_index=690, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627293, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Composing and allows other team members to edit it.\n158\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nTeam Buying and Receiving', page_no=158, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('8be94f85-f55e-4266-bbce-ee6d1fb80a36'), chunk_index=691, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627376, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Results\nBefore submitting a request, if you no longer want to use team buying or receiving you can make it a regular\nrequest by removing the team (set one or both of the values above to No).\nAfter a request is sent to suppliers only the Turn on team receiving control remains available. You can turn off team', page_no=159, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('e6bd8e97-280f-4cdc-9ab4-dec3296fb33f'), chunk_index=692, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627380, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="receiving or change to a different team. The receiving team can be a different team than the buying team.\nTeam requests display in the Recent requests box if you’re the requester (team owner) or the preparer. They don't\ndisplay in that box if you’re a contributor or viewer.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nSome organizations display fields named Is Team Requisition and Is Team Received in requisitions. These", page_no=159, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('689af39d-83cb-46c9-a80d-a6d721948211'), chunk_index=693, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627384, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='fields display the team buying setting from SAP Ariba Procurement solutions, such as SAP Ariba Buying, not\nguided buying. To change team buying in guided buying, use the team buying and receiving control described\nabove.\nNext Steps\nBefore submission, team members with the Contributor role can edit the requisition by using the following steps:\n1.\nGo to the Your Requests page.\n2. Filter the results by Team requests.', page_no=159, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('fc94ef27-dabb-4da9-b5d2-55e921696784'), chunk_index=694, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627388, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='3. Click a request in Composing state.\n4. Click Edit at the top of the request.\n5. Change values in the request. To add additional items, click Continue shopping at the bottom of the request.\n6. Click Save and exit to allow other team members to edit it, or click Send request to submit it.', page_no=159, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('69709183-e354-43eb-8021-f049a75b55f7'), chunk_index=695, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627391, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='After submission, if the preparer or contributor copies or changes a team requisition (by clicking Buy again or\nChange request), the copy or changed requisition is also a team requisition.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nWhen using PunchOut suppliers, team contributors can’t re-punch-out to edit PunchOut items. The only team\nmember who can edit items on a PunchOut site or change a PunchOut shopping cart is the preparer of the\noriginal requisition.', page_no=159, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('7a6f83ba-1634-40cc-a263-91b869a239f0'), chunk_index=696, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627395, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Task overview: Team Buying and Receiving [page 145]\nRelated Information\nTurning on Manual Team Buying and Receiving [page 146]\nTurning on Automatic Team Buying [page 148]\nManaging Your Teams [page 149]\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nTeam Buying and Receiving\nPUBLIC\n159', page_no=159, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('f6cfa364-cbe0-4f06-98a9-38d199bfd1a3'), chunk_index=697, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627454, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Creating a Team RFQ [page 155]\nReceiving with a Team [page 160]\nReceiving with a Team\nTeam receiving allows you to collaborate with other users when receiving items.\nPrerequisites\nThe purchase order must come from a team requisition. A requisitions resulting from a team RFQ doesn't retain the\nteam receiving setting, but you can set it manually before submitting it.\nContext", page_no=160, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('31a24d9c-efa7-480f-8874-f603e3f908e9'), chunk_index=698, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627458, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="After a supplier provides ordered items, team members with the Contributor role can perform receiving. Their\nguided buying sessions don't have to have team buying turned on.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nYou must belong to the group named Receiving agent, Receiving Administrator, or Receiving manager to\nperform receiving.\nOnly the requester is notified that items are available to be received; contributors aren't notified.", page_no=160, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0c11b062-522c-40f8-b797-762c886934c3'), chunk_index=699, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627462, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Teams can't receive commodities that are configured for central receiving; instead, those items are received by\nmembers of the central receiving group. They display in the To receive tab in the Your Requests page, and the\nReceive button is grayed out unless you are a member of the central receiving group.\nProcedure\n1.\nClick Your Requests, then click the To receive tab.\n2. Find the purchase order by:\n•", page_no=160, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2dc2eb09-57d5-4a41-b4de-44738831ad2b'), chunk_index=700, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627466, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Filtering by date range, Order ID, Supplier ID, or Supplier name\n•\nSearching by order number\n3. Narrow the list of purchase orders displayed by filtering by Team items:\n160\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nTeam Buying and Receiving', page_no=160, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('915dd533-74f1-472d-ac4c-ab2fd273948e'), chunk_index=701, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627500, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='The team name displays for each purchase order.\n4. Enter the quantity accepted. To accept all items, click Receive All.\nYou can come back later and accept additional items.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nIf you previously accepted the wrong quantity or amount, you can enter a negative value in the Accepted\nfield to correct the mistake.\n5. Click Submit.\nResults', page_no=161, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a326b685-b158-4ff9-b40e-e7fb9a62957d'), chunk_index=702, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627504, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='After at least one of the items has been received, the change team receiving dialog box becomes read only.\nTask overview: Team Buying and Receiving [page 145]\nRelated Information\nTurning on Manual Team Buying and Receiving [page 146]\nTurning on Automatic Team Buying [page 148]\nManaging Your Teams [page 149]\nCreating a Team RFQ [page 155]\nBuying with a Team [page 157]\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases', page_no=161, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('0d6a55ca-8285-4d72-a217-633f1c15a75b'), chunk_index=703, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627507, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Team Buying and Receiving\nPUBLIC\n161', page_no=161, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a24369ce-aded-4c65-b9d7-d3d38909d25c'), chunk_index=704, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627575, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Working with Assets\nFrom the Asset Workbench, you can add asset information, such as asset type or asset numbers for each ordered\nitem, and create asset groups.\nAdding Asset Information on a Requisition [page 162]\nCreating Asset Groups [page 164]\nAdding Asset Information on a Requisition\nIf you're an asset manager, use this procedure to enter asset information for the asset line items on a requisition on\nthe Asset Workbench.", page_no=162, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ad885526-35c1-46df-9f34-71a9c8c4b2de'), chunk_index=705, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627579, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Prerequisites\n•\nYou must have membership of the Asset Manager group to be able to access the Asset Workbench and enter\nasset information to the asset items on a requisition.\n•\nIf you require to group together a main asset and one or more sub-assets to assign related asset values, you\nmust create an asset group in which you bundle those items as related items. For more information about', page_no=162, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('eb82bd92-6b14-4791-970e-cf216137638c'), chunk_index=706, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627582, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='creating groups, see Creating Asset Groups [page 164].\n•\nIf a line item on a requisition has multiple quantities, by default the buying solution assigns the same asset\nnumber to all units of that item. For example, if a line item on a requisition consists of 10 chairs, the buying', page_no=162, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d7ab4ccc-e872-45c7-b2d9-70351b6caf27'), chunk_index=707, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627586, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='solution assigns the same asset value to all 10 chairs. If you require each item to be tracked as a separate\nasset, you can choose to split a line into the required number of lines to ensure that the buying solution assigns\nunique asset values to each of those items.\nContext\nAfter you assign asset information to items on a requisition, asset records are created. The buying solution assigns', page_no=162, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('97ea73af-b036-4cbb-8099-89e18e0414ef'), chunk_index=708, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627590, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='asset values to the line items on the requisition based on the asset records.\nProcedure\n1.\nFrom the guided buying home page, open the Asset Workbench tab, as shown in the following figure.\n162\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nWorking with Assets', page_no=162, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('31fd1557-0ed6-49e3-ae95-e496e8c43392'), chunk_index=709, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627646, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='2. From the Asset Workbench page, choose Manage for the appropriate requisition, as shown in the following\nfigure.\n3. If required, choose Request View to display the details of the line items on the associated requisition.\n4. Perform one of the following actions:\na. Specify the asset class, asset line type, and description for each asset.', page_no=163, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d607b3be-36ad-4973-9ad0-251f1b262370'), chunk_index=710, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627651, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='b. To specify the same values for asset class and asset line type for multiple line items, click Mass Edit and\nspecify the appropriate values on the Mass Edit view. Select the appropriate line items to which the values\nmust be applied and click OK.\n5. If you need to assign unique asset values to each item with multiple quantities, perform the following steps to\nsplit the quantity:', page_no=163, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('296fe8d7-7b9e-4ef5-ba80-c1fcb5c1a1d5'), chunk_index=711, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627654, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='a. Choose the more options icon (\uea32\xa0) next to the item and choose Split.\nb. Enter a numeric value under the Lines column on the Split page to specify the number of independent\nlines you want to create.\nc. Choose Split.\nThe line is split into multiple lines based on the specified value.\nd. Choose Done to return to the previous page.', page_no=163, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b339551d-18b2-434c-a85d-6c477434fc1c'), chunk_index=712, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627658, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='6. If required, create asset groups. For more information about creating asset groups, see Creating Asset Groups\n[page 164].\n7.\nChoose Finish.\nThe buying solution sends a copy of the requisition to SAP ERP and adds asset values received from SAP ERP\nto the line items on the requisition.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nWorking with Assets\nPUBLIC\n163', page_no=163, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('70d27976-bcd3-4ca5-8858-69dc5f65792e'), chunk_index=713, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627704, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='8. Choose Done to return to the Asset Workbench page.\nResults\n•\nThe requisition moves to the In Progress tab on your dashboard in guided buying. During this stage, you\ncannot edit, withdraw, or deny the requisition. The requisition moves to the Completed tab after asset values\nassigned (asset class and asset line type) to line items are approved. Asset values are automatically assigned\nwhen line items are approved.', page_no=164, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('264c98f7-5887-4091-9bcc-5760557c197f'), chunk_index=714, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627708, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Related Information\nCreating Asset Groups [page 164]\nCreating Asset Groups\nUse this procedure to group items based on their asset line types before you approve a requisition in the Asset\nWorkbench.\nContext\nAn asset group must fulfill the following conditions:\n•\nAn asset group must include only one main asset and at least one sub-asset.\n•\nAll assets must have same asset class, company code, cost center, and accounting information.', page_no=164, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('46a6e01f-f077-41fa-96f9-f3d787bd3b23'), chunk_index=715, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627712, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Procedure\n1.\nFrom the guided buying home page, open the Asset Workbench tab.\nThe Asset Workbench displays.\n2. Choose Manage and complete the following fields:\nField name\nAction\nAsset Class\nChoose an appropriate asset class for the item.\n164\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nWorking with Assets', page_no=164, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('2160f78e-9eda-4c5d-992f-62245307bc31'), chunk_index=716, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627737, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Field name\nAction\nAsset Line Type\nAssign the item as a main asset or a sub-asset.\nAsset Description\nEnter a description for the asset.\n3. Choose Manage Asset Groups and then choose Create group.\nAn empty group is created.\n4. Choose Advanced Grouping and then select one main asset line item and the required items having asset line\ntypes as sub-asset.\n5. Choose Next and then choose Create.', page_no=165, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('1bea5061-df79-46b7-aa38-555696e5fc7c'), chunk_index=717, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627741, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='The items are added to the group.\n6. If you want to undo your changes, choose Revert.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nWorking with Assets\nPUBLIC\n165', page_no=165, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('1d96e078-91d3-4fb3-9213-6231d73fa127'), chunk_index=718, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627798, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Running Reports\nIf allowed by your organization, you can run reports to view detailed information about the requests that you've\ncreated. Depending on your organization's reporting policies, you might have access to view and run certain public\nor prepackaged reports.\nPrerequisites\nYour organization must configure the reporting option before you can access the reporting database.\nProcedure\n1.\nBrowse the categories in the customer catalog and find one related to reports.", page_no=166, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('bbfd5d0e-72bd-4d16-b930-dc58185cf6e5'), chunk_index=719, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627802, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='\ue04c\xa0Tip\nIf you can\'t find a category for reports, search for "report" to try to locate a reporting option.\n2. Choose a tile related to reports to get redirected to the reporting database in a new browser tab.\nIn the new browser tab, you\'ll see one of the following report folders: Personal Workspace, Public Reports, or\nPrepackaged Reports.\n3. In the report folder, do one of the following:\n•', page_no=166, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6022456a-d8d9-4229-ba1e-31f2c56c4dca'), chunk_index=720, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627806, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='To export the data for a report, click a report title and choose Export.\n•\nTo view the output for a report that was previously run, click a report title and choose View Stored Results.\n•\nTo specify a different date range or to update other report parameters, click a report title and choose Open.\n•\nTo view the available reports, expand one of the sub-folders.', page_no=166, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('b20c6ffd-10ea-4a6a-bbce-5ba1cc39d82a'), chunk_index=721, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627810, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="4. When you're finished running reports, close the browser tab for the reporting database and continue working in\nthe original tab.\n166\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nRunning Reports", page_no=166, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('97d9879f-c873-423a-849f-79c3781a8738'), chunk_index=722, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627859, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Getting Help through WalkMe\nThe WalkMe Digital Adoption Platform is optional in guided buying. If it is enabled, you can take advantage of\neasy-to-understand guidance.\nContext\nIf WalkMe is enabled, a question mark icon appears on the pages that are related to the processes for which\nWalkMe guided tours are available. The following procedure explains how you can use the tour.\nProcedure\n1.', page_no=167, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('ffc37c85-1d9c-4408-b246-87ef8d44293e'), chunk_index=723, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627863, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Click question mark \ue1c4\xa0 icon in the window banner.\nThe help panel appears.\nIf you have both WalkMe and SAP Companion enabled, the panel displays two tabs: Help displays WalkMe\ncontent and On-Screen Help displays SAP Companion content.\n2. Select the process for which you want assistance.\n3. An introductory text bubble appears, with a brief description of the process.\n4. Click Next.', page_no=167, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('8f9c97cf-9af3-46d4-be2b-991b6fb6c8dd'), chunk_index=724, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627867, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='5. Text bubbles with guiding text appear for the main steps of the process to assist you through the process.\nFor some UI elements, such as text fields, the bubble automatically moves to the next step as soon as you\nfinish entering the value. In other places, Next and Back navigation buttons are provided.', page_no=167, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('786b3268-e875-48b1-b125-b527ceea06d0'), chunk_index=725, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627871, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='6. The tour ends at the end of the process. WalkMe can also suggest the next process to follow.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nGetting Help through WalkMe\nPUBLIC\n167', page_no=167, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6ddfd35a-561d-42f2-80d6-a0aa80cd892c'), chunk_index=726, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627920, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Getting Help through SAP Companion\nGuided buying optionally provides online help using SAP Companion, powered by SAP Enable Now.\nPrerequisites\nIf you use the Apple Safari web browser, perform the following steps so that it can use the Single Sign-On\nauthentication required by SAP Companion:\n1.\nSelect\nSafari\nPreferences...\n.\n2. Go to Privacy.\n3. Deactivate the option\nWebsite tracking\nPrevent cross-site tracking\n.\nContext', page_no=168, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('8ac5addb-81a4-49ea-900d-005cc1ea0cd7'), chunk_index=727, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627923, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Your organization might use SAP Companion, which displays context-sensitive help within guided buying.\nSAP Ariba and your own procurement experts create online help content that explains how to use guided buying.\nThey might also provide access to learning center content, such as recommended tutorials for the current task.\nProcedure\n1.\nOn the upper-right corner of a guided buying page click the question mark icon (\ue1c4\xa0).', page_no=168, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('f1f720f4-730e-4c71-987c-1301a119f176'), chunk_index=728, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627927, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='The SAP Companion panel slides in from the right-hand side.\n2. Click controls in the SAP Companion panel or hover your pointer over hotspots on the guided buying page.\nFor the available SAP Companion functions, see SAP Companion Controls [page 169].\nSAP Companion Controls [page 169]\n168\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nGetting Help through SAP Companion', page_no=168, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('a5acaa21-57fb-42a3-b534-7dd42349781d'), chunk_index=729, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627951, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='SAP Companion Controls\nThe following table lists the available controls you can click in the SAP Companion panel to display help\ninformation.\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nYour organization might not use all controls.\nControl\nDisplays\nThe "What\'s this" topic\nA link\nA video\nPrerequisites\nAn FAQ\nA PDF document\nAn external website\nThe support page\nAnnouncements\nThe learning center\nA guided tour\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases', page_no=169, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('1c7ef0cd-481b-4aa6-b6dc-ce5d33af4e9a'), chunk_index=730, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 627955, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Getting Help through SAP Companion\nPUBLIC\n169', page_no=169, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('79911620-2a43-439b-a0b5-3cc9cdba7d15'), chunk_index=731, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 628041, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Getting Help through Help Community\nYour organization's help community gives you quick access to help when you have questions related to what you're\nbuying.\nContext\nBy having the help community right on the page when you're making a purchase, you can get assistance without\nhaving to leave the page or needing to call your internal help desk.", page_no=170, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('08d1c4e8-6b7c-45ad-b2c2-ae50afd8327e'), chunk_index=732, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 628045, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="In the help community, you can browse or search to find help content. You can also post comments on a help\ncontent item.\nIf your organization also allows users to post questions, you can also do the following:\n•\nView previously answered questions from your colleagues.\n•\nAsk an expert if you can't find an answer.\n•\nCollaborate with your colleagues by posting answers to their questions.", page_no=170, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('3228f666-214a-4f37-9c52-5e8da4725405'), chunk_index=733, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 628049, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="The purchasing experts in your organization curate the help content and questions to make sure you have access\nto the most relevant content for the task you're doing.\nGuided buying always expands the help community panel when your browser window width is 1350 pixels or wider.\nOn most computers, you can attain this width by zooming out the browser display to approximately 90%.\nProcedure\n1.", page_no=170, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('910db123-8dc3-4875-b1a0-f3789e4b0ed0'), chunk_index=734, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 628052, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Click Help or the question mark icon (\ue090\xa0).\n2. Perform one of the following actions:\nOption\nDescription\nBrowse content)\nalong the right\nside of the page\nto expand the\nhelp community\npanel.\nBelow the help community search box, you can browse the list of help content to see if there's some-\nthing that might answer your question or help to resolve your issue. Your organization manages this", page_no=170, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('c27477dd-16e0-40fe-b741-2c5bc2ef943f'), chunk_index=735, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 628056, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="content and aims to offer the most relevant help content on each page.\nTo access and read a content item, click the content item's title. If the content item is a video or a\ndocument such as a PDF, the content opens in a new window.\nAfter you access help content item in the panel, you can:\n•", page_no=170, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('9f588562-6650-40a8-a74e-aa7945fa8ded'), chunk_index=736, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 628060, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Click the next page arrow (\ue066\xa0) along the right side of the page to expand the help community) to\ncontinue reading additional pages of the content item.\n•\nClick the previous page arrow (\ue067\xa0) to return to the last page you read.\n170\nPUBLIC\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nGetting Help through Help Community', page_no=170, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('85eb404b-f820-4eee-9829-d29cc96f3ffc'), chunk_index=737, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 628129, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Option\nDescription\n•\nClick the thumbs up icon (\ue222\xa0) to like the article.\n•\nClick Comments (x) to view the comments on the article, where "x" represents the number of\ncomments. You can\'t take this action if there are no comments.\n•\nClick Add new comment to post a comment on the article.\n•\nClick the left arrow (\ue04d\xa0) to return to the previous view.\n•', page_no=171, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('67f7ee37-9a53-4f91-9989-c7e886bcb5d6'), chunk_index=738, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 628133, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Click the view content icon (\n), or click the content item title, to view the full content item in a new\nwindow.\nRun a search\nRun a search to find an answer to your question or issue. As you type, you begin to see suggested\nsearches to run. Click one of the suggested searches or enter your own search term.\n\ue05c\xa0Note', page_no=171, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('3f0f45ee-0651-4670-9785-25be7c62af4c'), chunk_index=739, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 628137, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='You can improve your search results by searching for only the most important words. For example,\nsearch for wireless headset instead of Does anyone have any recommendations\nfor a good wireless headset?. Search strings of three or fewer words tend to return\nbetter results than longer phrases or sentences.\nAsk an expert\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nYour organization might not make this option available to users.', page_no=171, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d15c3407-3bfd-4a72-ae5d-dafa7fbfa381'), chunk_index=740, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 628141, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='If you don\'t find the information you need when browsing or searching, click Ask Expert to get help from\na purchasing expert in your organization.\nFor example, imagine you need to buy a wireless headset, but you don\'t know how to purchase this item\nor which model to purchase. You search for "wireless headset" in the help community, but you don\'t get\nany results.', page_no=171, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('629cfd88-3791-4d3c-a21a-bc245a6f263a'), chunk_index=741, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 628145, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Figure 11: Example Search with No Results\nBecause you didn't get any search results, you decide to ask an expert in your organization by clicking\nAsk Expert at the bottom of the help community panel.\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nGetting Help through Help Community\nPUBLIC\n171", page_no=171, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('7e31efb1-5f7e-40f7-8c92-ec5f924edbac'), chunk_index=742, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 628191, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="Option\nDescription\nFigure 12: Ask an Expert\nNext, you enter your specific question in the box, and then click Post Question.\nFigure 13: Post a Question\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nKeep in mind that the questions you ask are visible to other employees in your organization.\nAfter you post your question, an expert or a colleague will respond. Note that you aren't notified (either", page_no=172, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('8e72ca54-5e5e-4c7d-8dfe-79c6c72147c1'), chunk_index=743, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 628196, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='through email or the user interface) when your questions is answered.\n\ue04c\xa0Tip\nIf your question deals with confidential information, contact your internal help desk instead of\nposting a question that other users can see.\nHelp a colleague\nby answering a\nquestion\n\ue05c\xa0Note\nYour organization might not make this option available to users.', page_no=172, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('d60a28be-70e9-4d63-bb06-48db8b39b67d'), chunk_index=744, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 628200, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="If you see a question from a colleague that hasn't been answered, you can open the question and click\nAdd new answer to provide an answer.\nView the help\ncommunity in a\nseparate win-\ndow\nIf you'd prefer to read help content, run a search, or ask a question in a separate window, click View\nmore or\nat the bottom of the help community panel.\n172\nPUBLIC", page_no=172, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('01ef9525-c3ee-42cd-8518-0996cfd0fdc8'), chunk_index=745, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 628203, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Guided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nGetting Help through Help Community', page_no=172, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('66241b3f-66ec-41d6-b4b3-02ef794257f5'), chunk_index=746, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 628211, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='3. After you find your answer or post your question, collapse the help community panel by clicking Help Center or\nthe right arrow icon (\ue066\xa0).\nGuided Buying: Finding Items and Making Purchases\nGetting Help through Help Community\nPUBLIC\n173', page_no=173, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('24eabf5a-91ea-4cbd-9486-f412ad9052e0'), chunk_index=747, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 628321, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='Important Disclaimers and Legal Information\nHyperlinks\nSome links are classified by an icon and/or a mouseover text. These links provide additional information.\nAbout the icons:\n•\nLinks with the icon\n: You are entering a Web site that is not hosted by SAP. By using such links, you agree (unless expressly stated otherwise in your agreements\nwith SAP) to this:\n•', page_no=174, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('02103f8f-c339-4d4e-8c21-fb0c90bd1773'), chunk_index=748, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 628326, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='The content of the linked-to site is not SAP documentation. You may not infer any product claims against SAP based on this information.\n•\nSAP does not agree or disagree with the content on the linked-to site, nor does SAP warrant the availability and correctness. SAP shall not be liable for any', page_no=174, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('204ef8a8-2567-4ef7-86d4-3662c9d4c56b'), chunk_index=749, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 628329, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="damages caused by the use of such content unless damages have been caused by SAP's gross negligence or willful misconduct.\n•\nLinks with the icon\n: You are leaving the documentation for that particular SAP product or service and are entering an SAP-hosted Web site. By using such links,", page_no=174, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('bd24e711-7385-462e-b103-63377f4bcd14'), chunk_index=750, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 628333, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='you agree that (unless expressly stated otherwise in your agreements with SAP) you may not infer any product claims against SAP based on this information.\nVideos Hosted on External Platforms\nSome videos may point to third-party video hosting platforms. SAP cannot guarantee the future availability of videos stored on these platforms. Furthermore, any', page_no=174, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('6b4612be-1f64-4cd7-804f-2a8922bcd567'), chunk_index=751, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 628337, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='advertisements or other content hosted on these platforms (for example, suggested videos or by navigating to other videos hosted on the same site), are not within the\ncontrol or responsibility of SAP.\nBeta and Other Experimental Features\nExperimental features are not part of the officially delivered scope that SAP guarantees for future releases. This means that experimental features may be changed by', page_no=174, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('667ee901-030e-4c41-ab55-5a068349bfe4'), chunk_index=752, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 628341, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='SAP at any time for any reason without notice. Experimental features are not for productive use. You may not demonstrate, test, examine, evaluate or otherwise use the\nexperimental features in a live operating environment or with data that has not been sufficiently backed up.\nThe purpose of experimental features is to get feedback early on, allowing customers and partners to influence the future product accordingly. By providing your feedback', page_no=174, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('4bcaf57c-4025-40bc-9e10-e1ed902d0d31'), chunk_index=753, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 628344, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text='(e.g. in the SAP Community), you accept that intellectual property rights of the contributions or derivative works shall remain the exclusive property of SAP.\nExample Code\nAny software coding and/or code snippets are examples. They are not for productive use. The example code is only intended to better explain and visualize the syntax and', page_no=174, section=None, title=None), DocumentChunk(chunk_id=UUID('60207adb-0fe8-4000-b06b-65b81d0e1550'), chunk_index=754, chunking_version=1, document_id=UUID('d7524966-da8d-45fa-848b-76d5c4c6aaeb'), document_group_id=UUID('393ced59-cd60-4f63-9bba-6a55d8f73f81'), is_active=True, created_at=datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 27, 18, 33, 43, 628348, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), text="phrasing rules. SAP does not warrant the correctness and completeness of the example code. SAP shall not be liable for errors or damages caused by the use of example\ncode unless damages have been caused by SAP's gross negligence or willful misconduct.\nBias-Free Language\nSAP supports a culture of diversity and inclusion. Whenever possible, we use unbiased language in our documentation to refer to people of all cultures, ethnicities, gend